window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3401,"title":"Chapter 3401 Smart Feng Wu","paragraphs":["3401 Smart Feng Wu","Master Duanmu wanted to throttle Feng Wu, but how could he? The crown prince was there.","The crown prince waved his hand, and Master Duanmu stumbled backward.","Elder Wu and Elder Yin caught Master Duanmu together, but the crown prince was so powerful that even the two elders were injured.","Pffft!","Elder Yin felt the blood in his chest and his meridians surge. He almost vomited blood!","Elder Wu was slightly weaker than Elder Yin, so he couldn’t control himself and spat out a mouthful of blood on the spot.","The crown prince was still sitting in his high seat, and Feng Wu stood there with her hands behind her back, looking down at Master Duanmu with confidence on her face.","Master Duanmu felt as if a bucket of cold water had been poured over his head when he met the girl’s clear and confident eyes. A chill ran down his spine.","Feng Wu glanced at Master Duanmu. “Why are you so anxious?”","Master Duanmu stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “I’m curious. Master Duanmu, why are you so flustered? Didn’t you study the design draft for years? So what if I tear the drawings up? You can just draw them again.”","Feng Wu had countless ways to prove Master Duanmu had stolen the drawings. For example, she could say there was a special spice in the paper, and anyone who came into contact with it would behave in a certain way, but she couldn’t be bothered.","She wanted everyone to see that Master Duanmu couldn’t draw it from memory.","If Master Wang couldn’t transcribe the blueprints, neither could Master Duanmu.","Feng Wu’s confidence stemmed from the fact that the drawings Master Duanmu gave Jun Linyuan were her work, and Master Duanmu didn’t transcribe them himself. Therefore, he would never be able to draw them on his own.","Only by completely understanding every inscription and formation on it could one transcribe it. Master Duanmu was far from being able to do that.","As expected, Master Duanmu was rendered speechless by Feng Wu’s words. He gritted his teeth and glared at Feng Wu, but couldn’t say a word.","Feng Wu grinned at him.","“Am I wrong?” Feng Wu smiled. “Master Duanmu, didn’t you say you’ve been working on the inscriptions and formations for so many years? Why can’t you draw them again?”","Master Duanmu glared at Feng Wu.","Master Wang almost laughed out loud.","How clever!","That was so clever!","Why didn’t he think of this method? If he couldn’t transcribe the blueprints himself, Duanmu definitely couldn’t either.","The only person who could redraw the design was Feng Wu, the original owner.","Everyone else looked at Master Duanmu suspiciously.","Previously, they firmly believed that the design of the fighter jet was really drawn by Master Duanmu. After all, everyone knew Master Duanmu’s attainments in inscriptions.","Therefore, Elder Wu turned around and stared at Master Duanmu, signaling him to retort to Feng Wu.","What was there to be afraid of? Just draw it!","The others also hinted to Master Duanmu with their eyes, “Draw it. Why don’t you say you’re going to draw it?","“What’s so difficult about that?”","Master Duanmu felt bitter.","How was he supposed to draw it?","He had indeed seen the blueprints, but there were a few particularly difficult inscriptions that he had yet to master. How could he draw them?","However, he believed he was currently the strongest inscription master in the entire Nest Fortress, so no matter what he drew, no one would dare to say he made a mistake.","At that thought..."]},{"number":3402,"title":"Chapter 3402 I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (1)","paragraphs":["3402 I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (1)","At this thought, Master Duanmu sneered. “Who said I don’t know how to draw them?!”","As soon as he said that, Master Duanmu regained his confidence. He straightened his back and sneered. “I drew these blueprints one by one. Even if you tear them up, I’ll draw them again!","“You!” Master Duanmu pointed at Feng Wu with a grim look in his eyes. “The design of a fighter jet is so precious that it’s a national treasure. How can you break a national treasure?!”","At that, Master Duanmu looked at Jun Linyuan solemnly.","“Your Royal Highness, no one can predict what this evil woman will do in the future if she dares to destroy the blueprints now!","“I even suspect she’s a spy sent by the Dongsang Kingdom!”","...","Elder Dongfang had expected Master Duanmu to attack Feng Wu, but she hadn’t expected Master Duanmu to be so stupid as to accuse Feng Wu of being a spy from the Dongsang Kingdom.","Anyone in the Junwu Empire could be a spy, but not Feng Wu!","She had single-handedly turned the situation around. Sun Castle had suffered heavy losses. General Xue must be fuming right now.","Hence, Elder Dongfang quickly stood up and berated Master Duanmu. “Shut up!”","Master Duanmu believed his status wasn’t inferior to Elder Dongfang’s, so he didn’t want to shut up. He wanted to continue talking.","Elder Dongfang flew into a rage. “There are so many people here. Anyone could be a spy sent by the Dongsang Kingdom, but not Feng Wu! Both the crown prince and the marshal know that!”","When Master Duanmu saw how angry Elder Dongfang was, he didn’t continue.","Feng Wu stared at Master Duanmu. “Didn’t you say it was easy to draw? Go ahead.”","Master Duanmu said, “Who do you think you are? Do you think I’ll draw just because you want me to?”","Crossing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu smiled. “Master Duanmu, don’t you want me to stay away from the crown prince? As long as you can draw the original blueprints, I’ll do as you wish. Deal?”","The look on the crown prince’s face...","Elder Dongfang stole a glance, and her stomach lurched.","Master Duanmu sneered. “Alright!”","Elder Dongfang looked at Master Duanmu with pity.","She had already done what she could, but Master Duanmu insisted on going down that path, so what could she do?","Master Duanmu waved his hand.","“Give me some paper, a writing brush, and some ink!”","Soon, a short table and prayer mat were placed in front of Master Duanmu. He then sat down.","Immediately after, the brush, ink, paper and inkstone were all set out.","The brush was made from top-grade fox hair.","The ink was the best pine smoke and musk ink.","The paper was snow paper refined dozens of times over.","The inkstone had a fine and smooth surface.","...","Standing next to him, Feng Wu took the brush with one hand, held her sleeve out of the way, and dipped the brush in the ink. She then handed the ink brush to Master Duanmu and smiled at him. “Please.”","Master Duanmu sneered, grabbed the brush, and began to draw.","At first, he drew very quickly since it wasn’t difficult.","One page, two pages, three pages...","Master Duanmu seemed relaxed, and so were the people around him.","Elder Wu said to Elder Yin, “Look at how fast Master Duanmu is drawing. It’s obvious that Miss Feng Wu is making things up. She’s slandering him.”","After Feng Wu stared at him, Elder Yin didn’t dare oppose Feng Wu openly. However, he lowered his voice and nodded. “That’s right. I’ve always believed in Master Duanmu.”"]},{"number":3403,"title":"Chapter 3403 I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (2)","paragraphs":["3403 I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (2)","On the other side, Master Wang frowned deeply. Could Duanmu really draw it? That was impossible!","Master Wang frowned and stared at Master Duanmu, afraid that the latter would really succeed.","Feng Wu, on the other hand, remained calm the entire time.","Master Duanmu indeed drew very fast at first.","It wasn’t until the seventh page that he began to slow down.","This was because he didn’t quite understand the inscriptions that followed.","When he got to the eighth page, he felt troubled.","Instinctively, he looked up at Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince, who was sitting high up in his seat, had a grim look on his face and a cold look in his eyes. Master Duanmu wondered who had upset the crown prince so much.","Master Duanmu scratched his head guiltily and somehow felt it could be him.","However... no one present knew inscriptions better than he did. He could draw whatever he wanted.","Hence, from the eighth page onward, Master Duanmu began to draw something different from Feng Wu’s original draft.","When it came to the ninth page, he almost couldn’t keep making things up anymore.","However, he braced himself and drew all the way to the fifteenth page.","After finishing all the drawings, Master Duanmu was covered in sweat. The blueprints weren’t that easy to fake.","Master Duanmu put down his brush, blew dry the ink, and handed over the blueprints with both hands.","“Your Royal Highness, these are the blueprints for the fighter jet.”","Master Duanmu said seriously, “The fifteen pages contain my hard work from over a decade. Please take a look, Your Royal Highness.”","Jun Linyuan stared at him with a brooding look in his eyes. No one knew what the crown prince was thinking.","Feeling guilty, Master Duanmu lowered his head and stole a glance at Jun Linyuan.","With just that one look, Master Duanmu felt as if his heart had been stabbed!"]},{"number":3404,"title":"Chapter 3404: I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3404: I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan smirked. “Master Duanmu, how am I supposed to punish you for trying to fool me like this?","“Should I cut you into pieces?”","Jun Linyuan’s voice was light, and the corners of his lips curled up, but the bloodlust in his voice almost scared Master Duanmu out of his wits.","Master Duanmu’s legs went weak.","However, Master Duanmu lived up to his name. Anyone else would have dropped to their knees at Jun Linyuan’s words, but Master Duanmu was still standing.","He took a deep breath and told himself to calm down. He was the best inscription master in Nest, and the crown prince wouldn’t do anything to him!","After making up his mind, Master Duanmu finally summoned the courage to look up at Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness, what do you mean?”","“What do I mean?” Leaning forward, Jun Linyuan rested one hand on the table and stared at Master Duanmu with a smile. “You won’t admit to your crimes, Master Duanmu. How dare you try to fool me with these things?!”","Jun Linyuan smashed the pile of paper into Master Duanmu’s face!","Master Duanmu fell to the ground.","The temperature seemed to plummet.","Everyone stared at the crown prince in horror.","Was the crown prince... going to lose his temper?","Could there really be a problem with Master Duanmu’s designs? But that wasn’t right. Master Duanmu looked very confident, and he had drawn everything on the spot.","Elder Wu and Elder Yin looked at each other and wondered if they should stand up for Master Duanmu.","But in the end, they didn’t.","If it had been Emperor Wu, they would have stood up for Duanmu, because no matter how angry Emperor Wu was, he wouldn’t kill anyone. He cared about his reputation.","But Jun Linyuan was different. He could kill someone when he was angry.","No matter how important a person was, if they offended the crown prince... Master Duanmu’s heart trembled, and he gritted his teeth. Seeing that no one was speaking up for him, he finally mustered his courage. “Your Royal Highness, you’re slandering me for a little maid. That’s just...”","“Just what?” Jun Linyuan snorted.","Master Duanmu said, “It’s just too cruel!”","“Cruel?” Jun Linyuan smirked. He was going to show Master Duanmu what cruelty was.","However, before Jun Linyuan could do anything, Feng Wu stepped forward. She looked at Master Duanmu with pity. “Master Duanmu, at this point, shouldn’t you stop slandering people? You may get away with slandering others, but how dare you slander Jun Linyuan? You’re such a piece of work.” Master Duanmu said, “You’re echoing each other and colluding to frame me. I want to go to the capital to lodge a complaint. His Majesty will help me!” Either because of Feng Wu or Master Duanmu’s accusation, the crown prince finally calmed down. Leaning back in his chair, he kept his gaze on Feng Wu. Feng Wu looked at Master Duanmu in resignation. “When this is over, if you still have the courage, go to the capital and sue us. No one will stop you. Let’s get back to business.”","Feng Wu picked up the papers that Master Duanmu had drawn. “You’re right with the first six pages, but at your level of inscriptions, you can only reach that far.","“You’ve been making mistakes since page seven.”","Feng Wu took out a red pen and began to draw circles on the designs.."]},{"number":3405,"title":"Chapter 3405: I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3405: I’ll Leave Jun Linyuan (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was just like how Feng Wu’s calligraphy teacher in her previous life would draw circles on her work.","“What’s she doing?” Elder Wu looked at Feng Wu in shock.","No one said anything because they couldn’t understand what Feng Wu was doing with a pen.","Only Master Wang, who knew Feng Wu’s inscription skills, could tell what was going on.","He pointed at Feng Wu, who kept drawing circles with a red pen, and said in shock, “She... She’s not marking the incorrect inscriptions, is she?”","Marking the inscriptions?","That didn’t sound convincing at all.","Elder Wu glared at Master Wang. “Nonsense! What do you mean by that? If Feng Wu can correct Master Duanmu’s inscriptions, doesn’t that mean she’s better at it than Master Duanmu?”","Master Wang nodded matter-of-factly. “Feng Wu is indeed better at inscriptions than Duanmu!”","Elder Wu sneered and couldn’t be bothered to speak to Master Wang.","Elder Qing and Aunt Qing didn’t believe it either...","Only a few people believed that Feng Wu was better at inscriptions than Master Duanmu.","Master Duanmu smirked as he watched Feng Wu work.","Even if she started learning inscriptions before she was born, it was impossible for her to reach Master Duanmu’s level. So, why did she have to pretend to be an expert? If she wanted to humiliate herself, so be it.","Master Duanmu was about to mock Feng Wu, when Feng Wu smacked the corrected page seven in Master Duanmu’s face.","Then, without saying a word, she continued to mark the eighth page.","Master Duanmu had to take it when Jun Linyuan threw the drawings in his face, but he couldn’t stand it when a maid did the same thing.","Master Duanmu was about to scold her, when Feng Wu said coldly without looking up, “Take a look at your mistakes.”","What a cold and aloof statement.","She sounded like a senior lecturing a junior.","Elder Wu and the others were furious.","Why was the girl so arrogant?","Master Duanmu was a Level 9 inscription master, the best in Nest Fortress!","However, when the number one inscription master of Nest looked down at the design on the seventh page, he frowned when he saw the errors that Feng Wu had circled.","They were all the places that he wasn’t sure of.","He wondered if she could really be better than him.","He then burst out laughing. Who was he kidding? She was just a young maid. But the errors...","“It must be a coincidence,” thought Master Duanmu.","“Maybe she saw the drawings earlier and remembered the inscriptions...”","Just as Master Duanmu was desperately trying to convince himself, the eighth page smashed into his face.","Master Duanmu grabbed the paper and looked at it. With just one look, he frowned!","Feng Wu had circled thirteen places on this page.","Coincidentally, he had made up all those thirteen spots because he didn’t know","what the original inscriptions were.","None of the inscriptions he was confident in were circled.","Well...","Could that still be a coincidence?","Master Duanmu was more than a little worried.","Page 9, page 10, page 11...","Towards the end, more and more circles appeared on the pages. On the 15th page, the entire paper was filled with red circles.","After the marking, Feng Wu smiled at Master Duanmu. “Master Duanmu, what do you think these red circles are?”","Master Duanmu’s face flushed!","He really didn’t want to admit it.."]},{"number":3406,"title":"Chapter 3406: What Is There to Say?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3406: What Is There to Say?","How could Master Duanmu not know what these circles meant?","These inscriptions circled in red were the ones he had made up. They were all wrong inscriptions!","He had thought Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to tell, and neither would the crown prince. After all, he was the best at inscriptions, but to his surprise, Feng Wu didn’t miss a single mistake.","She had found all of them.","Was she even human?","However, Master Duanmu still wouldn’t admit it.","If he did, the others would know he had been lying.","Master Duanmu gritted his teeth and sneered. “Who knows what those circles are?”","Feng Wu was amused by Master Duanmu’s words. “Aren’t you going to admit it?”","Master Duanmu pretended to be calm. “Admit what?”","Feng Wu said, “It seems you won’t be convinced until I show you the real evidence.”","After that, Feng Wu took out a pile of paper from her pocket.","Master Duanmu’s eyes widened when he saw the stack of paper in Feng Wu’s hands.","That was because he recognized it at once. It was the designs that Feng Wu had torn up earlier. They were the drawings that he had stolen from Master Wang! Staring at Feng Wu, Master Duanmu rushed forward to take back the drawings. Feng Wu turned around and hid behind Jun Linyuan. Master Duanmu couldn’t reach her.","Master Duanmu was extremely anxious. “Return the blueprints to me!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Return them? Are they yours? Why should I give them to you?”","Master Duanmu’s face was livid.","Feng Wu waved at Master Wang. “Master Wang, take a look at these designs.”","Master Wang’s eyes lit up when he saw the drawings in Feng Wu’s hand. “That’s it! That’s it!”","Master Wang was pleasantly surprised. “Miss Feng Wu, so you didn’t tear the drawings up?”","Feng Wu smiled. “Of course. I’m not stupid. Why would I tear them up? They’re evidence.”","No one here was stupid. At this point, they all saw what was going on.","Feng Wu had set a trap for Master Duanmu from the beginning. She pretended to tear up the drawings, but in fact, she had torn up something else. However, she had given Master Duanmu the impression that the designs were gone.","Because of that, Master Duanmu made things up when he clearly didn’t know what he was doing.","Of course, this was what most people thought. The people from the Military Academy, led by Elder Wu, were still putting up a final struggle.","Frowning, Elder Wu stepped forward and said, “Miss Feng Wu, aren’t you taking it for granted? How can Master Duanmu be such a person? Do you know what a crime it is to slander a Level 9 inscription master?!”","Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to argue with him. She said directly, “Master Wang, Elder Wu, please check these two drafts. Master Duanmu said he drew both of them. I’d like to see if you can say that again after reading them.”","Two blueprints were placed in front of Master Wang and Master Wu. After Master Wang flipped through them, he smiled bitterly and shook his head. He stood at the side and waited for Elder Wu to finish reading.","Elder Wu looked at the second blueprint and frowned. When he flipped through all the pages, he understood what happened better than anyone else.","The two blueprints were drawn by the same person?","He had to be blind and stupid to reach that conclusion!"]},{"number":3407,"title":"Chapter 3407: I Can Make Fighter Jets","paragraphs":["Chapter 3407: I Can Make Fighter Jets","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Wang looked at him with a smile. “What do you think, Elder Wu?”","Elder Wu frowned and gritted his teeth, but he didn’t say anything.","Master Wang smiled and urged, “Elder Wu, say something. Be honest and tell me, were these two designs drawn by Master Duanmu?”","Master Wang asked again when Elder Wu remained silent.","Elder Wu still didn’t say anything, so Master Wang asked again.","Elder Wu had never known that Master Wang, who had always been silent and only cared about inscriptions, could be so aggressive.","He knew that even if he didn’t answer Master Wang, he would have to answer Feng Wu and the crown prince.","Elder Wu turned around and gave Master Duanmu a meaningful look.","At this moment, Master Duanmu had already fallen to the ground after seeing the evidence.","Elder Wu heaved a long sigh and finally said, “This second design draft was indeed done by Master Duanmu. He drew it in front of all of us, so it can’t have been faked.","“As for the first one... this first design draft...” Elder Wu pondered for a long time and finally said, “It’s very different from the second one.”","Elder Wu wasn’t the only one Feng Wu showed the drawings to. She let everyone present see them.","Master Duanmu knew he was facing a hopeless situation.","Was he going to admit his defeat?","No!","Master Duanmu was a tenacious person. How could he allow himself to lose to a little maid?!","“I can make a fighter jet right now!” Master Duanmu stepped forward and stared at Jun Linyuan solemnly. He enunciated each word clearly. “Crown prince, I can make a fighter jet right now!”","WHAT?!","When Master Duanmu said this, everyone looked at him in shock!","Elder Wu was even more excited. “Master Duanmu, is that true? You can create a fighter jet now? A fighter jet that can fly in the sky?!”","Master Duanmu said with a serious expression, “Yes, a fighter jet that can fly in the sky!”","Elder Wu was overjoyed.","The process didn’t matter. The most important thing was the outcome.","If Master Duanmu could build a fighter jet now, who would care about the original blueprint?","Master Duanmu was obviously thinking the same thing. He said to Jun Linyuan, “Your Royal Highness, please give me four hours. I’ll assemble our first fighter jet right away!”","Jun Linyuan gave Master Duanmu a strange look and said bluntly, “You can’t even draw the blueprint, let alone build a fighter jet.”","Master Duanmu’s face turned red.","His disciple, Ji Ying, quickly stepped forward. “Your Royal Highness, my master is telling the truth. He’s lacking in the design aspect, but he’s always been better when it comes to real action. Your Royal Highness, please give Master a chance. ”","Ji Ying and Master Duanmu were bound together, so he had no choice but to plead for Master Duanmu.","Elder Wu and Elder Yin naturally didn’t want Master Duanmu to lose, because it meant that the Military Academy had lost. Therefore, they all stood up and asked Jun Linyuan to give Master Duanmu a chance.","Elder Wu said, “Your Royal Highness, fighter jets are a national treasure. If the Junwu Empire had its own flying fighter jets, it would be a glorious thing.. We wouldn’t have to be afraid of the Dongsang Kingdom! We can’t let go of any chance, even the slightest possibility!”"]},{"number":3408,"title":"Chapter 3408: I’ll Show You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3408: I’ll Show You","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Elder Wu knelt on the ground and kowtowed.","He banged his head hard on the ground. Soon, his forehead was bleeding, and blood splattered everywhere. The stone slab in front of him was covered in blood.","Wasn’t this too exaggerated?!","However, Feng Wu knew Elder Wu was trying his best to protect the Military Academy.","He was on the same side as Master Duanmu. If Master Duanmu lost miserably, that meant Elder Wu would also fail. Therefore, he had to protect Master Duanmu with all his might.","Feng Wu shook her head. It seemed that Elder Wu still wouldn’t give up.","“Alright, then. Master Duanmu, please make the first self-developed fighter jet in the Junwu Empire.” Feng Wu put her hands behind her back and smiled.","At that moment, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi found their way in. However, in order not to disturb anyone, they stayed at the back of Master Wang’s team.","Apart from Ji Ying, Master Duanmu also had other disciples and servants.","Ji Ying quickly ran back and returned with the set of things from their studio.","There were many components in a fighter jet. The other components were easy to make, but the inscription propeller was the most difficult part. It was a problem that the Junwu Empire had never been able to solve.","When Master Duanmu saw the exquisitely wrapped wooden box, he looked ecstatic.","The inscription propeller!","This was the inscription propeller that could turn things around in the end!","Master Duanmu gave Feng Wu a smug look, but Feng Wu only smiled at him.","Elder Yin lowered his head involuntarily, not daring to look Feng Wu in the eye.","He had a feeling that Feng Wu already knew something.","However, he would never admit it! Elder Yin secretly made up his mind.","Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t look at him, Master Duanmu thought she was scared. He became even more pleased with himself.","“Your Royal Highness, this is the inscription propeller that I developed.” Master Duanmu opened the wooden box that was half the height of a man and revealed an entire inscription propeller.","Because the Dongsang Kingdom’s inscription propellers had a self-destruct program, even if the Junwu Empire managed to get one, it was very difficult for everyone to see a usable inscription propeller.","Staring at Master Duanmu, Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","Master Duanmu knew the crown prince had always been aloof, so he said, “As long as the problem with the inscription propeller is solved, all other problems will be solved.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Is that so? Master Duanmu, are you saying you’ve solved the problem of the inscription propeller?”","Ji Ying glared at Feng Wu. “Didn’t my master tell you he was the one who made the inscription propeller?”","Feng Wu didn’t even look at Ji Ying. She only looked into Master Duanmu’s eyes. “Is what your disciple said true? Is this really an inscription propeller you made yourself, Master Duanmu?”","Master Duanmu wanted to change the subject, but Feng Wu wouldn’t let go of it, which frustrated him.","In any case, there was only one inscription propeller. Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to find another one that looks exactly the same.","At that thought, Master Duanmu nodded.","He darted an arrogant look at Feng Wu. “What? Miss Feng Wu doesn’t believe","Feng Wu couldn’t help but laugh. “This is an inscription propeller taken from a fighter jet of the Dongsang Kingdom, and Master Duanmu said that he made it himself.. Since when did Master Duanmu become so close to the Dongsang Kingdom?”"]},{"number":3409,"title":"Chapter 3409: Test Flight","paragraphs":["Chapter 3409: Test Flight","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Duanmu was stumped by Feng Wu’s words.","Why was this girl so annoying? Would it kill her to shut up?","Master Duanmu threw a dirtv look at Feng Wu. “I made this mvself. How can it be from a fighter jet from the Dongsang Kingdom? Young lady, envy won’t help you. The most important thing is to study. You’re still so young, and you’re already resorting to such unorthodox methods. What are you going to do in the future?”","After giving Feng Wu a contemptuous look, Master Duanmu said to Jun Linyuan, “Your Royal Highness, I drew the inscriptions on the propeller with my penknife. They’re sacred and can’t be demeaned.”","In other words, he was asking Jun Linyuan to discipline his maid.","Feng Wu smiled. “But why do the inscriptions on the propeller look so similar to the ones from Dongsang?”","Master Duanmu scolded angrily, “Have you seen a Dongsang inscription propeller? Don’t spout nonsense!”","Feng Wu said, “I have.”","Master Duanmu said, “Just because you said so? Show me the evidence.”","Feng Wu said, “I do have evidence.”","Master Duanmu was about to say something else, when Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “The inscription propeller really came from the Dongsang Kingdom? Master Duanmu, are you sure you’re not colluding with the","Dongsang Kingdom?”","Master Duanmu said, “I swear this inscription propeller doesn’t look like the Dongsang Kingdom’s at all. It has nothing to do with them! Do you dare to make the same oath?!”","Master Duanmu was really irritated by Feng Wu’s aggressiveness.","Feng Wu remained calm in the face of Master Duanmu’s irascible temper. She grinned. “Master Duanmu, don’t get so worked up. If it’s yours, it’s yours. If it’s not, it’s not. What’s the rush?”","Master Duanmu snorted.","He would attack Feng Wu when he was done assembling the fighter jet and flew it into the sky. If he didn’t kill the girl then, he wouldn’t call himself Duanmu anymore!","Master Duanmu hated Feng Wu to the core.","He started assembling with a serious expression.","Soon, the fighter jet was assembled.","From the outside, this was a complete fighter jet, no different from the ones in the Dongsang Kingdom.","Everyone looked at Master Duanmu with complicated expressions.","Could Master Duanmu really create the first fighter jet?","If he really succeeded, he would be remembered forever!","Why was Master Duanmu so confident? It was because he had assembled the fighter jet before and had really flown it.","However, he had been hiding this matter because he had yet to understand the inscription propeller and couldn’t replicate a second one.","But now that it was a matter of life and death, he couldn’t care less.","After assembling it, Master Duanmu took a few steps back and said to everyone, “We can only fly outside. This place is too narrow.”","Everyone looked at the crown prince, waiting for his decision.","Jun Linyuan, however, kept his eyes on Feng Wu. He had been a bystander the entire time.","Feng Wu smiled. “Let’s go outside and see if it can fly.”","“If?” Master Duanmu sneered in his head. “You’ll be so scared.”","Master Duanmu wanted to humiliate Feng Wu, so he led the way.","After arriving at the open space outside, he told Ji Ying, “Get in there.”","Master Duanmu wasn’t the pilot. Ji Ying was.","In fact, it was Ji Ying who flew the jet last time.","The master and disciple had secretly tested it in a remote valley in the West Mountain. Everything had been perfect."]},{"number":3410,"title":"Chapter 3410: Are You Making Fun of Me? (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3410: Are You Making Fun of Me? (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The master and disciple looked at each other. Ji Ying took a deep breath and said to Master Duanmu, “Master, please leave everything to me. I won’t disappoint you!”","With that, Ji Ying sat in the flight cabin.","With a bang, the fighter jet’s door closed.","Everything was ready, and it was time to take off.","Everyone’s attention was on Ji Ying.","If Ji Ying could take off, it would be an iconic victory for the entire Junwu Empire!","There was still blood on Elder Wu’s head. He glanced at Master Duanmu angrily. “You actually hid this from us. Why didn’t you say anything earlier?”","Master Duanmu looked at the blood on Elder Wu’s forehead and felt a little guilty. “I really didn’t dare to reveal it earlier because I haven’t developed a method to mass-produce inscription propellers. Elder Wu, please forgive me.”","Elder Wu snorted.","However, he was still proud of the achievement.","If Master Duanmu succeeded, then the Military Academy would be superior to Imperial College. From then on, Imperial College wouldn’t dare to complain anymore and would stay in second place forever!","“Are you sure about this?” Elder Wu lowered his voice and asked Master","Duanmu.","Master Duanmu was unprecedentedly confident. “Of course! Ji Ying and I experimented before!”","Elder Wu was even more delighted. He stroked his beard and nodded with a smile. “That’s good. That’s good.”","Meanwhile, Feng Xun snuck up behind Feng Wu and patted her on the back.","“Xiao Wu.”","Feng Wu turned around and was surprised to see Feng Xun and Xuan Yi. “What are you doing here? When did you arrive?”","Feng Xun said, “We’ve been here for a while and heard what Master Duanmu said. ”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Feng Xun frowned. “I don’t understand. How can you let them test their fighter jet?”","Feng Wu was confused. “Why not?”","Feng Xun said, “I think I know what’s going on. The inscription propeller in Master Duanmu’s hand is from the fighter jet that Mu Yan gave you before, right?”","Feng Wu smiled mysteriously.","Feng Xun said, “Don’t laugh. Tell me now.”","Feng Wu said, “Maybe?”","Feng Xun rolled his eyes at Feng Wu. “What do you mean ‘maybe’? I know I’m right. I just don’t understand. How can you let him do a flight test? What if they can fly it?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “They can’t.”","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in confusion. “How can you be so sure?”","Crossing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu smiled confidently. “I just am.”","Feng Xun wanted to ask Feng Wu more questions, but he couldn’t get anything out of her.","Meanwhile, everyone was looking at Ji Ying in confusion.","Wasn’t the fighter jet supposed to take off? How long had it been? Why couldn’t it fly?","“What’s going on?”","“It can’t fly?”","“But didn’t Master Duanmu say confidently that it can definitely fly?” Instantly, almost everyone turned to look at Master Duanmu.","Meanwhile, Master Duanmu was glaring at Ji Ying with a frown.","What was going on?!","Why wasn’t the fighter jet taking off?!","In the cabin, Ji Ying was also dumbfounded.","What the hell?","The last time they tested it, the fighter jet could take off. Although it had only circled in the sky three times, it could still fly!","Ji Ying panicked and pressed buttons randomly.","However, no matter how hard he tried, the fighter jet just wouldn’t take off.","“What’s going on?” The crown prince stared at Master Duanmu with a dark face.. “Are you making fun of me?”"]},{"number":3411,"title":"Chapter 3411: Are You Making Fun of Me? (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3411: Are You Making Fun of Me? (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Duanmu wasn’t afraid of anything except the crown prince’s dark expression.","He couldn’t stand still anymore and quickly walked toward the fighter jet.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Master Duanmu banged on the door.","The cabin door opened.","Master Duanmu shouted at Ji Ying, “Why isn’t it flying?!”","Ji Ying looked like he was about to cry and was a little flustered. “Master, I can’t make it fly.”","Master Duanmu’s expression was very ugly. “Why? Didn’t you fly it last time? Just do what you did last time!”","Ji Ying looked even more bitter. “I’ve already followed the previous procedure, but it still won’t take off... Master, is there something wrong with the inscription propeller?”","Master Duanmu dragged Ji Ying out and entered the cabin.","However, no matter how he fiddled with it, the fighter jet still showed no signs of activating.","It was as if this fighter jet was a big toy that was purely for show.","Master Duanmu’s face turned as black as the bottom of a pot.","At that moment, there was already a lot of discussion outside.","Master Wang naturally wouldn’t let go of this opportunity.","He smiled at Master Duanmu. “Eldest Senior Brother, didn’t you say you could fly the jet? What’s wrong now? Can’t you do it?”","Master Duanmu glared at Master Wang.","His junior brother had always been quiet. Since when had he learned how to mock others? It was all Feng Wu’s fault!","Master Duanmu gave Feng Wu another dirty look and went back to examining the fighter jet.","He was so anxious that his forehead was covered in sweat...","He had already lost several battles in a row. If the fighter jet failed... it would prove that everything he had said was a lie. How would he explain it to everyone?","Time passed slowly, but Master Duanmu still had no clue.","Feng Wu smiled at Master Duanmu. “Master Duanmu, don’t you think you’re wasting our time? When will it be ready?”","“It’ll be ready soon!” Master Duanmu gave Feng Wu a dirty look.","But another two hours passed after that.","Even the others couldn’t wait any longer, let alone Jun Linyuan.","Master Duanmu was still fiddling with the fighter jet. In the end, he removed the inscription propeller and tried to study the inscriptions on it. However, thev were too difficult for him. The inscriDtions contained endless changes. and Master Duanmu could never understand them all.","The crown prince stared at Master Duanmu. “So, how long are you going to waste my time making up stories?”","Master Duanmu’s heart lurched. He had a bad feeling.","Jun Linyuan said to Elder Dongfang, “Take him down.”","Master Duanmu was really anxious. “Your Royal Highness! Just give me a little more time... I’ve really developed a fighter jet, Your Royal Highness!”","Feng Wu smirked. “At first, you showed us your blueprints and said you’d be able to build a fighter jet in a year. Then, you said that you’d be able to build one in half a year. After that, you said you had already built one. You’ve been making things up all along!”","Master Duanmu glared at Feng Wu. “I’m not!”","Feng Wu said, “You’re full of lies! You still refuse to admit your inscription propeller came from a fighter jet of the Dongsang Kingdom!”","Master Duanmu: “I carved the inscriptions on the propeller stroke by stroke. How can it be from the Dongsang Kingdom?”","However, before Master Duanmu could say anything else, Feng Wu waved her hand, and an inscription propeller identical to the one in Master Duanmu’s hand appeared in front of everyone.."]},{"number":3412,"title":"Chapter 3412: Are You Making Fun of Me? (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3412: Are You Making Fun of Me? (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Be it the appearance or color, or the details of every inscription, the two propellers were identical in every way.","Master Duanmu was dumbfounded!","He looked up and glared at Feng Wu!","Feng Wu smirked at him. “Master Duanmu, do you recognize what this is? If you don’t, I can explain it to you.","“This is an inscription propeller taken from the first-generation fighter jet of the Dongsang Kingdom. The general, the crown prince, Mr. Xu, and even Elder Dongfang can prove it.”","Master Duanmu’s expression instantly turned ugly.","Feng Wu pointed at the inscription propeller in Master Duanmu’s hand. “Everyone, you can compare the two. Let’s see if the inscription propeller in Master Duanmu’s hand is exactly the same as the one I took out!”","Hearing Feng Wu’s words, everyone grew suspicious.","A moment ago, Master Duanmu said he had drawn the inscription propeller all by himself. Everyone had believed him, but now...","Almost everyone went forward to take a look.","Master Duanmu subconsciously held the inscription propeller in his arms, not letting anyone see it.","However, Elder Dongfang dragged him over and tied him up with a rope. That was under the crown prince’s order.","Elder Wu was dumbfounded. “They’re indeed...”","Master Wang wasn’t as polite.","“They’re exactly the same!” Master Wang looked at Feng Wu in surprise. “Miss","Feng Wu, where did you get the inscription propeller of the Dongsang","Kingdom? We have to study it now, or the self-destruct program will activate.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Master Wang, don’t worry. Dongsang won’t be able to activate it.”","Master Wang asked, “Why?”","Feng Wu smiled. “Is it because Master Duanmu’s inscription propeller won’t self-destruct that you think he made it himself?”","Everyone nodded. That was indeed the case.","Feng Wu darted a look at Master Duanmu. “Master Duanmu, aren’t you going to tell me the truth now?”","At this point, Master Duanmu lowered his head and remained silent.","Feng Wu stared at him. “If I tell everyone what happened, Master Duanmu, you’ll be punished even more severely.”","Master Duanmu looked up at Feng Wu and gritted his teeth. “I’m a Level 9 inscription master! Even if I’m lying, I’m still a Level 9 inscription master!” Feng Wu smiled at him.","Master Duanmu jumped to his feet and looked around. In the end, he strode over to Jun Linyuan and dropped to one knee. “Your Royal Highness, I have something to say!”","Jun Linyuan glanced at him and didn’t say anything.","Master Duanmu gritted his teeth and said, “Your maid is right! The blueprints were indeed obtained from Junior Brother Wang, and not drawn by me!”","wow!","Instantly, everyone’s eyes fell on Master Duanmu.","“He admitted it?”","A Level 9 inscription master actually admitted that he bribed someone to steal the designs from his junior brother?","Master Wang stared at Master Duanmu. “Who stole the design blueprints of the fighter jet from my arms while I was sleeping?!”","Master Duanmu didn’t want to tell him.","If he revealed that person, who would still work for him in the future?","However, Master Wang rushed forward and grabbed Master Duanmu’s collar.","He asked angrily, “Who was it?!”","Feng Wu smiled at Master Duanmu.","Master Duanmu met Feng Wu’s gaze and then looked at the crown prince. His heart ached.."]},{"number":3413,"title":"Chapter 3413: Are You Making Fun of Me? (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3413: Are You Making Fun of Me? (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It seemed the crown prince was going to favor his maid.","Master Duanmu didn’t expect that he, a dignified Level 9 inscription master, would actually lose to a nobody. It was incredible.","He was extremely indignant, but in the end, he gritted his teeth and said, “It was Wang Zhiheng.”","WHAT?!","Instantly, everyone looked behind Master Wang.","Wang Zhiheng?","Wasn’t he Master Wang’s eldest disciple?","He was also the eldest disciple to whom Master Wang was about to pass on his knowledge.","Master Wang was shocked. His first reaction was disbelief.","“Impossible! You’re talking nonsense!” Master Wang was furious and punched Master Duanmu’s nose!","However, Master Duanmu laughed. “Junior Brother Wang all these years, have you ever defeated me in anything? Did you really think I liked our junior sister? No, I saw you liked her, so I had to snatch her away.”","Master Duanmu was so furious that he was about to lose his mind, so he didn’t stop attacking Master Wang.","“If I really liked her, why wouldn’t I treat her well? I deliberately took away the love of your life. I’ll take away everything you ever wanted!”","A ferocious expression appeared on Master Duanmu’s face!","“This eldest disciple of yours is the one vou value the most. Therefore, I want","to snatch him away and let you taste the betrayal of the world again!","“Hahahaha —”","A look of madness appeared on Master Duanmu’s face.","Feng Wu looked at Master Duanmu calmly.","Actually, Master Duanmu wouldn’t be acting so crazy if she hadn’t drugged him.","She had secretly sprinkled some truth serum on him.","Master Duanmu was too despicable. Master Wang had suffered most of his life under his oppression.","Now that she had such a good opportunity, Feng Wu used a little trick to uncover Master Duanmu’s past.","He wasn’t as innocent as he claimed.","In his anger, Master Duanmu revealed his true self. Master Wang was furious and punched him in the face!","“Why?!","“What have I ever done to you?","“Why do you want to take away everything I have?!”","Master Wang was so angry that his eyes were bloodshot, and his entire body shook. This honest man had suffered for most of his life.","Master Duanmu laughed out loud. “Why? You ask me why? Master treated you better than he treated me! Back then, Master told me directly that you were the one who would inherit his title. Tell me, how could I take that lying down?! Look, I’ve achieved much more in inscriptions over the years. Master was clearly blind!”","Feng Wu looked at Master Duanmu indifferently. “Isn’t your fast improvement the result of your second wife?”","“How did you know?!” Master Duanmu turned around and glared at Feng Wu. “Who told you?! How did you know? Only she and I know about this. Did she tell you?!”","For a moment, everyone looked at Feng Wu in surprise...","What was going on?","Even Aunt Qing was stunned.","She remembered she had told Feng Wu about the gossip not long ago, but now, Feng Wu seemed to know more than she did. How amazing!","Feng Wu smiled. “She told me, of course. She even told me she was from the Dongsang Kingdom.” WHAT?!","Everyone was shocked again!","Master Duanmu’s second wife was actually from the Dongsang Kingdom?","What kind of shocking case was this?!"]},{"number":3414,"title":"Chapter 3414: The Truth","paragraphs":["Chapter 3414: The Truth","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What kind of shocking case was this?!","Everyone looked at Master Duanmu in shock.","Even Master Duanmu himself was shocked!","He had only found out later that his wife was from the Dongsang Kingdom.","At first, he really didn’t know!","“You... Who are you?!” Master Duanmu gritted his teeth, his eyes filled with anger!","Feng Wu didn’t answer Master Duanmu. She took a step forward, her hands still behind her back, and said with a cold and confident smile, “Master Duanmu’s wife isn’t only from the Dongsang Kingdom, she’s also from a noble family there. Correct?”","Master Duanmu stared at Feng Wu in horror.","Although Feng Wu had humiliated him time and time again, Master Duanmu had only been angry, not scared.","Feng Wu took a step forward. “Your wife also taught you Dongsang inscriptions, right?”","Master Duanmu denied it. “No!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Not only is your wife from Dongsang, but your disciple...”","Feng Wu pointed at Ji Ying. “He’s from Dongsang too, isn’t he?”","“No!” Master Duanmu said firmly and confidently!","Because he really didn’t think Ji Ying was from the Dongsang Kingdom.","However, as soon as Feng Wu said that, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi dashed forward and grabbed Ji Ying. “What are you doing?! What do you want?!”","Ji Ying struggled anxiously.","However, Feng Xun was infuriated. He grabbed Ji Ying and cut his skin open.","If the spiritual essence of plants leaked from the wound, that would determine if one was from the Dongsang Kingdom or not.","“It smells like plants.” Excited, Feng Xun reached into Ji Ying’s pocket.","“Let me go, let —”","Before Ji Ying could finish, Xuan Yi had already pinned his hands behind his back and gagged him with a rag.","Feng Xun took out a badge from Ji Ying’s pocket and saw that it was a military badge of the Junwu Empire.","There seemed to be something else.","Feng Xun dug around again and found a wooden box as wide as a finger. It was square and well-protected. The surface was polished, and Feng Xun could tell it had been rubbed often.","Ji Ying didn’t Imow what to do when Feng Xun found the box.","“Give it back! Give it back to me!”","Ji Ying struggled violently, but he was pinned down by Xuan Yi and couldn’t move at all.","Master Duanmu looked at the scene in surprise.","What was going on with Ji Ying? Why was he so agitated? What was in the small box?","Master Duanmu wasn’t the only one who was curious. The others were also puzzled.","Could Feng Wu be right?!","Just then, Feng Xun opened the box.","Inside...","“Holy crap! Isn’t that the military badge of the Dongsang Kingdom?” “This is a token from the Dongsang Kingdom. Why does Ji Ying have it?!” Everyone was shocked!","Master Duanmu’s reaction was the fastest. He rushed forward and slapped Ji Ying on the head, making the latter dizzyu At the same time, Master Duanmu shouted, “Who put this thing in your pocket? Speak!”","Feng Xun smirked at Master Duanmu. “Master Duanmu, are you suspecting","Master Duanmu: “I wouldn’t dare!”","Feng Xun said, “Master Duanmu saw how much Ji Ying valued the box just now. Do you think we’re all blind and can’t tell that it’s important to him? If it wasn’t his, why would he be so nervous?”","Feng Xun’s words rendered Master Duanmu speechless.."]},{"number":3415,"title":"Chapter 3415: Scold Her Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3415: Scold Her Again","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun’s words rendered Master Duanmu speechless.","Just now, Ji Ying indeed looked like he cared a lot about this small wooden box. Even Master Duanmu wouldn’t believe that someone had secretly placed it there.","Everyone confirmed that Ji Ying really was from the Dongsang Kingdom.","At that moment, someone had already gone to find Master Duanmu’s wife.","“That woman ran away!” When Aunt Qing went to capture Master Duanmu’s wife, she only found","“Escaped?” Feng Xun frowned.","If she escaped, it meant that there was something wrong with that woman. Master Duanmu’s face was ashen. He never expected his celebration event to turn out like this.","His disciple was a spy from the Dongsang Kingdom, and so was his wife. His capability had been repeatedly denied...","At this moment, Mr. Xu came over with Elder Dai.","Master Duanmu was still trying to explain that he was indeed the one who had made the inscription propeller.","Elder Dai had no choice but to confess, “I stole the inscription propeller from Feng Wu and gave it to Elder Yin.”","Elder Yin’s face turned red when he heard this.","Under everyone’s gazes, he panicked.","“Investigate thoroughly.” Jun Linyuan’s face darkened.","Everything had been revealed.","Jun Linyuan left with Feng Wu.","“Don’t you dare run away again!” Jun Linyuan glared at Feng Wu when he saw the valley where the black-robed man had found her.","Feng Wu was a little frustrated.","It was quite humiliating to be scolded in front of so many people.","However, Jun Linyuan kept a straight face and stared at Feng Wu. “I see you don’t agree with me.”","Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine.","“No... I’m not...” Feng Wu bit her lower lip with grievances.","She had done so well today. She had caught Zuo Qingluan and exposed several spies in Nest! She had done a great job, but Jun Linyuan only scolded her.","Everyone saw how Jun Linyuan lectured the girl with a dark face...","Hence, they all pretended there was an urgent matter at home and fled the scene.","Soon, Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were alone in the valley.","Jun Linyuan had the same expression on his face, regardless of whether onlookers were there or not.","He glanced at her and asked, “If not, why are you twisting around?”","Feng Wu really wasn’t happy.","Why would he care if she twisted or turned? Why did this man like to control her so much? This wasn’t a good sign.","Feng Wu raised her head and glared at Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince asked, “What? Did I accuse you of something you didn’t do?”","Rubbing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu darted a look at Jun Linyuan and said nothing.","Jun Linyuan said, “You’re allowed to tell me.” Feng Wu said, “If you insist.”","Crossing his arms, Jun Linyuan grunted.","Feng Wu stuck out her chest indignantly. “I caught a few spies for you today.”","Feng Wu counted on her fingers. “Zuo Qingluan, Elder Dai, Elder Yin, Master Duanmu, Lady Duanmu and Ji Ying. I’ve found a whole team of them. I should be rewarded, shouldn’t I?”","Jun Linyuan didn’t make any comment. Feng Wu asked, “Did I do a good job?”","Leaning against a tree with his arms crossed, the crown prince gave Feng Wu a sidelong glance and said grumpily, “Yes..”"]},{"number":3416,"title":"Chapter 3416: Trial Twelve","paragraphs":["Chapter 3416: Trial Twelve","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing Jun Linyuan nod, Feng Wu grew more confident.","“I’ve done so much for you, but you didn’t praise me at all. Instead, you lectured me...” Feng Wu sounded even more aggrieved.","The crown prince rubbed his temples","Every time he was rational, she would pretend to be obedient. Every time he wanted to talk about his feelings, she wouldn’t treat him seriously. How naughty.","“So, do you know your mistake now?” Before he knew it, Jun Linyuan had calmed down a lot, and he looked at Feng Wu indulgently. There was really nothing he could do about this girl.","Feng Wu said, “I...”","She scratched her head and muttered, “I don’t think I did anything wrong...”","The crown prince stared at her.","Feng Wu felt a little guilty. “I... I guess I shouldn’t be out alone at night.”","The crown prince darted a look at her and turned to leave.","His attitude was cold and distant.","Feng Wu rubbed her head. That wasn’t it?","Seeing that Jun Linyuan was leaving, Feng Wu ran after him.","She was experienced enough to know that when Jun Linyuan was angry, she had to appease him as soon as possible. Otherwise, the longer she delayed, the angrier he would get, and the more difficult it would be to make him happy later.","Feng Wu caught up with Jun Linyuan and asked, “What did I do wrong? Should I not have asked you for help?”","Jun Linyuan stopped abruptly.","Feng Wu’s head hit Jun Linyuan’s straight back, and her nose almost went crooked.","In pain, Feng Wu rubbed her red nose and looked at the crown prince aggrievedly.","Was he happy now?","However, Jun Linyuan still strode off. Feng Wu said, “Hey, Jun Linyuan!”","However, Jun Linyuan didn’t stop.","Just then, Feng Wu heard a voice in her head.","Ding!","Feng Wu’s scalp tingled when she heard that sound.","It was the fairy’s voice!","Nothing good happened when the fairy showed up, of this Feng Wu was sure!","As expected!","Just as Feng Wu stopped and focused, the fairy jumped out happily.","“Trial Twelve of the 12 Trials of Love will begin!","“Trial Twelve of the 12 Trials of Love will begin!","“Trial Twelve of the 12 Trials of Love will begin!","“Important things should be said three times. Dear host, please stop whatever you’re doing and make your choice!”","Make a choice?","Feng Wu looked like she had a huge question mark on her head.","Did she have a choice this time? That would be great.","The fairy was the one who had given out the first eleven trials, and Feng Wu had to complete them within a stipulated time frame.","Feng Wu heaved a sigh of relief. It was finally the twelfth trial... Once she completed it, her beautiful master would wake up.","Feng Wu was thrilled!","She remembered something. “When I complete the 12 Trials of Love, my beautiful master will stay awake for a long time, right? You said it before!”","Under Feng Wu’s excited gaze, the fairy didn’t dare to avoid the question. She said meekly, “It’ll be a lot longer than before. There are additional tasks. Your beautiful master will stay awake for even longer after you finish them.” Feng Wu remembered that!","Feng Wu remembered everything about her beautiful master; she would never forget them.."]},{"number":3417,"title":"Chapter 3417: Passionate Relationship (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3417: Passionate Relationship (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu had forgotten she was chasing Jun Linyuan. She didn’t care where she was and sat down right away, and urged the fairy excitedly, “Tell me! Tell me! What’s Trial Twelve? Hurry up!”","The fairy didn’t know what the mission was, and she was as excited as Feng wu.","However, when she opened the mission scroll in her hand and took a look, her expression changed.","She stole a glance at Feng Wu out of the corner of her eye as she read.","However, because Feng Wu was staring at her, she caught that look.","The fairy stiffened and looked away from Feng Wu.","Feng Wu panicked.","She glared at the fairy. “Hurry up and tell me.”","Feng Wu had never been as anxious as she was now.","The fairy took a deep breath, looked at Feng Wu, and said slowly, “Dear host, please calm down.”","Feng Wu almost jumped when the fairy said that.","“Speak!”","The fairy was a little taken aback by Feng Wu’s outburst. She drew her head back and said meekly, “Then... don’t be angry.”","Feng Wu frowned at the fairy.","The fairy quickly said, “Alright, alright. I’ll tell you. Trial Twelve is...","“There are two options for Trial Twelve. You just have to choose one of them.” The fairy swallowed and looked at Feng Wu seriously.","Feng Wu nodded. “Alright.”","The fairy said, “Option one: You and Jun Linyuan will be strangers, and you’ll never see each other again.”","Feng Wu’s breath caught in her throat, and her eyes widened.","The fairy nodded solemnly. “Yes, that’s the first option. You can see for yourself if you don’t believe me.”","The fairy waved her hand, and a panel appeared in front of Feng Wu.","The panel read, “For Trial Twelve of the 12 Trials of Love, the candidate can choose one of two options.","“Option one: Become a stranger to Jun Linyuan and never see him again.”","Biting her lower lip, Feng Wu looked grim.","If it were before, she wouldn’t mind treating Jun Linyuan like a stranger. After all, they hadn’t been familiar with each other. However, as they got closer, Feng Wu had to admit that Jun Linyuan had drawn her attention – and it wasn’t just a little – even though he had a bad temper.","To be apart from him... Even Feng Wu didn’t realize how grim she looked.","Feng Wu looked at option two.","She was a little afraid of looking at it now. What if it made her even angrier?","But Feng Wu still read it in the end.","When she saw the second option, she was dumbfounded.","Feng Wu didn’t know if she was angry or what, but she just stood there in a daze.","Option two was to have a passionate relationship with Jun Linyuan!","Feng Wu’s eyes widened as she stared at the bright red words.","What the hell was the system trying to do to her?","The first option was to become a stranger to Jun Linyuan, and the second was to have a passionate relationship with him!","Did they have to be that extreme?","Why wasn’t there anything in between?","Feng Wu stiffened and looked at the fairy with difficulty.. “Are you sure you’re not messing with me?”"]},{"number":3418,"title":"Chapter 3418: Passionate Relationship (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3418: Passionate Relationship (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The fairy looked at Feng Wu anxiously.","Feng Wu said the same thing. “Are you really not messing with me?”","The fairy looked pitiful. She was so scared that tears rolled down her cheeks. “I,","1...”","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","In fact, she knew that the 12 Trials of Love had nothing to do with the fairy; she was just the person who issued the missions. If Feng Wu ever found out who designed the missions, she would definitely slap them to death!","However, when Feng Wu found out who that person was one day...","“Then, what should we do now?” The fairy was nervous, but she was also curious.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at her.","How would she know?","She was really troubled. These two options were too extreme. No matter which one she chose...","How annoying.","Rubbing her head, Feng Wu fell into deep thought.","The fairy shrunk back, not daring to disturb Feng Wu again.","She knew she would easily become Feng Wu’s target right now.","As a matter of fact, she wanted to remind Feng Wu... Alas, she decided not to, in case Feng Wu wanted to slap her.","The fairy quickly retreated to a safe distance before running away.","The crown prince was also feeling infuriated at that moment.","He had been marching forward, but after a while, he realized the girl wasn’t following him.","Why didn’t she follow him?","What was she doing?","He was already angry, so how could she not follow him? The crown prince was furious!","He was really mad!","The angry young man immediately stopped walking. He crossed his arms and leaned against a tree, waiting for Feng Wu.","He wanted to see when that heartless girl would catch up with him.","Time ticked by, but Jun Linyuan didn’t see his girl.","He frowned more and more.","Had he been too harsh on her and made her angry?","But if he didn’t reprimand her, what if she ran around and put herself in danger again? Therefore, it was reasonable for him to be angry!","The crown prince wanted to ignore her.","However, he kept glancing back and forth from time to time.","She still didn’t show up.","The crown prince looked worried.","Could that girl have gotten lost in the valley?","It was so dark. Did she fall?","Would wolves get to her?","Would she be sitting alone in a corner, hugging her knees and crying?","No...","Feng Wu’s pitiful face filled the crown prince’s mind; he had completely forgotten that the girl was a Level 6 Spiritual King. Unless she met a powerful opponent, she could send a wolf flying with a single punch.","Should he go back and look for her?","The crown prince thought about it. The girl had been trying to cheer him up lately, so it wouldn’t be embarrassing for him to go back and look for her.","After making up his mind, Jun Linyuan started to walk back.","Not long after, he saw the girl sitting cross-legged under a locust tree. Her eyes were closed, and she seemed to be circulating her energy.","As soon as Jun Linyuan saw her, all the worries in his mind dissipated, and all he wanted to do was lecture her.","He leaned against another tree and looked quietly at the girl.","It wasn’t easy for other people to see in the pitch-black night, but for Jun Linyuan, who had good night vision, it wasn’t a problem.","He saw that the girl’s face was red with anger. In the end, he sighed.."]},{"number":3419,"title":"Chapter 3419: Option One or Two","paragraphs":["Chapter 3419: Option One or Two","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Was the girl angry at him for scolding her every day?","What a temperamental girl.","Forget it. Since she had been trying to make him happy all this while, he wouldn’t scold her this time.","“If you run away again, I’ll break your leg,” the crown prince threatened Feng wu.","However, he wasn’t looking at Feng Wu. Instead, he was looking into the distance.","Receiving no response, the crown prince snorted again. “Let’s see if you dare run around again. That was very bold of you. How could you provoke a Spiritual","Overlord?”","Feng Wu still said nothing.","That was because she was still in shock.","Were she and Jun Linyuan going to become strangers, or was she going to have a passionate love relationship with him? Who the hell came up with this mission? It was impossible!","Hence, Feng Wu didn’t hear what the crown prince said.","“What are you thinking?!”","The crown prince turned around and saw Feng Wu clutching her head; it didn’t seem like she had heard him. He poked her.","What?","Feng Wu jumped at Jun Linyuan’s voice!","“What are you doing here?!” Agitated, Feng Wu jumped up!","However, she had forgotten she was under the tree, so when she jumped up, her head hit the tree branch above and broke it with a bang.","“Ugh...”","Feng Wu’s forehead was red and swollen from the tree branch, and she quickly reached for her eyes.","The crown prince was dumbfounded by Feng Wu’s reaction.","Feng Wu landed on the ground with a thud.","She was such a powerful girl, but she didn’t even know how to use her strength when she landed. Her legs hit the ground and sank three inches into it. Even the crown prince could feel the pain.","The crown prince noticed that Feng Wu looked as if she had just seen a ghost.","Of course, she would look that way.","Jun Linyuan...","She thought of the twelfth trial and then looked at Jun Linyuan.","Then she thought about the twelfth trial again.","Feng Wu was speechless.","The crown prince frowned at her. “Are you dreaming or something?","Feng Wu wasn’t dreaming. She was just frustrated.","She didn’t even want to talk to anyone else, so she looked away from Jun Linyuan and walked away.","The crown prince was perplexed.","The crown prince was used to Feng Wu’s coaxing, and he suddenly panicked when he realized she had stopped trying to please him. Had he treated her too poorly and made her run away?","The crown prince followed her with a frown.","Feng Wu kept walking, neither too fast nor too slow. However, her expression, which used to be lively, was now very stiff, and she was frowning.","She really didn’t know what to choose now...","However, the fairy was still urging her in her mind.","“Do you choose option one or two?","“Which one will it be?","“What are you...”","Feng Wu glared at her.","The little fairy was so frightened that she almost choked. She shrank back and didn’t dare to make a sound.","Feng Wu heaved a sigh of relief and calmed down a little. She asked the fairy, “When do I have to make the choice?”","Frightened by Feng Wu, the fairy told her honestly, “Look at the countdown.","There are still 48 hours.”","Sure enough, Feng Wu saw that there was a countdown after the option.","That meant she still had two days to make her choice.","Luckily, she hadn’t made a choice right away, and Feng Wu immediately felt better.."]},{"number":3420,"title":"Chapter 3420: My Daughter","paragraphs":["Chapter 3420: My Daughter","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Are you angry?” A muffled voice came from behind Feng Wu.","It was Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu didn’t know if she was angry, but she knew she didn’t want to see Jun","Linyuan right now.","Because the moment she saw him... she felt depressed.","Without looking back, Feng Wu said, “I’m off.”","With that, she quickly ran away.","Jun Linyuan stood alone in the wind, a storm brewing on his stunning face...","Nest Fortress.","Lying in bed, Feng Wu tossed and turned all night.","Why did she have to make this decision?","She didn’t know what to do...","Feng Wu lay in bed with her eyes open. She tossed and turned in bed for the entire night, unable to fall asleep for a second. Then, she watched the sky light up.","Feng Wu got up with the blanket around her, feeling a little drowsy.","At that moment, there was a loud knock on the door!","Feng Wu frowned. Why was someone disturbing her so early in the morning?","Before Feng Wu could ask, Feng Xun’s voice came from outside.","“Xiao Wu, Xiao Wu! Hurry up! Something bad has happened!”","Had Nest been conquered? Feng Wu jumped out of bed, put on her exquisite combat boots, and opened the door.","Before Feng Wu could see what was happening, Feng Xun dragged her away.","“Let’s go!”","Feng Wu looked at him in confusion. “What’s wrong?”","Feng Xun said in a hurry, “Didn’t you catch Zuo Qingluan last night?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Feng Xun asked, “You proved Zuo Qingluan was a spy last night, right?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. Didn’t I tell you to lock her up? I was going to interrogate her today.”","Feng Xun said in a hurry, “That’s the problem! Zuo Qingluan has been released ! ”","WHAT?!","Feng Wu’s eyes widened and she frowned. “What do you mean?”","Feng Xun said, “It’s what you call an acquittal.”","Feng Wu said, “How is that possible? There’s concrete evidence that Zuo Qingluan is a spy, and she has the special blood of the Dongsang Kingdom in her veins. No one will let her go. And without Jun Linyuan’s order...” Feng Xun was in a hurry. “But it was Boss Jun who ordered the release.”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Feng Xun nodded solemnly and looked at Feng Wu. “Boss Jun was the one who","oraerea tne release.”","What the hell was Jun Linyuan doing?! Feng Wu pushed Feng Xun away angrily and ran toward Jun Linyuan’s yard.","“She’s not in Boss Jun’s yard. She’s with my father!” Feng Xun shouted at Feng Wu as he chased after her. “Zuo Qingluan’s master is here to pick her up. We might be able to stop them at the general’s place.”","Firmament Palace’s old master?","Feng Wu frowned even more. The old palace master wasn’t a kind person.","When Feng Wu arrived at Feng Xiangnan’s manor, she saw everyone there.","The general, Jun Linyuan, Mr. Lu, and Mr. Xu.","There was also a red-robed woman. She was on the elderly side and was still beautiful, but her facial features were very sharp, as if they had been cut out with a sword. Her cheekbones were prominent, her temples were hollow, and her eyebrows were peaked like swords...","She looked very fierce.","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan was kowtowing in front of the master of Firmament Palace.","Feng Wu pushed the door open, and everyone turned to look at her.","Only the crown prince didn’t look in her direction.","The general waved enthusiastically at Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, come here.”","Feng Wu walked over to the general and stood next to him.","The general turned to the master of Firmament Palace and said proudly, “See? This is little Feng Wu, the invincible girl whom I told you about. She’s my daughter..”"]},{"number":3421,"title":"Chapter 3421: Humiliate the Master of Firmament Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 3421: Humiliate the Master of Firmament Palace","(1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The master of Firmament Palace looked at Feng Wu.","It was the scrutinizing gaze of a superior.","The air seemed to stop moving.","Anyone else would have panicked under that stare, but Feng Wu remained calm. She even smiled and allowed the master to examine her.","General Feng was extremely proud of his daughter. Hence, he happily showed off to the master of Firmament Palace. “Xiao Wu is extremely talented and has advanced quickly. What’s your level now?” The last question was for Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled. “I’m a Level 7 SDiritual King.”","General Feng was surprised. “Weren’t you only a Level 6 Spiritual King yesterday?”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I don’t know why, but I couldn’t sleep last night, so I decided to cultivate. I made a breakthrough before I knew it.”","General Feng said to the master of Firmament Palace in resignation, “Look at this daughter of mine. I’ve been suppressing her from making breakthroughs to stop her from making progress too quickly. If her body can’t keep up, she’ll be in trouble in the future. However, I really can’t suppress this girl’s breakthroughs. Don’t you think this is too troublesome?”","General Feng looked extremely distressed, but the master of Firmament Palace didn’t look too happy.","Did she know Feng Wu?","Of course, she did.","Back then, it was Feng Wu who had caught the master’s eye, and she had wanted to take Feng Wu in as her disciple. However, something happened to Feng Wu, and her True Phoenix Blood was destroyed. She had turned from a genius to a good-for-nothing, which was why the master had chosen another person with True Phoenix Blood, Zuo Qingluan.","Not many people knew that, but the master wasn’t sure if Feng Xiangnan knew it.","However, now that Feng Xiangnan was praising Feng Wu in front of her, the master didn’t look happy. Zuo Qingluan was still kneeling on the ground.","The master’s face darkened, and she didn’t want to speak.","However, General Feng wouldn’t let it go. He sighed in resignation and said to the master, “Master Yun, my little girl doesn’t know anything except catching spies. Look, we caught a bunch last night.”","Feng Wu darted a look at General Feng and winced. Aren’t you supposed to be cold and stoic? Why are you so talkative when you’re talking to her?","Master Yun snorted. “General Feng, she’s not your daughter, is she?”","Feng Xiangnan said, “Of course she is. My wife personally took her in as her goddaughter. She’s more like a daughter to me than a real daughter. Why,","Master Yun? Are you not convinced?”","Master Yun snorted, and her expression turned even uglier.","Feng Xiangnan rubbed his chin and suddenly said, “Why did I hear that back then, Master Yun wanted to recruit my daughter as a disciple but didn’t succeed?”","Master Yun’s face darkened as she stared at Feng Xiangnan!","She wanted to throw a tantrum, but Zuo Qingluan was in his hands. If she wanted to take Zuo Qingluan away, she really couldn’t fall out with Feng Xiangnan now.","She took a deep breath and finally suppressed her emotions. She said lightly,","“There was no such thing.”","General Feng asked, “Really? Was I wrong?”","Master Yun said coldly, “Yes.”","General Feng said, “That’s good. If Master Yun had wanted to have Feng Wu as your disciple, but in the end chose...”","General Feng glanced at Zuo Qingluan, who was kneeling on the ground, and clicked his tongue.. “That would have been such a pity, wouldn’t it?”"]},{"number":3422,"title":"Chapter 3422: Humiliate the Master of Firmament Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 3422: Humiliate the Master of Firmament Palace","(2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Yun was truly enraged. She glared at General Feng and gritted her teeth. “Feng Xiangnan! ”","General Feng gave her a perfectly guileless look. “What’s wrong?”","Master Yun was so angry that her face turned pale. What was wrong? What was wrong?!","General Feng shrugged innocently. “I’m serious. If you had really wanted to take my Xiao Wu as your disciple but didn’t do so, you should regret it now. Do you know how powerful my Xiao Wu is?”","General Feng ignored the ugly look on Master Yun’s face and said seriously, “Xiao Wu has the Divine Phoenix Blood, not True Phoenix Blood. She’s the only one who has the Divine Phoenix Blood on the continent.”","Master Yun was about to go mad from anger.","Did Feng Xiangnan think that she had passed away in Firmament Palace? How could she not know about the emergence of the Divine Phoenix Blood? The moment she found out, she regretted it so much that she felt like throwing up.","The Divine Phoenix Blood meant Feng Wu was destined to be a peerless genius.","At that moment, Master Yun wanted to strangle Zuo Qingluan to death!","She wished she could turn back time and choose Feng Wu instead of Zuo","Qingluan.","But what could she do?","She had already chosen, raised, and taught Zuo Qingluan. She couldn’t change anything now.","Master Yun glared at Feng Xiangnan. She didn’t want to talk about it, but Feng Xiangnan kept mentioning it. He had to be doing it on purpose.","In order not to be provoked by the mention of Feng Wu, Master Yun had stopped asking people to gather information about Feng Wu. In fact, mentioning Feng Wu was taboo in all of Firmament Palace.","As a result, she only had information on Feng Wu up to the point when she gained the Divine Phoenix Blood.","When General Feng saw Master Yun’s frustration, he laughed inwardly. A smug expression appeared on his face.","He had learned from his wife’s letter how Master Yun had abandoned Xiao Wu, who had lost her True Phoenix Blood, and that she might have even been involved in destroying Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood.","It would be strange if General Feng didn’t want to make her more frustrated.","Feng Xiangnan said with a serious expression, “Master Yun is good at medicine. You were already a Semi-Supreme Level medicine refiner in your early years. I wonder what level you are at now?”","Zuo Qingluan’s expression changed.","Only the higher-ups of the Peace Grassland knew that Feng Wu was already a Semi-Divine medicine refiner; Master Yun didn’t know that yet. Zuo Qingluan was worried that General Feng would embarrass her master, so she took the initiative to say, “Master’s medical skills are actually...”","Master Yun glared at Zuo Qingluan. “Who permitted you to speak here? Shut","Zuo Qingluan was speechless.","She really wanted to warn her master, but she couldn’t find the right words. Therefore, Zuo Qingluan could only grit her teeth and kneel on the ground without saying a word.","Everyone was sitting down, including Feng Wu. Zuo Qingluan was the only one kneeling. It was particularly humiliating for her!","She felt that everyone was looking at her strangely. Everyone was mocking her and laughing at her.","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and swallowed the humiliation.","At that moment, Feng Xiangnan still wouldn’t get to the point, and only exchanged pleasantries with Master Yun.","“Master Yun, I’m sure you’re at the Semi- Divine Level, right?” Feng Xiangnan actually knew how to flatter others.","Master Yun felt that Feng Xiangnan’s attitude had improved. Hence, she softened her attitude and said coldly, “I’m almost there.”","General Feng said, “Almost there? How much longer do you need? When will you become a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”"]},{"number":3423,"title":"Chapter 3423: Humiliate the Master of Firmament Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 3423: Humiliate the Master of Firmament Palace","(3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Yun frowned and glanced at General Feng haughtily. “Feng Xiangnan, what’s with the look in your eyes? Do you think the Semi-Divine Level is that easy to reach? Think about it. Does the Junwu Empire have a Semi-Divine medicine refiner? The best Nest has is a Supreme Level medicine refiner. Why are you so arrogant?!”","Feng Xiangnan looked like he wanted to retort, but Master Yun cut him off. “Why? Are you still unconvinced?” Master Yun sneered. “In one to three years, I can become a Semi-Divine medicine refiner!","“At that time, I’ll be able to refine Semi-Divine elixirs. Feng Xiangnan, what your Nest Fortress lacks the most is healing medicine. Are you sure you don’t want to be more polite to me now?”","The more Master Yun spoke, the more arrogant she became.","She had begged Feng Xiangnan to let Zuo Qingluan go, but now, she suddenly felt that she had the upper hand!","Who wouldn’t want a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?! Feng Xiangnan, why aren’t you in a hurry to please me, a future Semi-Divine medicine refiner? How dare you make things difficult for me?!","However, Master Yun suddenly realized that everyone was looking at her strangely.","General Feng looked at Master Yun strangely and said in a surprised tone, “Master Yun, you haven’t become a Semi-Divine medicine refiner yet?”","Master Yun glared at him.","What did Feng Xiangnan mean? Did he really think he could find a Semi-Divine medicine refiner just anywhere?","However, Feng Xiangnan’s next sentence was, “My Xiao Wu is already a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, and you’re still not?” WHAT?!","Master Yun froze, and her mind went blank.","However, she quickly came back to her senses.","She decided that Feng Xiangnan was lying to her. Why was he making such a scary joke?","“Feng Xiangnan, we’re talking about urgent matters. Is this the time to joke?!” Master Yun stared at him with a serious expression.","General Feng said, “I’m not joking. My Xiao Wu is really.. ”","Master Yun interrupted him impatiently. “If she’s a Semi -Divine medicine refiner, I can give her the entire Firmament Palace! Alright, don’t make such...” “Really?” General Feng nudged Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, thank Master Yun!”","Feng Wu and General Feng understood each other very well. Hearing Feng Xiangnan’s words, Feng Wu immediately bowed deeply. “Thank you for your kindness, Master Yun. I’ll accept the gift.” What the heck?!","Master Yun glared at Feng Xiangnan angrily.","Feng Xiangnan looked puzzled. “Master Yun doesn’t know? That shouldn’t be the case. I don’t think the Firmament Palace would miss out on that; Xiao Wu didn’t really keep it a secret.” Master Yun was astonished.","She turned to stare at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan hated everyone here.","However, she was the weakest here, so she could only grit her teeth and say, “Master... she’s really...”","The fury in Master Yun’s heart was like a raging fire.","However, she had to smile. “Whether it’s true or not, congratulations, General Feng.”","After that, she immediately changed the topic. “I’ll leave with Qingluan now.","Goodbye!”","Master Yun wanted to leave, but it wouldn’t be that easy.","General Feng smiled, but his smile didn’t reach his eyes.. “Master Yun, are you going to take away this spy who colluded with the Dongsang Kingdom just like that? Aren’t you afraid that all of Firmament Palace will come under suspicion?”"]},{"number":3424,"title":"Chapter 3424: Ruthless Zuo Qjngluan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3424: Ruthless Zuo Qjngluan","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Yun shuddered and felt a chill run down her spine.","Feng Xiangnan was so bold!","Master Yun didn’t speak to Feng Xiangnan. Instead, she looked at Jun Linyuan.","“What does the crown prince think?”","!!","Immediately, everyone turned to look at Jun Linyuan.","As a matter of fact, Jun Linyuan was the most influential person here. No one would dare refuse him since he was the crown prince.","Leaning back in his chair, Jun Linyuan stared at the ground without any expression.","Everyone waited for him to answer.","But his face was getting darker and darker.","He looked up and stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu stood next to the general.","She knew that Jun Linyuan was looking at her, and she could even guess what he was waiting for.","He was waiting for her to beg him.","However, Feng Wu wouldn’t do it.","Why should she?","Zuo Qingluan had been colluding with the Dongsang Kingdom and became their spy in the first place, and the evidence was conclusive. Someone like that deserved to die. Why should Feng Wu beg for Jun Linyuan’s help?","Feng Wu pursed her lips. She didn’t like what was going on.","General Feng looked from Jun Linyuan to Feng Wu, then back to Jun Linyuan.","He realized the young couple were quarreling.","As Feng Wu’s father, General Feng sided with her without hesitation.","At that moment, Master Yun realized something.","She thought Jun Linyuan still had feelings for Zuo Qingluan.","At that thought, Master Yun glared at Zuo Qingluan, suggesting the latter beg the crown prince!","Zuo Qingluan also felt the crown prince didn’t like Feng Wu that much anymore. That was the best news.","Zuo Qingluan turned to Jun Linyuan on her knees, took a deep breath, and banged her forehead on the ground.","The sound was so loud!","Everyone was shocked!","Zuo Qingluan’s forehead cracked, and blood oozed out.","“Your Royal Highness, it’s all my fault. I shouldn’t have given in to the temptation of the Dongsang Kingdom.”","There was a loud thump.","Zuo Qingluan knocked her head on the ground again.","“Your Royal Highness, it was all my fault. I shouldn’t have been jealous of Feng Wu’s cultivation and made such a decision because of her breakthrough speed.”","There was a loud thump.","Zuo Qingluan knocked her head on the ground again.","Blood gushed out!","At this moment...","There was already a bowl-sized wound on Zuo Qingluan’s forehead, and blood was flowing out...","Her face was dyed red, and her clothes were soaked with blood. The ground in front of her was covered in blood as well.","Mr. Lu frowned. Zuo Qingluan was a ruthless person.","This way, she would turn herself into a victim and put all the blame on Feng Wu. Those who didn’t know the truth would be fooled by her.","Mr. Lu looked at Feng Wu involuntarily.","He wasn’t the only one.","Everyone glanced at Feng Wu from time to time.","With a thud, Zuo Qingluan banged her head on the ground again.","Her skull was about to shatter.","She was dizzy, but she still gritted her teeth and insisted. “Your Royal Highness, it’s all my fault. I shouldn’t have been jealous of Feng Wu for winning your favor.”","Zuo Qingluan was still kowtowing.","She was covered in blood...","How scary.","She had to be so ruthless to herself to put up such a show.","It was actually not difficult to kill herself by banging her head hard enough to die instantly.","But for Zuo Qingluan to do it again and again, that required a lot of willpower!"]},{"number":3425,"title":"Chapter 3425: Your Matriarch Is Still Alive?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3425: Your Matriarch Is Still Alive?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Even General Feng frowned slightly.","Zuo Qingluan was indeed extraordinary. He had underestimated her.","His gaze fell on Feng Wu. The girl’s lips were pursed; she was obviously sulking.","General Feng shifted his gaze from Feng Wu to Jun Linyuan, only to find that Jun Linyuan was expressionless, and his eyes were dark and cold.","The young couple was so...","General Feng finally looked at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan had been banging her head so hard that she was about to pass out.","But she was still kowtowing.","How ruthless. General Feng sighed inwardly again.","It wasn’t just physical pain, but also mental humiliation. Zuo Qingluan could actually take it...","General Feng released his spiritual senses and noticed that Zuo Qingluan’s spiritual power was growing.","“That’s enough!”","In the end, it was Master Yun who stopped Zuo Qingluan.","Staring at Zuo Qingluan, she frowned and finally looked at Jun Linyuan.","“Your Royal Highness, my disciple has committed such a disgraceful act. She should be executed immediately, but...” Master Yun hesitated for a moment before saying, “However, Zuo Qingluan is of True Phoenix Blood. The","Matriarch has issued a decree that she must be brought back to Firmament Palace. Your Royal Highness, please let her go.”","Feng Wu frowned and darted a look at Feng Xun.","Who said that Jun Linyuan had given the order to release Zuo Qingluan? She had been so angry just now.","Judging by what Master Yun said, Jun Linyuan still hadn’t agreed yet.","Feng Xun scratched his head in embarrassment. He had rushed off to find Xiao Wu when he heard the news, and he forgot who had told him that...","At that moment, everyone’s attention was on Jun Linyuan.","General Feng frowned. “Matriarch?”","Master Yun glanced at General Feng proudly. “That’s right, our Matriarch.”","General Feng frowned even more. “The Matriarch of Firmament Palace... is still alive?”","Master Yun glared at the general. “Feng Xiangnan, how dare you!”","General Feng said “Why can’t I ask that question? After so many years, not many old cultivators from the ancient era are still alive. Who knows if your Matriarch is still alive or if it’s an excuse you made up?”","Master Yun sneered. “Why don’t you visit Firmament Palace?”","Feng Xiangnan stroked his chin. The Matriarch of Firmament Palace was still alive? That made him wary.","Master Yun opened her palm, and a snow-white mist which looked like cotton candy appeared.","“Immortal substance?” Feng Xiangnan’s pupils contracted as he stared at the substance in Master Yun’s hand!","Master Yun sneered. “Recognize it?”","Feng Xiangnan frowned. “Is your Matriarch really still alive?”","The immortal substance was used to cultivate the body.","Even if one’s body was damaged, one would be able to recover quickly after using an immortal substance to repair it.","However, only an Immortal Stage cultivator could nurture the immortal substance.","Only those from the Ancient God Era could create the immortal substance, such as Master Linghu and Chu Tianxiao.","In this era, it was basically impossible.","Feng Xiangnan looked at Jun Linyuan, wondering if he would be able to reach that level in the end. After all, the spiritual essence in nature now couldn’t be compared to that of ancient times.","Master Yun glanced at General Feng arrogantly. “Feng Xiangnan, my Matriarch is still alive. Are you scared?”","Master Yun’s strength was on the same level as Feng Xiangnan’s. She revered the Matriarch, so everyone wondered how powerful the latter was.."]},{"number":3426,"title":"Chapter 3426: Jun Linyuan’s Love","paragraphs":["Chapter 3426: Jun Linyuan’s Love","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu frowned a little.","Seeing Feng Wu’s frown, Jun Linyuan felt sorry for her.","Did Master Yun think that she could suppress Feng Xiangnan with the help of the Matriarch?!","Staring at Master Yun, Jun Linyuan smirked. “Just tell your Matriarch to come here.”","Master Yun was pleased to see that Feng Xiangnan was intimidated, but she didn’t expect Jun Linyuan to make things difficult for her. She was confused.","Didn’t Zuo Qingluan say that Jun Linyuan liked her? Even if Jun Linyuan had fallen in love with Feng Wu, he would at least care about Zuo Qingluan for old times’ sake.","Master Yun stared at Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness, the Matriarch is too busy cultivating to care about the mundane world.”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “Then she can focus on her cultivation!”","That tone...","Master Yun was furious.","He was talking about their Matriarch, the Matriarch of the Ancient God Era!","“She’s a Matriarch from the same era as Lord Mu Jiuzhou!” Master Yun stared at Jun Linyuan. “The crown prince should watch his language.” With that, Master Yun was about to leave with Zuo Qingluan.","“Who said you could leave?”","A beam of light suddenly descended to envelop everyone, including Master Yun.","She stared at Jun Linyuan in surprise. She hadn’t expected him to do something like that.","She tried to break the light barrier, but she realized that she couldn’t do that with her current ability.","In other words, Jun Linyuan was stronger than her.","How was that even possible?","The young man wasn’t even twenty years old. How could he have such strength?!","No wonder he didn’t have too much respect for the Matriarch. At his current cultivation progress, he would sooner or later reach that stage as well.","Master Yun gritted her teeth and stared at Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness, won’t you do something for old times’ sake?”","At the mention of old times’ sake, Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu involuntarily.","He saw that his girl was frowning and was very unhappy.","Jun Linyuan was furious.","He didn’t care about a nonexistent past relationship at all, but if his girl was unhappy, he wouldn’t be happy either.","“Are you an idiot?” Jun Linyuan glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “What?” What was going on? Why was she involved?","Wasn’t it supposed to be a conversation between big shots? Why was she dragged into it?","“How did you lose your True Phoenix Blood back then?” Jun Linyuan stared at Feng wu.","Feng Wu realized what was going on. Was he telling her to reveal the truth?","But that was true. If she didn’t say it now, when would she?","Master Yun’s Matriarch... Judging from General Feng’s reaction, it was obvious that he felt quite intimidated.","The Matriarch was probably on the same level as Chu Tianxiao.","At that thought, Feng Wu said, “Zuo Qingluan destroyed my True Phoenix","Blood back then.”","“I didn’t.” Zuo Qingluan was still dizzy from the kowtowing, but she managed to stand up with the help of Master Yun. She stared at Feng Wu. “I didn’t. Don’t make things up.”","Feng Wu smirked. “Yes, you did.”","Zuo Qingluan smiled bitterly. “You can accuse me of anything, but I’ll never admit to anything I haven’t done. Feng Wu, you already have so much. You have an advanced cultivation level, a lot of talent, and great connections. You even have the crown prince’s love... Why are you still making things difficult for you ve dLLeauy LLILUVVLI Ille lien. vvny die you SULL SLctnueLLL1g Ille LUIS! “I’m not as strong as you now. I’m inferior to you in everything. I’m no longer a threat to you. Do you want me dead?","“Feng Wu, how can you be so cruel?”"]},{"number":3427,"title":"Chapter 3427: Spiritual Fossil Stone (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3427: Spiritual Fossil Stone (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Feng Wu, how can you be so cruel? How can you slander me?!” Zuo Qingluan shouted at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smirked.","Zuo Qingluan was still looking at Feng Wu with tears in her eyes.","“Feng Wu, do you really want me dead?!”","As she spoke, Zuo Qingluan took out a dagger from her sleeve and put the blade on her fair neck.","The sharp dagger sliced her skin. Instantly, a bloody mark appeared, and beads of blood oozed out.","Right now, Zuo Qingluan looked so sad, so miserable, so wronged..","“That’s enough!”","Master Yun hollered angrily! She stared at Feng Wu. “Are you really going to kill her?!” Feng Wu kept a smirk on her face.","Instead of answering Master Yun, she stared at Zuo Qingluan.","She wanted to see how thick-skinned Zuo Qingluan was to say something like that at a time like this.","However, under Feng Wu’s gaze, Zuo Qingluan still looked as aggrieved as ever.","Feng Wu didn’t want to play along with her anymore.","“Zuo Qingluan, I used to respect you for being a brave woman. You may be despicable, but at least you have a bottom line. But now, I’m really disappointed.”","Feng Wu shook her head in disappointment. “I can’t believe I’m going against someone like you. Tsk.”","Her voice was filled with indescribable disdain.","However, Zuo Qingluan was still acting.","She used to be cold and aloof, but now, she looked so pitiful.","Tears rolled down her cheeks as she sobbed. “Feng Wu. I was tricked bv that black-robed man and went astray for a while before I came back to the right path. I admit my mistake, but how can you... How can you frame me like this?","“Back then, you were too greedy, and your spiritual essence went berserk, which destroyed your True Phoenix Blood.","“I have my own True Phoenix Blood. Why would I destroy yours?","“You’re the one the crown prince likes now. You’re the prettiest and the most favored. Is there anyone in the world who’s luckier than you?","“I really didn’t frame you. Can you stop hurting me?”","Zuo Qingluan was about to say something else, but Feng Wu waved her hand.","“Zuo Qingluan, you told me yourself that you framed me in that underground mine. Have you really forgotten?”","Zuo Qingluan had said it herself, so of course, she remembered.","But how long ago had that been? Did Feng Wu have any evidence?!","Zuo Qingluan cried, “Feng Wu, why are you making this up? The crown prince is biased toward you, and so is the general. They’ll take anything you say seriously. If you want me dead, just say the word. Why do you have to put on such a show?”","Master Yun glared at Feng Wu. “I made the right choice by not taking you in as my disciple back then! So what if you’re talented? You’re so despicable that you’re doomed!”","“Qingluan, let’s go!” Master Yun was about to leave with Zuo Qingluan.","However, Feng Wu smiled at that moment.","“No one will stop you if you want to leave, Master Yun, but...","“Are you sure you don’t want to see something first?”","Before Master Yun could say anything, Feng Wu waved her hand, and a huge water curtain appeared in front of them.","Without waiting for anyone to ask, Feng Wu broadcasted what she had recorded with the Spiritual Fossil Stone.","She specifically picked out Zuo Qingluan’s section.","That conversation contained a lot of information.","Zuo Qingluan looked up and was dumbfounded.","How, how could this be..."]},{"number":3428,"title":"Chapter 3428: Spiritual Fossil Stone (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3428: Spiritual Fossil Stone (2)","Zuo Qingluan looked up and was dumbfounded.","How, how could this be...","She was completely stunned!","It was indeed a recording of the conversation between her and Feng Wu.","She had thought that she and Feng Wu were the only ones there, so she hadn’t been polite.","What did she say back then?","Zuo Qingluan’s mind went blank. She had no idea what to do.","Everyone’s attention was immediately drawn to the water screen.","Zuo Qingluan admitted that she was the one who had destroyed Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood.","Everyone stared at Zuo Qingluan.","“And you said you didn’t do anything?!","“You’ve admitted it yourself!”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","She really had no idea what was going on!","From that angle, the cameraman had to be in the cesspit!","There had been someone squatting in that huge cesspit?! Zuo Qingluan wanted to cry!","Everyone watched with interest. They even heard Zuo Qingluan call Master Yun an old witch...","“Ahem.. ” General Feng covered his mouth and pretended to be embarrassed. “Old witch... She’s really bold. Even us old fellows don’t dare to say it.”","Master Yun’s expression was very ugly.","The recording soon came to an end.","Feng Wu had only played a small section of the recording, but that was enough.","Zuo Qingluan had fallen to the ground, and everyone was looking at her strangely.","At that moment, Zuo Qingluan could tell that everyone was looking at her with disdain and ridicule, but after the initial shame, she was no longer afraid.","Master Yun felt extremely embarrassed!","She wanted to leave Zuo Qingluan behind and get away from this place.","Zuo Qingluan? How dare she call her an old witch behind her back? What was the point of having such a disciple? She was the type that would kill her master in the future!","However, it wasn’t Master Yun’s idea to bring Zuo Qingluan back, but the Matriarch’s.","General Feng wouldn’t let this matter go so easily.","He smirked. “I didn’t know it was you, Zuo Qingluan, who ruined Xiao Wu’s","True Phoenix Blood. Interesting, very interesting.”","Master Yun stood up and frowned. “It was just child’s play. Who knows if it’s true?”","Seeing that Master Yun was still defending Zuo Qingluan, General Feng smiled.","“No wonder your disciple called you an old witch. Look at you, you’re still","protecting her even after hearing what she said.”","Master Yun was so angry that her face turned red!","She wasn’t the one who wanted to save Zuo Qingluan.","“The Matriarch wants to bring her back.” Master Yun snorted coldly.","“If it’s your Matriarch’s request, we can spare her for the time being for being a spy,” Feng Xiangnan said. “But what about the fact that she destroyed Xiao Wu’s True Phoenix Blood?”","Master Yun stared at Feng Xiangnan. “Are you not going to show the Matriarch some respect? Don’t forget that the Matriarch is a peak expert of the Ancient God Era. Also...’","Master Yun stared at Feng Xiangnan. “The place where Firmament Palace was built used to belong to the Junwu Empire. Ever since the Matriarch woke up, we took that piece of land back from the Junwu Empire. Your emperor didn’t say anything about that. What do you want to say, General Feng?”","She sneered again. “The Firmament Palace doesn’t belong to the Junwu Empire. Even if Zuo Qingluan helps the Dongsang Kingdom, she’s not a spy.. You can’t humiliate her here!”"]},{"number":3429,"title":"Chapter 3429: Matriarch","paragraphs":["Chapter 3429: Matriarch","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The moment Master Yun said that, everyone was shocked!","WHAT?!","Firmament Palace had already left the Junwu Empire and become an independent territory?","Back then, the Dark Dynasty had also declared independence from the Junwu Empire. Was Firmament Palace going to do the same? General Feng’s expression turned ugly.","When Master Yun saw Feng Xiangnan’s face, she was rather pleased.","“Since Firmament Palace isn’t a subordinate of the Junwu Empire, we naturally don’t have to obey your orders!”","This was the first time Zuo Qingluan had heard the news, and she was thrilled.","In other words, her reputation as a spy had been cleared just like that. Had God finally begun to favor her?","Master Yun was still bragging to Feng Xiangnan about how impressive and awesome their Matriarch was...","Suddenly!","A figure flashed past her!","Zuo Qingluan screamed in frustration.","Everyone turned to look at Zuo Qingluan.","A tiny hole appeared on her forehead, and blood seeped out. Her eyes widened in disbelief!","“True Phoenix Blood!”","Master Yun let out a cry of surprise!","Everyone realized that the True Phoenix Blood between Zuo Qingluan’s evebrows had been dug out!","And the person who had done it was none other than Feng Wu.","Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood was in Feng Wu’s right hand!","Feng Wu was so fast that no one could react in time.","Oh god..","It was only at this moment that everyone finally understood what had happened.","While Master Yun and General Feng were talking, Feng Wu took advantage of the situation and dug Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood out from where it was buried between the brows.","Zuo Qingluan was bleeding profusely. She was trembling.","Moreover, her cultivation was declining at a visible speed.","Spiritual King, Spiritual Lord, Spiritual Elder...","Her cultivation level kept falling.","Flustered, Master Yun rushed up to Zuo Qingluan and tapped several spots on her body, hoping to delay the decline, but she couldn’t do it.","The decline of Zuo Qingluan’s cultivation level was due to the decline of her spiritual essence.","Right now, Zuo Qingluan was leaking like a deflating balloon.","Moreover, she was leaking from more than one spot.","Could Master Yun block hundreds of leaks?","In the end, Master Yun could only watch as Zuo Qingluan became a piece of trash with zero cultivation.","Just like how Feng Wu used to be.","“Feng Wu!” Master Yun stared at Feng Wu with bloodshot eyes.","The Matriarch had specifically asked for Zuo Qingluan, but she had been destroyed to such an extent. Master Yun didn’t know how to explain it to the Matriarch when she returned!","Feng Wu had a solemn look on her face.","There was no smile or sadness.","She looked at Zuo Qingluan and asked indifferently, “How does it feel to have your True Phoenix Blood destroyed?”","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu with a cold look in her eyes.","She wanted to kill Feng Wu!","She wanted to kill Feng Wu!","She wanted to kill Feng Wu!","Zuo Qingluan felt as if she had lost her mind. She wanted nothing more than to tear Feng Wu into pieces.","All of Zuo Qingluan’s feigned kindness and innocence was gone. All she could think of now was hatred!","Master Yun stared at Feng Wu. “Do you want to die?!”","Feng Wu said calmly, “I’m just giving someone a taste of their own medicine.”","Everyone looked at Zuo Qingluan and couldn’t help but think of an eight-year-old Feng Wu.."]},{"number":3430,"title":"Chapter 3430: True Phoenix Blood...","paragraphs":["Chapter 3430: True Phoenix Blood...","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","How helpless Feng Wu would have been then...","D*mn you, Zuo Qingluan!","Master Yun took a deep breath and gave Feng Wu a look before turning to Feng Xiangnan. “I’m taking her away.”","Master Yun pointed at Feng Wu.","Feng Xiangnan’s expression was no longer as nonchalant as before. He became much more serious.","He could deal with Master Yun, but if the Matriarch behind her really existed, it would be a huge problem.","As a matter of fact —","If Firmament Palace really became independent, the Matriarch probably existed.","Feng Xiangnan looked at Feng Wu in frustration.","This girl was really accurate and ruthless.","Fearing that she wouldn’t be able to take revenge if Zuo Qingluan was taken back, she attacked first.","Well...","He was her godfather, and it was his duty to protect her. General Feng was aware of this.","He stared at Master Yun. “No.”","Master Yun stared at Feng Xiangnan. “General Feng, do you need me to remind you? If my Matriarch turns to help the Dongsang Kingdom, what do you think will happen?”","Feng Xiangnan frowned.","After Master Yun finished threatening him, she stared at him. “I’ll take Feng Wu away and let the Matriarch deal with her. Once the Matriarch is appeased, everything will be fine. Otherwise, billions of people will be plunged into misery and suffering. Feng Xiangnan, can you bear the responsibility?!” Feng Xiangnan frowned.","He definitely wouldn’t let her take Feng Wu away, but that Matriarch of Firmament Palace wasn’t easy to handle either.","Just then, Jun Linyuan stood up.","“Let her come.” Jun Linyuan stared at Master Yun.","Master Yun didn’t know what to say. She stared at the crown prince in confusion.","Jun Linyuan walked up to Feng Wu and took her hand.","Master Yun’s expression instantly turned ugly!","Feng Wu was speechless.","Her hand was covered with blood. Didn’t Jun Linyuan mind holding it?","Why would he do that now?","Master Yun stared at Jun Linyuan. “What do you mean, Your Royal Highness?”","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes; his gaze was as sharp as blades!","Master Yun’s heart skipped a beat!","She hadn’t seen Jun Linyuan in years, but he was already as strong as she was.","She was the master of Firmament Palace!","“Whatever comes her way, I’ll take it!” Standing there, the teenager looked like a ruler of the continent!","master Yun gritted n1S teetn!","What was so attractive about Feng Wu? Why were there people all standing up for her?","“Great!” Master Yun sneered. “In that case, I’ll summon a projection of the Matriarch’s clone and let her decide. Don’t regret it!”","With that, Master Yun took out an incense burner and lit incense before bowing.","Three incense sticks burned, and smoke curled up —","Suddenly, the originally blue sky was covered in dark clouds!","It was as if the world was being controlled by an invincible being.","Whoosh!","A bolt of lightning struck!","Half of the general’s residence was destroyed!","Almost everyone turned pale.","Feng Xiangnan had set up a formation barrier around the general’s residence, but half of it had been destroyed by a bolt of lightning. What kind of terrifying power was this?!","Jun Linyuan felt the girl shudder, and he took a step forward to shield her.","He narrowed his eyes and stared at the lightning, then told Feng Wu, “I’m here.”","He didn’t say “I’ll protect you” or “I won’t let go of your hand.”","He simply said, “I’m here..”"]},{"number":3431,"title":"Chapter 3431: Am I Wrong?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3431: Am I Wrong?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu wasn’t one to be touched easily, but she somehow wanted to cry.","“Yes.” Feng Wu nodded.","Thunder continued to strike from the sky.","The black clouds in the sky rolled out like a large black bag!","There was only one last gap left.","If it closed up..","“Go.” Jun Linyuan pushed Feng Wu toward General Feng, while he leaped up toward the remaining gap!","The young man was furious. He pointed his sword at the sky and rushed into the surging black clouds.","The sharp sword energy swept through everything!","Endless killing intent stirred up a storm!","In the dark void, a huge hand suddenly appeared.","“Matriarch ! ”","A look of delight appeared on Master Yun’s face!","She had been suppressed by Jun Linyuan and Feng Xiangnan and had been powerless to fight back. Now, the Matriarch was finally here. How could these people compare to the strength of her Matriarch?","Jun Linyuan’s Sky Destroyer struck the giant hand!","General Feng, Mr. Lu, and Mr. Xu... All of them looked extremely grim!","With their strength, they could easily sense how powerful the other party was.","Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu looked at each other in awe.","“One strike.” Mr. Lu lowered his voice and said to Mr. Xu, “I won’t be able to take even one strike.”","Mr. Xu nodded silently. “Me neither.”","General Feng’s originally calm expression was now extremely solemn. His expression was even uglier than when he looked at Xue Zhibei.","At least he could fight Xue Zhibei; he couldn’t do anything to that palm.","General Feng didn’t think he could withstand two blows.","Boom!","Sky Destroyer and the palm collided in midair.","The palm pressed down as if it wanted to crush Sky Destroyer into dust.","The spiritual essence around them was in chaos!","The impact sent Jun Linyuan flying!","He landed next to Feng Wu.","However, he had cut the palm in half!","Feng Wu wrapped her arms around Jun Linyuan in a hurry, but Jun Linyuan was staring at the palm. General Feng felt a little relieved.","How amazing!","His strength had increased by another level.","Fortunately, the giant palm was split apart. Otherwise...","Master Yun’s expression was extremely ugly!","How could an ancient god like the Matriarch be injured?","Although the Matriarch wasn’t here in person, and it was only a projection of her, how could Jun Linyuan cut it in half?!","Just as everyone was feeling bewildered, the palm that had been split open fused back together as they watched, and was soon intact again.","Moreover, this time, a golden layer glowed around it.","Had Jun Linyuan made another breakthrough?","An ancient and distant voice sounded in the depths of everyone’s minds.","“Young man, I’ve underestimated you.","“With such thin spiritual essence, it’s really rare that you can make such a breakthrough.","“But you’re disobedient.”","The female voice seemed to come from an ancient time, but it didn’t sound old.","“I’ll take only her and let you go.” With that, the palm reached for Feng Wu!","“Go to hell!”","Gripping Sky Destroyer tightly, Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything else and charged into the air again!","No one expected Jun Linyuan to be so brave!","Endless spiritual essence gathered around Sky Destroyer, ready to kill.","The voice rang out regretfully.","“I didn’t want to kill you, but you insisted.” The Matriarch almost sounded sincere.."]},{"number":3432,"title":"Chapter 3432: Ancient God","paragraphs":["Chapter 3432: Ancient God","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Matriarch almost sounded sincere.","But in the end, she still attacked.","“Young man, pay the price for your stupidity,” said the Matriarch. However, Jun Linyuan’s expression remained grim and unaffected.","“The Matriarch? You talk too much!”","No one had expected Jun Linyuan to say that.","The Matriarch was also shocked. “Disappear!”","Jun Linyuan roared like a dragon!","As he roared, Sky Destroyer borrowed the power of heaven and earth and pointed at the palm!","Thunderclaps and a huge explosion resounded in the sky.","Both Nest and Sun Castle felt the impact.","In Sun Castle, Xue Zhibei was furious.","Feng Xiangnan had been severely injured, and he was about to launch an all-out attack. However, all his fighter jets were gone. How could he not be angry?","Xue Zhibei lashed out at Mr. Sakiya, and the scolding had yet to stop.","Hearing the thunderous commotion outside, Xue Zhibei walked out of the house.","Mr. Sakiya followed him.","The two of them stared in the direction of Nest Fortress.","“It’s over there.” Mr. Sakiya frowned. “Something major seems to have happened at Nest Fortress.”","Xue Zhibei placed his hands behind his back, his long sleeves almost touching the ground.","He stared at the black clouds and frowned. After thinking for a moment, he finally said, “It’s an ancient aura.”","“The legendary Ancient God stage cultivator?!” Mr. Sakiya looked at Xue Zhibei in surprise.","Xue Zhibei nodded.","Mr. Sakiya said, “An Ancient God stage cultivator... Prime Minister Chu is at that stage, too. A cultivator that has lived that long is a disaster for us.” Xue Zhibei smiled. “What if it’s only targeting the Junwu Empire?”","Mr. Sakiya looked at Xue Zhibei in confusion.","Xue Zhibei rubbed his chin and fell into deep thought.","From the looks of it, this formidable cultivator with the aura of an ancient god was only targeting the Junwu Empire. Sun Castle seemed to be unaffected.","Should he take the opportunity to launch a sneak attack?","Xue Zhibei immediately summoned the two guardians and Mr. Sakiya to speed toward Nest.","They would soon reach Nest after passing through the Dayless Woods.","Xue Zhibei waved his hand, and the three people behind him immediately stopped.","At this moment, the demon kings in the Dayless Woods were trembling under the aura of the ancient god. They didn’t dare to raise their heads.","The Sacred Imperial Spider saw Xue Zhibei pass through its forest and head toward Nest.","The Peacock Demon King was visiting the spider and saw this scene as well.","The two demon kings looked at each other in astonishment.","Nest was under attack by an Ancient God stage cultivator and capable members of Sun Castle. Was the fortress doomed?","Both demon kings were worried about Feng Wu’s fate.","At the same time...","Everyone in Nest Fortress felt intimidated by the dark clouds.","Elder Dongfang and Elder Helian didn’t know what was going on. They went to look for the heads of their schools, but they couldn’t find them, so they rushed to look for the general.","They found the gate wide open, and all the high-ranking officials were inside.","If the giant palm landed, the entire fortress would be instantly destroyed.","In an instant, the two elders’ expressions were ugly to the extreme, and they were also extremely terrified!","They were filled with terror.","A chill ran down their spines.."]},{"number":3433,"title":"Chapter 3433: Where’s Zuo (ingluan?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3433: Where’s Zuo (ingluan?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, they saw the injured Jun Linyuan soar into the sky, cursing loudly.","“Shut your mouth!”","Upon hearing this, Elder Dongfang, Elder Helian, Xue Zhibei and Feng Xiangnan all looked at Jun Linyuan in astonishment.","He was so bold!","Wasn’t he afraid of the Matriarch?","There was a strange look on Xue Zhibei’s face.","Dark clouds covered the sky, and the air was filled with murderous intent. If Jun Linyuan couldn’t stop that hand, Nest would be destroyed, and it would be the best time for Xue Zhibei to attack.","To everyone’s surprise, Jun Linyuan put away his Sky Destroyer at the most critical moment and punched the giant palm!","Just one punch!","The spiritual essence was chaotic, and the entire world seemed to be on the verge of collapse!","Xue Zhibei’s expression was extremely ugly.","That punch...","Jun Linyuan was so powerful!","After he was injured last time, his strength could still improve!","Was he even human?!","Xue Zhibei looked up at the vast sky. The giant palm that could decide the life and death of countless people seemed to explode in an instant, turning into specks of light..","He was astonished.","That was an ancient god!","How did Jun Linyuan do that?","“Let’s go.” Xue Zhibei took a deep breath and left with a dark expression.","He didn’t want to watch anymore.","That was because Jun Linyuan was able to make a breakthrough on the spot after destroying the giant palm with one punch. How could anyone believe that?","Anyway, General Xue Zhibei couldn’t stand it anymore.","Mr. Sakiya could understand the general’s complicated emotions since he didn’t wish for this to happen either.","His crown prince was still bedridden. Not only was Jun Linyuan alive and kicking, he had also made another breakthrough. How did that happen?","Master Yun looked at the scene in disbelief.","Jun Linyuan had destroyed the Matriarch’s projection with one punch?","Although it was a projected wisp of the Matriarch’s aura, it was enough to kill experts of the current era!","But the palm was destroyed just like that!","Seeing Jun Linyuan sit down cross-legged and start cultivating, Master Yun was speechless.","She didn’t know what to say, but she still had to say something.","“You...” Master Yun’s expression darkened. “Don’t think that you’ve won the battle. That was only a wisp of my Matriarch’s aura. It was just a projection! If she was here in person, you wouldn’t have been able to withstand a single strike!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything, but Feng Wu smirked. “Then why isn’t your Matriarch here in person? Tell her to come here!” Master Yun glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was baffled. Had she said something wrong?","General Feng patted Feng Wu on the head and explained in resignation, “That Matriarch hasn’t fully awakened yet, has she? That’s why she can only project a wisp of her aura to carry out her tyrannical deeds.”","Master Yun’s expression turned uglier.","What did he mean by tyrannical deeds?!","However, Feng Xiangnan was right. The Matriarch hadn’t completely revived.","That was why Jun Linyuan could destroy the palm. Just then, Feng Xun cried out, “Hey, where’s Zuo Qingluan?!”","Everyone turned to where Zuo Qingluan had been lying.","Zuo Qingluan was nowhere to be seen.","Where did she go?"]},{"number":3434,"title":"Chapter 3434: It’s All My Fault","paragraphs":["Chapter 3434: It’s All My Fault","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Yun smirked. “My matriarch has boundless power and is omnipotent. She took Zuo Qingluan away. Do you have a problem with that?”","General Feng was speechless.","She was the famous master of Firmament Palace and was used to getting things her way. Why was she acting in a fit of pique?","In fact, Master Yun was indeed being spiteful.","She wouldn’t accept the fact that the projection of her Matriarch had been destroyed.","This meant that unless the Matriarch personally took action...","Master Yun couldn’t do anything to Jun Linyuan anymore.","In the end, Master Yun gave Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu a meaningful look in turn and was about to leave.","However, General Feng asked Feng Wu, “Do you want her to leave?”","Master Yun was shocked!","What was that supposed to mean?","She was the master of Firmament Palace. Who could stop her if she wanted to leave?","General Feng asked again, “Are we done with Zuo Qingluan yet? When a student makes a mistake, it’s always the master’s fault. If you haven’t vented your anger yet, Zuo Qingluan’s master is still around.”","Master Yun was furious!","She was frustrated. Were these people all so daring? Weren’t they afraid of her Matriarch? When the Matriarch fully recovered... Master Yun sneered inwardly. When that happened, the Junwu Empire would no longer have the final say!","Seeing Jun Linyuan’s pale face, Feng Wu blamed herself.","Earlier, she destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood and drew the attention of the Firmament Palace’s Matriarch, which had almost caused immeasurable consequences...","Feng Wu shook her head. “Zuo Qingluan destroyed my True Phoenix Blood back then, and I’ve done the same to her today. I’ve settled the score.”","After a pause, Feng Wu added, “But if Zuo Qingluan wants to take revenge, we’ll deal with her later.”","General Feng nodded approvingly. He liked how his daughter could draw a line when it came to her emotions.","“You can leave now.” General Feng nodded at Master Yun.","Master Yun was infuriated.","She and General Feng were equal in terms of strength and social status. Neither should order the other one around, but General Feng had used such a condescending tone.","Master Yun turned around and was about to retort, but she then saw Jun","Linyuan, who was making a breakthrough, and all the other masters of Nest.","She was so angry that she laughed. “Very well, General Feng, since you insist on protecting her, then protect her to the end!","“When the time comes, I hope you won’t be too surprised which side Firmament Palace will choose!","‘I also hope that you won’t regret your choice!”","With that said, Master Yun turned around and left. Soon, she disappeared from sight.","She was heading toward Sun Castle.","Mr. Xu frowned deeply and looked at General Feng with concern. “General Feng, Master Yun is going...”","Frustrated, Feng Wu took a deep breath and reflected on herself. “Father, it’s all because of me...’","What Master Yun said before she left was quite sly.","What she meant was that Firmament Palace would support Sun Castle because General Feng and Jun Linyuan had chosen to protect Feng Wu.","That put Feng Wu at a disadvantage.","Firmament Palace was already very powerful, and the Matriarch was also recovering. Feng Wu felt a headache coming on.."]},{"number":3435,"title":"Chapter 3435: Protect Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Chapter 3435: Protect Feng Wu","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What Master Yun said before she left was quite sly.","What she meant was that Firmament Palace would support Sun Castle because General Feng and Jun Linyuan had chosen to protect Feng Wu.","General Feng waved his hand. “Even if none of this had happened, do you think","Firmament Palace would have helped the Junwu Empire?”","Everyone thought of Master Yun’s arrogant attitude and shook their heads.","General Feng added, “Zuo Qingluan is the sacred lady of Firmament Palace. It might not have been her own decision to help the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu nodded slightly.","General Feng said, “From what I see, Firmament Palace probably planned this a long time ago.”","After that, General Feng turned to Feng Wu and gave her a wry smile. “So, Firmament Palace has already chosen its side. What does it have to do with you? It’s just that...”","General Feng frowned. “The only thing I need to worry about is that since you’ve destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s ability, Firmament Palace and the Zuo family will do you harm.”","Feng Wu said, “I’m not afraid of them.”","Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan opened his eyes and stared at Feng Wu. He said calmly, “I’m here.”","The simple reply was very reassuring.","General Feng nodded and said to Jun Linyuan in a serious tone, “Take good care of Xiao Wu from now on.”","The crown prince said, “Yes.”","General Feng said, “She can’t leave your sight!”","The crown prince said, “Yes.”","General Feng said, “Don’t give anyone any chance to get to her.”","The crown prince said, “Yes.”","Everyone gave Jun Linyuan strange IOOKS.","He was an early-stage Spirit Saint... No, he was already an intermediate-stage Spirit Saint and the crown prince of the empire. Why was he so happy to be a bodyguard for a girl?","That wasn’t like Jun Linyuan at all!","Feng Wu waved him off. “Don’t bother. I don’t need anyone to protect me. I can protect myself.”","General Feng rolled his eyes at Feng Wu. “Can you? Can you even get away from a Spiritual Saint?”","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","With her current strength, she couldn’t even handle a Spiritual Overlord, let alone a Spiritual Saint.","Feng Wu said, “I don’t think a Spiritual Overlord will come after me, right? I’ve settled the score with Zuo Qingluan. We’re even now. Why would a Spiritual Overlord...’","General Feng glanced at Feng Wu. “You have no idea how petty the people of Firmament Palace are!”","General Feng didn’t say anything else. He told Jun Linyuan in a serious tone, “If anything happens to this girl, I’ll hold you responsible!” Who would dare speak to Jun Linyuan in that tone?","Even Emperor Wu couldn’t do that.","However, the crown prince took a step closer to Feng Wu and nodded. “Alright.” Feng Wu looked resigned.","She truly believed that she and Zuo Qingluan were even. No matter how unreasonable Firmament Palace was, they wouldn’t hunt her down.","Mr. Lu cleared his throat and reminded General Feng, “Xue Zhibei was here just now.”","General Feng nodded in resignation. Of course he knew that.","Feng Wu didn’t, so she was shocked.","Xue Zhibei... Wasn’t he the general who was even more powerful than her godfather? He seemed to be even more powerful than Jun Linyuan. If he came...","Feng Wu was shocked.","She looked at Jun Linyuan!","Xue Zhibei must have heard the commotion and rushed over.","If Jun Linyuan hadn’t broken the giant palm and had been suppressed by it instead, would Xue Zhibei have taken the opportunity to attack Nest?","Feng Wu knew the answer was definitely yes!"]},{"number":3436,"title":"Chapter 3436: Making Things Difficult","paragraphs":["Chapter 3436: Making Things Difficult","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s heart raced at the thought of how close Nest had been to destruction!","That was close.","It was all thanks to Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu looked at him gratefully.","Standing there proudly, he was slender and handsome. His side profile was deep and sharp, like an unsheathed sword. He looked extremely arrogant as he looked forward, but he gave one a sense of security.","When Feng Wu got back, she could hear the exclamations.","Everyone was discussing what happened today.","Before Feng Wu could figure out what was going on, Feng Xun arrived.","“Xiao Wii!”","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder.","The sight of Feng Xun gave her a headache. Something must have happened again, or Feng Xun wouldn’t be in such a hurry.","“You won’t believe it!”","Sure enough, Feng Xun started talking before he reached her.","Feng Wu looked at him in resignation. “What happened now?”","Feng Xun said, “I was trying to calm them down. When I reached the portal, I saw Feng coming back, so I asked him why he returned. Guess what happened?”","Feng Wu asked, “Is it about the crown prince’s residence and Bao Er?”","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu in surprise. “How did you know?” Feng Wu smacked her head.","How could she have forgotten such an important thing?","She had the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid that she had stolen from Sun Castle.","It had belonged to Night Owl, but Feng Wu had stolen it and kept it for Bao Er. However, she had been so busy recently that she had forgotten about it.","She hadn’t told anyone about it, not even Jun Linyuan.","“What happened to Bao Er?” Feng Wu asked in a hurry.","“She’s not well. She may only has a few days left...”","Before Feng Xun could finish, Feng Wu ran toward Jun Linyuan’s yard.","“Boss Jun must be back in the empire by now,” Feng Xun shouted after her.","Without another word, Feng Wu headed for the portal.","She turned around and told Feng Xun, “Tell my godfather that I’m going back to the imperial capital!”","Feng Wu went straight to the portal.","At this moment, there was a row of people standing at the teleportation gate.","“Stop!”","It was a Level 5 Spiritual King who stopped Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “I’m going to the imperial capital now.”","The Spiritual King stared at Feng Wu with a stern face and shook his head arrogantly. “No.”","Feng Wu frowned. Saving a life was the most important thing, but she was stuck here.","“I’m going to the imperial capital.” Feng Wu raised her voice.","The Spiritual King darted a look at Feng Wu. “The portal only opens once a month. Don’t you know that?”","Feng Wu asked, “When will it open again? The Spiritual King said coldly, “Next month. Please leave.”","Feng Wu stared at him in displeasure.","The man was from the Military Academy, so he didn’t take Feng Wu seriously. He smirked. “The crown prince just used the portal, so the next time it opens will be in a month. Do you have a problem with that?”","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","Just as the saying went, those who wielded a small amount of power were the hardest to deal with.","“Just tell me what it takes to open the portal.” Feng Wu stared at him.","The Spiritual King said, “That’s not easy, unless Elder Helian and Elder","Dongfang agree to your request.”","Feng Wu asked, “Does Jun Linyuan need that, too?”","“Of course not. The crown prince has the authority.” The man gave Feng Wu a sidelong glance and snorted.."]},{"number":3437,"title":"Chapter 3437: Big Shot","paragraphs":["Chapter 3437: Big Shot","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The man gave Feng Wu a sidelong glance and snorted. “Of course, it would be even better if you could get the general’s token. Unfortunately, you can’t.” He was the one who let the new students in not long ago.","So, he remembered very clearly that Feng Wu was a freshman of Imperial College.","A mere freshman dared to ask him to open the portal and let her go back on her own? What a joke!","However...","The gatekeeper didn’t expect Feng Wu to throw a token at him.","He hurriedly caught it to take a look!","“That’s...","The general’s entry token?!","“That’s impossible!” The guard stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “Are you saying the token is fake?”","In order to make it easier to walk around Nest, Feng Wu had asked the general to give her a token.","To Feng Wu, it was only a matter of saying a few words to her father, but to the gatekeeper, it was unbelievable!","The token had to be real because no one could fake the general’s aura.","However, the gatekeeper couldn’t figure out why this freshman...","Seeing that he was staring at her arm, Feng Wu thought of something and revealed her epaulet.","“A colonel?!”","The gatekeeper’s eyes widened!","What was going on?","This freshman of Imperial College had only been at Nest for a few months, but she had already become a colonel!","“Your military rank..” The guard wanted to ask if she had stolen the badge, but he couldn’t bring himself to say the words.","Feng Wu asked, “What?” The gatekeeper asked, “Is it real?” Feng Wu was speechless.","At this moment, a person walked over quickly.","“Elder Dongfang?”","The gatekeeper was from the Military Academy and was a lieutenant colonel, so he was very respectful when he saw Elder Dongfang.","Elder Dongfang stared at Feng Wu.","She said coldly, “The general knows that you’re in a hurry to return to Imperial College. He’s worried that the guards will make things difficult for you, so he asked me to see you off.”","The gatekeeper was speechless.","Was the general personally looking after Feng Wu?","Feng Wu nodded and looked grim.","The guard was very puzzled. Elder Dongfang had personally come here to give instructions, but this freshman of Imperial College didn’t kneel down in gratitude. He was a little confused.","Elder Dongfang said solemnly, “You’re very important to Nest. After you return to the crown prince’s residence, you must rush back as soon as possible.” Feng Wu nodded.","Elder Dongfang turned to the gatekeeper. “What are you looking at? Open the portal and see Miss Feng Wu off!”","Miss Feng wu...","With his boss glaring at him, the gatekeeper didn’t dare say another word. He immediately opened the portal and walked Miss Feng Wu out.","After some thought, Feng Wu waved her hand, and ten fighter jets flew out of her space and landed on the ground.","She said calmly, “Please use these fighter jets as soon as possible. The","Dongsang Kingdom will soon develop a second generation.”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was already working on a second-generation fighter jet herself.","However, she had been too busy recently. There was Bao Er’s case, and Firmament Palace would probably come looking for trouble soon.","Feng Wu soon disappeared through the portal.","Elder Dongfang ordered people to take the fighter jets back.."]},{"number":3438,"title":"Chapter 3438: Assassination (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3438: Assassination (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The gatekeeper was dumbfounded.","General Feng, the crown prince’s residence, the fighter jets, and Elder Dongfang... None of them were things that ordinary people could come into contact with.","He had thought that Feng Wu was a newbie, but she turned out to be a big shot!","Feng Wu didn’t know that her casual actions had shocked someone so much, but even if she did, she wouldn’t have cared.","After exiting the portal, she hurried to the crown prince’s residence.","She didn’t stop moving.","Moreover, she only chose remote paths since a straight line was the shortest","route.","Just as Feng Wu was about to fly past Dark Cloud Alley and turn into East Main Street, something happened!","She felt the extreme danger of being targeted!","Instinctively, Feng Wu rolled over the wall.","Thud! Thud!","Arrows rained down!","As Feng Wu rolled, countless arrows pierced the ground!","If Feng Wu hadn’t reacted in time, she would have turned into a porcupine!","Who could it be?!","Feng Wu’s face darkened.","She had just returned from Nest and couldn’t even make it back to her house before she was ambushed.","Who the hell was it?","Before Feng Wu could figure it out, the first wave of sharpshooters retreated, and a group of men in black lunged at her!","Feng Wu stared at them.","They were rather capable.","They were all Level 3 and Level 4 Spiritual Kings, and all of them were good fighters.","However, had they underestimated her?","If they were sent by someone in Nest, they would have known that she was already a Level 6 Spiritual King. There was no way they would send Level 3 and Level 4 Spiritual Kings to assassinate her.","These people would never get the job done.","Therefore, Feng Wu was instantly certain that the person who was trying to assassinate her wasn’t an enemy in Nest, but someone from the imperial capital.","Without hesitation, Feng Wu drew her Fallen Star Sword.","“Die!”","Dozens of Level 3 and Level 4 Spiritual Kings were killed instantly.","The leader of those men hiding in the dark froze.","He stared at Feng Wu with wide eyes.","This shouldn’t be.","Wasn’t Feng Wu a Level 2 Spiritual King?!","Many people knew that Feng Wu had become a Level 2 Spiritual King during the battle between Imperial College and the Military Academy.","Hence, the leader had planned an assassination based on that knowledge, but now, his men were in such a sorry state.","A Level 6 Spiritual King... Was she even human?","In just a few months, she had become a Level 6 Spiritual King!","How did she make such fast progress?","However...","The leader himself was a peak Level 7 Spiritual King.","A sneer appeared on the leader’s face.","Feng Wu wasn’t going anywhere.","She couldn’t leave.","A whip lashed out at Feng Wu like a snake!","It happened so fast that no one else would have reacted in time.","Luckily, Feng Wu was on guard, so she leaned to the side to avoid the whip.","By the time Feng Wu stood up, the leader was already pointing the black whip at her.","“Have you been lying in ambush here ever since I entered Nest?” Feng Wu looked at him curiously.","The leader stared at Feng Wu coldly.","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t anyone tell you that I’m a Level 6 Spiritual King now?","“Why is your information so outdated?” Feng Wu found it hard to believe. The leader felt as if Feng Wu had slapped him again and again!"]},{"number":3439,"title":"Chapter 3439: Assassination (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3439: Assassination (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Die!”","Like a snake, the black whip lashed out at Feng Wu mercilessly!","The hideous black whip looked like a dragon with its mouth open as it went for Feng Wii!","Feng Wu smirked.","“A peak Level 7 Spiritual King? That’s impressive!”","Feng Wu used her three powerful stances one after another.","After seven moves, the leader was shocked!","Wasn’t Feng Wu a Level 6 Spiritual King?","Why couldn’t he defeat her after so long even though he was a peak Level 7 Spiritual King?","The whip couldn’t even touch her clothes.","Boom!","The whip exploded, and a streak of fire shot toward Feng Wu!","The explosion swept through everything!","Feng Wu backed away at once!","But she was too close to the explosion, and her head was spinning from the blast.","The leader blew up his favorite weapon, which was a major move.","Seeing Feng Wu was dazed, the leader attacked!","“Die!”","Clenching his fist, he punched at Feng Wu!","His fist whistled through the air.","It was like a huge wave on the sea or a storm sweeping over.","Feng Wu was hit in the stomach!","Her abdomen caved in, and blood rushed up her throat.","Ouch...","Feng Wu spat out a mouthful of blood.","The leader was ecstatic to see Feng Wu throw up blood.","Boom!","He threw another punch at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was hit again, and she flew backward.","Boom!","She smashed into a wall, which collapsed and fell on her.","That had to be painful as hell...","An indescribable pain washed over Feng Wu. She struggled to get up, only to find that she had no strength left.","What should she do?","Feng Wu remembered that there were still a few bombs in her storage space.","She had taken them from the Dongsang Kingdom. She didn’t use them up and had kept them there.","The leader’s two punches smashed Feng Wu down, and she was unable to get up. He smirked when he saw this.","“I can’t believe that a Level 6 Spiritual King is so weak. Feng Wu, I overestimated you.”","The leader sneered.","Feng Wu couldn’t help but recall that Mr. Lu had told her the same thing.","Mr. Lu hadn’t built a good foundation and had become rather vulnerable as he cultivated. He was also seriously ill at the moment.","Feng Wu took a deep breath. Indeed, after this incident, she needed to start enhancing her own body.","The leader stood in front of Feng Wu and stared down at her with a cold, mocking look in his eyes.","He threw a punch at Feng Wu’s heart!","Feng Wu had been gathering her strength. When the leader threw his punch, Feng Wu threw the bomb at him!","As for herself, she used the momentum and flew back again.","Never in his wildest dreams could the man have imagined that Feng Wu would have such a lethal bomb in her hands.","Only the Dongsang Kingdom had this type of bomb, and the Junwu Empire hadn’t mastered this technology, so it was normal that the leader hadn’t seen it before.","Boom!","There was an explosion.","The bomb couldn’t kill him and could only injure him. Feng Wu knew that she only had one chance!","“Die!”","She drew Fallen Star Sword and used her most powerful moves.","The tip of the sword stabbed the man between his eyebrows.","The leader struggled to break free from the explosion, only to see the glinting blade. By the time he reacted, the sword tip was already pressed to his forehead.."]},{"number":3440,"title":"Chapter 3440: Assassination (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3440: Assassination (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He stared in disbelief at Feng Wu, who was only a meter away from him.","Feng Wu’s face was pale and she was covered in blood. However, she was determined to pour all her energy into the sword!","The leader wanted to speak, but he couldn’t say a word.","“Who sent you?” Feng Wu stared at him and asked in a cold voice.","The leader opened his mouth and wanted to speak, but blood gushed out.","“Who is it?” Feng Wu sprinkled some truth serum on his face.","He didn’t have much time left. She wanted to get as much information as she could.","The leader was still stubborn at first. He sneered. “Why would I tell you it was Zuo...”","Before he could finish the name, an arrow tore through the air.","It pierced the back of the man’s head!","The leader slowly dropped to his knees.","He was completely dead.","Feng Wu looked in the direction of the arrow.","Seeing Feng Wu’s pale face, the archer was about to walk out of his hiding place. Feng Wu could even see his black combat boots!","She was alarmed.","She had suffered two punches and was now suffering from serious internal injuries.","Although she had poured a Semi-Divine potion down her mouth, such serious injuries couldn’t be healed in a short time.","Feng Wu could feel that her dantian had almost shattered, and it was recovering slowly.","Just now, she had taken a very big risk to finally kill the leader of the black men. Right now, she was so exhausted that she couldn’t even draw her sword.","Even an ordinary person could kill her, let alone a cultivator.","The man in the dark kept his eyes on Feng Wu. He had no idea what was going on with her.","After all, he hadn’t expected Feng Wu to kill a Level 7 Spiritual King.","He was waiting for Feng Wu to fall...","However, at that moment!","He suddenly felt he was in grave danger.","A look of frustration appeared on his face!","He was vexed that he didn’t make a move earlier; now, he had lost this chance.","He didn’t make any unnecessary movements and instantly disappeared from the spot.","“Miss wu —","Feng appeared next to Feng Wu.","The man who had wanted to assassinate Feng Wu had already disappeared.","“Miss Xiao Wu?” Seeing how pale Feng Wu’s face was and the blood on her chest, Feng was startled.","He was about to go after that person!","Seeing the steward, Feng Wu felt that she was safe and spat out a mouthful of blood.","God knew that she had long wanted to do that, confronting the person hiding in the dark, she I support herself and didn’t show any signs of serious injuries.","If she had revealed any trace of an injury earlier...","She would probably be dead by now.","Feng caught Feng Wu in a hurry. “Did someone try to kill you?!”","The steward was vexed.","Although he had expected it at the beginning, he didn’t think Firmament Palace would take action so soon. Feng Wu had just walked out of the portal.","Feng Wu spat out a mouthful of blood and felt much better.","She asked Feng, “Are you here for me?","Feng nodded.","Feng Wu asked, “Is Bao Er seriously ill?”","Feng nodded. “His Royal Highness didn’t want to trouble you, but Bao Er’s condition is too serious, so he asked me to pick you up at Nest. I didn’t expect...’ He didn’t expect someone to try and assassinate Feng Wu along the way.","“Who was it?” Feng frowned. Feng Wu smiled.. “Who do you think?”"]},{"number":3441,"title":"Chapter 3441: Assassination (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3441: Assassination (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The steward didn’t say anything, but there weren’t many families that could send a Level 7 Spiritual King.","Feng Wu said, “Let’s not talk about that. We should go.”","Seeing how pale Feng Wu was and how unsteady she was on her feet, the steward was very worried.","“Didn’t you say that Bao Er is in serious condition?” Feng Wu smiled wryly. “But you’ll have to get me a carriage. I don’t think I can make it to the crown prince’s residence on foot.”","!!","Feng wanted to ask Feng Wu if she could handle it.","But seeing the girl’s persistence and thinking about Bao Er’s condition, the steward nodded and ordered his men to get a carriage ready.","As for himself, he didn’t dare leave Feng Wu’s side.","The steward remembered clearly that the crown prince had said that he would protect Feng Wu, but now she had almost been assassinated. His Royal Highness would be furious.","He wondered which family was so bold. Weren’t they afraid of death?","Feng Wu got into the carriage and began to treat herself.","Fortunately, she still had some healing medicine on her.","In fact, the Immortal Spiritual Fruit medicinal liquid would help her internal injuries a lot, but Feng Wu didn’t use a single drop. She only used her own medicine.","The journey from Black Cloud Alley to the crown prince’s residence took half an hour since they were traveling by carriage.","Feng Wu had already recovered from her external injuries, but her internal injuries weren’t healing so quickly. The slightest movement of her spiritual essence was enough to make her head hurt.","Before getting out of the carriage, Feng Wu took a look at her dirty clothes and changed into another set.","By the time she got out of the carriage, apart from her pale face, she looked almost normal.","Outside the crown prince’s residence, Feng Wu saw rows of ceremonial guards.","They were the ceremonial guards of the empress dowager, Empress Dugu and Princess Jun Wuxia.","Feng frowned. “I was only gone for a short while. Are the empress dowager and the others here already?”","The crown prince liked peace and quiet. Normally, he wouldn’t let anyone disturb Bao Er’s peace. Was Bao Er already...","Apart from them, there were also other carriages and horses.","“The Hua family is here too?” The steward frowned even more.","Feng Wu asked, “The Hua family?”","Feng told Feng Wu, “The eldest princess’s husband was a member of the Hua family, but from a branch family. It’s quite complicated, but the Hua family isn’t easy to get along with. Miss Wu, just ignore them.”","Feng Wu nodded. She was almost too weak to even save Bao Er, let alone care about anything else.","However, before Feng Wu could reach the golden house that Jun Linyuan had specially built for Bao Er, someone stopped her at the door.","“Hey, hey, stop!”","Standing in the backyard, Jun Wuxia frowned at Feng Wu. “Who are you? This isn’t a place for you. Get lost! ” Feng frowned. “Princess Wuxia...”","Jun Wuxia waved her hand. “Feng, you’re an experienced steward. Don’t you know what’s important? Can’t you see what’s happening now? Why are you still letting people in? Aren’t you afraid that my brother, the crown prince, will cut your head off?!”","The steward’s face darkened.","He was about to speak, when there was a voice from inside, as if someone was asking what the noise was about.","Both Feng and Feng Wu recognized the empress dowager’s voice.","They had to pass through the door of the backyard to reach the exquisite golden palace, which meant that Feng Wu had been stopped outside.","“Let her in,” the empress dowager said impatiently.","With a cold face, Feng led Feng Wu in.."]},{"number":3442,"title":"Chapter 3442: Kick Her Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3442: Kick Her Out","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Wuxia tried to stop her, but Feng Wu bumped into her as she walked past the princess.","Although Feng Wu was injured, she was still a Level 6 Spiritual King, and her aura alone was much stronger than Jun Wuxia’s. Therefore, she could easily brush past Jun Wuxia.","“Ah!”","Jun Wuxia cried out in pain and flew backward. She fell into the flowerbed and couldn’t pull herself out.","!!","Feng Wu walked into the backyard, and everyone looked at her.","The empress dowager sat at the head of the table, and next to her was Empress Dugu. Opposite her was an old lady with gray hair and a walking stick.","The old lady seemed to be in good spirits, and her eyes were as sharp as blades and as cold as ice. Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine when she saw the look in her eyes.","What a powerful old lady. Her strength was extraordinary!","From what Feng Wu could tell, the old lady was much stronger than she was.","Seeing that Feng Wu was about to walk in, the empress dowager looked disgusted.","“Stop!” the empress dowager bellowed.","Feng Wu pretended not to hear her and kept walking.","The empress dowager’s face fell. She was the empress dowager, and no one had ever disobeyed her like that. How dare someone disrespect her?!","Before the maid next to the empress dowager could say anything, the old lady sitting next to the empress dowager rose to her feet.","No one knew how she moved.","Feng Wu’s vision blurred, and before she knew it, the old lady was standing in front of her.","“Young lady, please wait.”","Feng Wu sensed a murderous look in the old lady’s eyes.","There was a sharp pain in her head.","Feng Wu’s face turned even paler, and she unconsciously rubbed her temples.","Feng was already there. He stared at the old lady. “Mrs. Hua, are you trying to make things difficult for Miss Feng Wu?” Mrs. Hua?","Was it the Hua family that Feng had mentioned?","Heartless Valley’s Hua Family?","From the looks of it, the Hua family of Heartless Valley wasn’t all that heartless.","Mrs. Hua didn’t expect Feng to intervene.","She Imew how capable the steward was, but she didn’t expect him to get involved in this matter.","“Feng, the empress dowager is here.” Mrs. Hua threatened him.","The girl who had been standing behind Mrs. Hua stepped forward and stood next to her. She was taller than Feng Wu, and raised her chin and gave Feng Wu a condescending look.","“Who’s this girl? Doesn’t she know where she is? Why didn’t she bow to the empress dowager? Offending the empress dowager is a serious crime!” “Hua Wushuang, you’ve finally said something that makes sense.” That was Jun Wuxia, who had been pulled out of the flowerbed by a maid and eunuch.","She hadn’t liked Hua Wushuang at first because Hua Wushuang was so much like Zuo Qingluan. She was just as proud and as cold as Zuo Qingluan.","Mrs. Hua confronted the steward, while Hua Wushuang and Jun Wuxia blocked Feng Wu’s way.","Feng Wu had only recovered 20% or 30% of her strength after being injured by the assassin. She was only able to stand here now because of her determination; she really didn’t have the strength to argue with others.","“Get out of here! You’re not welcome here Jun Wuxia glared at Feng Wu and said in a nasty tone, “Kick her out!”","The empress dowager and Empress Dugu didn’t move or speak. They just stared at Feng Wu coldly.."]},{"number":3443,"title":"Chapter 3443: His Majesty","paragraphs":["Chapter 3443: His Majesty","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The surrounding servants acted according to their masters’ wishes.","The empress dowager looked as if she was acquiescing, and the servants understood her meaning.","Hence, before their masters said anything, two eunuchs went up and tried to drag Feng Wu out.","!!","Feng had always been a good-natured man, but at this moment, he was truly furious.","“His Royal Highness invited Miss Feng Wu to treat Princess Bao Er,” the steward said as he gestured at Granny Gong.","At his signal, Granny Gong turned around and headed for the door.","Feng turned back to the empress dowager. ‘Your Majesty, if we delay Miss Bao Er’s treatment and His Royal Highness loses his temper, no one will be able to take responsibility!”","That was very harsh.","The empress dowager was a little shocked.","Feng had always been by Jun Linyuan’s side and was on good terms with Emperor Wu, but he hadn’t had much dealings with the empress dowager. She hadn’t expected him to be so intimidating when he was angry.","In any case, the empress dowager was a little frightened.","What was wrong with this world? How could a steward lecture the empress dowager?","The empress dowager wasn’t the only one who was shocked. Everyone else looked at the steward in surprise.","Mrs. Hua stared at Feng and frowned. “Feng Tian, how dare you?!”","It seemed that Mrs. Hua and the steward were old acquaintances. She knew how capable the steward was, so she only threatened him verbally.","The steward snorted. “I’m just sending Miss Feng Wu in to save Princess Bao","Mrs. Hua shook her head. “Everyone knows that it’s hopeless for Bao Er. That’s just an excuse.”","Feng said, “Miss Feng Wu is an extraordinary doctor. If there’s anyone in the","Junwu Empire who can save Princess Bao Er, it’ll be her.”","The empress dowager frowned. “Feng, don’t you understand what Mrs. Hua is saying? Bao Er is on her deathbed, and not even the gods can save her! Aren’t you worried that I’ll punish you for using this excuse to fool me?!”","Just then, footsteps came from not far away.","“His Majesty has arrived.”","It was Emperor Wu.","Dressed in bright yellow casual clothes and thick-soled boots, Emperor Wu soon came into the room.","Everyone bowed to Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu ignored them and hurried over to the empress dowager.","“Greetings, Mother.”","Emperor Wu was the most filial, and bowed to the empress dowager first.","The empress dowager, on the other hand, pressed her hand to her chest, looking like she couldn’t breathe.","Emperor Wu looked worried as he hurried to the empress dowager’s side. “Mother, what’s wrong? Are you feeling unwell?”","Having said that, Emperor Wu bellowed at the others, “Go get the imperial physician!”","Jun Wuxia ran up to him and complained loudly, “Father, Grandmother is so angry because someone offended her.”","Emperor Wu frowned at her. “Who dares to do that?”","Emperor Wu’s eyes lit up when he saw Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, what are you doing here? Are you back from Nest? Come and see your grandmother! She’s not feeling well! ”","Jun Wuxia almost lost her temper at Emperor Wu’s words.","She said indignantly, “Father, Feng Wu was the one who made Grandmother angry!”","Since when did her grandmother become Feng Wu’s? What was wrong with her father?! Jun Wuxia was furious.","However, Emperor Wu glared at her. “What are you talking about? Xiao Wu is the most obedient girl.. How could she have offended Her Majesty? Don’t make false accusations!”"]},{"number":3444,"title":"Chapter 3444: How Amazing Is Xiao Wu?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3444: How Amazing Is Xiao Wu?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Emperor Wu glared at her. “What are you talking about? Xiao Wu is the most obedient girl. How could she have offended Her Majesty? Don’t make false accusations!”","Emperor Wu wasn’t angry, but Jun Wuxia was fuming.","She got the sense that Feng Wu was Emperor Wu’s biological daughter, while she herself had been picked up from the roadside.","!!","“Father!” Jun Wuxia stomped her foot.","However, Emperor Wu said kindly to Feng Wu, “Xiao Wu, come here and have a look at your grandmother.”","The empress dowager was furious at Emperor Wu.","Didn’t he know that she didn’t like Feng Wu?","“I don’t need her help!” the empress dowager said angrily. ‘Who knows if she’ll take the chance to kill me!”","That was a serious accusation.","Emperor Wu turned around and stared at Feng Wu. “You... Forget it. I don’t want you to upset the empress dowager. Go in and see Bao Er.”","Feng Wu nodded at Emperor Wu and went in.","Jun Wuxia was displeased.","“Father!”","However, no matter how loud she shouted, Emperor Wu ignored her.","The empress dowager didn’t usually have to put on a show, but now that Emperor Wu was obviously biased toward Feng Wu, she was displeased. Clutching her chest, she asked, “Your Majesty, are you trying to upset your mother?”","Emperor Wu looked alarmed. “Mother, what are you talking about? I beg you to live forever.”","The empress dowager took a deep breath and glared at him!","He claimed to be a filial son, but when it came to siding with Feng Wu, he didn’t hold back at all.","“I just don’t understand what that girl has done to make you so biased!” The empress dowager pointed at Jun Wuxia. “That’s your real daughter!”","Emperor Wu smiled apologetically. “Mother, what are you talking about? Do you think I’ll side with her?”","The empress dowager couldn’t help but feel helpless when she saw that Emperor Wu smiled obediently but was still biased toward Feng Wu.","Baby Jun had been dazzled by the girl, and now Emperor Wu...","“That’s all I have to say! I just don’t like her!” The empress dowager clenched her fists and said angrily, “I just don’t like her! I don’t like her at all! Your","Majesty, do as you see fit!”","The empress dowager didn’t beat around the bush with Emperor Wu anymore. She got straight to the point and made her stance clear in front of so many people. “Emperor Wu, do as you see fit. If you are as filial as you seem, you would be on the same side as your mother right now.”","The empress dowager wasn’t the only one focused on Emperor Wu. Most of the people around them were kneeling on the ground with their heads lowered, but their ears pricked up.","She was forcing the emperor to say where he stood.","Emperor Wu was put in a difficult position. “Mother...”","The empress dowager waved his hand away. “I won’t argue with you. I’ve already made my stance clear. I don’t approve of her marriage to the crown prince! I don’t like her at all! If you insist on her marrying into the royal family, I’ll kill myself here!”","Was it that serious?!","Emperor Wu frowned. He was displeased too.","The empress dowager was so angry, but she had no idea how rare Xiao Wu was.","Others might not know, but Emperor Wu was the one who received information from the front line!","He knew that Feng Wu had gone to Sun Castle alone and done something spectacular.","To put it bluntly, if it hadn’t been for what Feng Wu had done at Sun Castle, Nest would have been blown up by now.. Feng Xiangnan and the others might not even be alive!"]},{"number":3445,"title":"Chapter 3445: Angry Empress Dowager","paragraphs":["Chapter 3445: Angry Empress Dowager","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","And there was Jun Linyuan. If Feng Wu hadn’t gone into that dangerous place to get the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, Jun Linyuan might not even be alive right now, let alone make a breakthrough.","However, these people...","Emperor Wu looked around. Why did they have to ruin Xiao Wu’s reputation and drag her down?","He was really displeased!","!!","He didn’t try to coax the empress dowager anymore. Instead, he found a seat and sat there sulking.","The crowd was speechless.","They looked at each other, all at a loss.","The empress dowager was dumbfounded.","No matter how she flared up or how unreasonable she was, the emperor would always comfort her, his mother.","But now, he was ignoring her.","Was he just going to leave her like this?","The empress dowager’s chest heaved with fury!","She felt that Emperor Wu had changed. He didn’t care about his mother anymore; Feng Wu must have cast some spell on him!","The empress dowager was about to explode, when Emperor Wu jumped to his feet!","“I’ll go inside and take a look. Since that girl is here, Bao Er might really be saved.”","After that, Emperor Wu headed for the door.","The empress dowager flushed with rage.","There were so many people here, and Emperor Wu was just going to ignore her, his mother. That was so embarrassing! Didn’t he care about her dignity?","“Your Majesty!”","The empress dowager shouted at Emperor Wu, “Bao Er is on her deathbed. Do you have to torture her like this?!","“If Feng Wu can cure Bao Er, I’ll... I’ll serve Feng Wu tea! I can even kneel down to her!”","Emperor Wu rubbed his forehead.","His mother was really furious. How could she say such things?","The empress dowager smirked. “If Feng Wu can’t cure Bao Er, I won’t forgive her!”","Emperor Wu didn’t want to talk anymore, and he went in without looking back.","His mother was becoming less and less like the empress dowager. Why was she being so petty with a girl?","When the late emperor was still alive, she used to bicker with his concubines, which made sense, but Feng Wu was her grandson’s fiancée now. Why should she hold it against her?","Emperor Wu suddenly felt a little emotional. Had he been too obedient all these years?","“It’s the empress dowager!”","“Your Majesty!”","Seeing that Emperor Wu was about to leave, the empress dowager fell backward!","There was no one behind her!","Jun Wuxia couldn’t believe what she was seeing. How brave of her grandmother to put on such a show!","Hua Wushuang reacted quickly. Before Jun Wuxia reacted, she stepped forward to catch the empress dowager.","But she was too late.","Everyone was trying to catch the empress dowager, but the capable ones were too far away. The less capable ones were close enough, but they were too slow.","Hua Wushuang slipped and fell under the empress dowager.","Thump!","The empress dowager collapsed on top of Hua Wushuang.","Hua Wushuang groaned.","Everyone ran around in panic. “It’s the empress dowager!”","“Your Majesty!”","“What’s wrong, Your Majesty?!”","“Wake up, Your Majesty!”","Emperor Wu was about to step into the golden palace, when he turned around and saw the chaos behind him. He was dumbfounded!","After all, she was his mother.","Emperor Wu, who had decided not to indulge the empress dowager too much, couldn’t think about anything else. He ran as fast as he could!","“Mother!”","Moving through the crowd, Emperor Wu soon appeared in front of the empress dowager.. “Mother, are you alright? How are you? Where’s the imperial physician?!”"]},{"number":3446,"title":"Chapter 3446: Not His Idea","paragraphs":["Chapter 3446: Not His Idea","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Chu, the imperial physician, was talking to Feng Wu about Bao Er.","Hearing the commotion outside at the same time, Feng Wu was speechless. Could the empress dowager stop causing trouble? Bao Er was her granddaughter.","“Master Chu, please go out and help the empress dowager,” said Feng Wu in resignation.","Master Chu said, “But Princess Bao Er...","!!","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “If you can calm the empress dowager down, that’ll be a great help to me. I’ll be here with Bao Er. You can come back when you’re done.”","The imperial physician knew what Her Majesty was like.","Everyone said that elderly people were like children, and Her Majesty was at that stage. She was like a spoiled child with a bad temper and was more arrogant than a princess. Master Chu felt helpless and cursed inwardly.","But since she was the empress dowager, and the empire valued filial piety, what else could he do?","Seeing Master Chu come out, Emperor Wu asked, “What’s going on inside?” Master Chu said, ‘Miss Feng Wu is checking Bao Er. She says there’s still hope.”","Emperor Wu heaved a sigh of relief. “Xiao Wu never brags. If she says there’s hope, then there is.”","The empress dowager almost jumped out of Emperor Wu’s arms.","Xiao Wu never liked to brag? Ha!","Emperor Wu said in a hurry, “Master Chu, take a look at the empress dowager.” Master Chu glanced at the empress dowager.","Apart from checking the pulse, one could actually tell if someone was really unconscious just by looking at their face.","If one was awake, one couldn’t stop their eyes from moving.","The empress dowager’s eyes had twitched when she heard what Emperor Wu said about Feng Wu. How could she really have fainted?","Master Chu took the empress dowager’s pulse.","As expected.","Master Chu thought of Feng Wu in the golden palace. Her face was pale, and he could tell at a glance that she had internal injuries and needed to rest. However, she had rushed over to save Bao Er, but the empress dowager... It was just ridiculous.","Master Chu was displeased.","Although he was only a physician, he could still find a way to teach the empress dowager a lesson. Master Chu had many tricks up his sleeve.","“The empress dowager was so excited that she sort of fainted. Don’t worry,","Your Majesty. She’ll be fine.”","“Sort of?” Emperor Wu’s eyebrows twitched.","The empress dowager almost jumped up and slapped Master Chu in the face! Even if he knew she was faking it, why didn’t he cover it up? What a useless man! She would replace him later!","Master Chu smiled bitterly and said, “I’m not saying Her Majesty is faking it, it’s just a relative term. It’s a symptom of... er... Well, she fainted, but she didn’t lose consciousness.”","Emperor Wu was confused. “Huh?”","Master Chu said, “Don’t worry, it’s very easy to treat. I’ll just stick this needle into her eye and stimulate her. She’ll be fine immediately.”","As he spoke, Master Chu asked the attendant to bring over his personal medicine box.","This move wasn’t really his own idea.","Not long ago, Her Majesty had acted the same way with Feng Wu. That girl took out a needle the length of her finger and said that she wanted to stab the bottom of the empress dowager’s foot. Immediately, the empress dowager’s head didn’t hurt anymore, and she could breathe normally.","Master Chu was just following suit.","He felt this method would work.","There was a long row of needles in the medicine box. They were arranged according to the length and thickness.","Master Chu chose the thickest needle.","It was almost like the needle that one used to sew the sole of a shoe.","“Ssss —”","The surrounding people gasped.."]},{"number":3447,"title":"Chapter 3447: Saving Bao Er","paragraphs":["Chapter 3447: Saving Bao Er","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Wasn’t that a little ruthless?","The emnress dowager kent her eves closed- She didn’t even dare to move her","eyeballs so that Master Chu wouldn’t notice. She was having a hard time holding it in.","!!","She couldn’t see, so her hearing became especially sharp.","When she heard everyone’s gasps, she immediately became nervous.","Master Chu held the thick needle in his hand and said as he approached the empress dowager, “Give me a hand. Hold the empress dowager down. I’m going to stab her right in the eye.”","Jun Wuxia frowned. “Won’t that hurt?”","Master Chu said, “Of course it’ll hurt, but I’m saving her life. Her Majesty can’t stay this way. She needs this.”","Two maids approached the empress dowager and held her down.","Empress Dugu could tell at a glance that the empress dowager was pretending to be unconscious. Right then, she and the empress dowager were on the same side and were going after Feng Wu together.","Therefore, Empress Dugu stopped Master Chu. “The empress dowager doesn’t need acupuncture, does she?”","The empress dowager was almost in tears!","Empress Dugu’s words were so touching.","However, Master Chu shook his head and said righteously, “No, the empress dowager needs this needle for her illness!”","Master Chu turned around and frowned when he saw Empress Dugu. “Your","Majesty, you’re stopping me from treating Her Majesty. Don’t you want Her Majesty to recover?”","What an accusation!","Empress Dugu was rendered speechless!","If she insisted, what if Master Chu asked, “Who’s the imperial physician here, you or me?” She wouldn’t Imow how to reply. At that thought, Empress Dugu had no choice but to step aside.","She had done what she could, and the empress dowager should understand.","The empress dowager was furious.","At that moment, Mrs. Hua stepped forward and tried to stop Master Chu. Emperor Wu asked coldly, “Does Mrs. Hua have medical skills as well? Do you know more than a physician of the Imperial Hospital?”","Mrs. Hua was speechless.","Why did it feel like Emperor Wu was on Master Chu’s side? That was strange.","Mrs. Hua and Hua Wushuang hadn’t figured out the situation yet. They looked at each other and shook their heads. They couldn’t afford to offend Emperor wu.","The empress dowager was pressed against the chair, waiting for the needle to pierce her!","Just as Master Chu’s needle was about to reach the empress dowager, she jumped up!","Luckily, Master Chu was prepared, or the needle would have pierced the empress dowager’s eye.","The empress dowager was utterly embarrassed.","When Feng Wu saw Bao Er again in the golden palace, the latter was lying on a small ice bed.","Feng Wu touched the ice bed.","The material was similar to the cold jade bed that her beautiful master slept on, but it wasn’t as good.","However, such an ice bed was probably the best material one could find in this world.","In the mist, Feng Wu saw a five-year-old girl with delicate features and a tiny chin. She slept on a bed of ice all day long without getting any sunlight, so she looked ghastly pale.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan. “She wasn’t sleeping on the ice bed before.”","Jun Linyuan looked a little tired. He hadn’t slept in a long time since he left","Nest, so his eyes were bloodshot red.","His voice was cold as he frowned. ‘Granny Gong said that Bao Er’s condition has been very bad recently, so Master Chu made the decision to have her sleep on the ice bed. He wanted to delay the inevitable for as long as possible..”"]},{"number":3448,"title":"Chapter 3448: Princess Bao Er","paragraphs":["Chapter 3448: Princess Bao Er","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing Jun Linyuan’s exhausted face, Feng Wu paused and wanted to say something, but kept quiet in the end.","She examined Bao Er from head to toe. The longer she examined her, the uglier her expression became.","“Is it serious?” Jun Linyuan asked involuntarily when he saw the look on Feng Wu’s face.","Feng Wu nodded. “It’s worse than I expected. Bao Er’s almost out of breath!”","!!","Jun Linyuan hurried over and stared at Feng Wu!","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry, I’ll do my best to save her.”","Staring at Feng Wu, Jun Linyuan stressed each word. “You know that I need more than ‘do my best’.”","What he wanted was Feng Wu’s promise.","He wanted her to promise that she could save Bao Er.","However, Feng Wu shook her head. “No doctor can guarantee that they can save a life.”","After that, Feng Wu took out a vial of medicine from her pocket.","“That’s the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid.” Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu.","“You found it?”","Because Feng Wu hadn’t said anything, Jun Linyuan didn’t know about it until now.","He was delighted to see it at first, but his eyes soon turned cold. ‘You found it in Sun Castle, right?”","Feng Wu could feel Jun Linyuan’s intimidating gaze, so she lowered her head and pretended to be busy, not daring to meet his eyes.","However, Jun Linyuan didn’t look happy.","“It wasn’t that dangerous...” Feng Wu said weakly.","The crown prince stared at her with such cold eyes that Feng Wu almost froze.","Feng Wu looked up at him in resignation. “If you keep releasing that cold air, Bao Er will freeze to death.”","The teenager remained silent, his eyes still on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu knew that he was angry. She could guess what he was angry about.","At that moment, the fairy suddenly spoke in her mind. “Dear host, have you made your choice?”","Feng Wu was almost interrupted. She asked in her head, “I still have time, don’t","The fairy said, “What if you’re busy? After you give me the answer, I can click the option for you before the deadline.”","Feng Wu said, “No!”","The fairy wanted to say something else, but Feng Wu stopped her. “I’m going to save someone now. I can’t be distracted. Don’t jump around in my head.”","The fairy asked, “Save someone?”","She looked at the pale little girl on the ice bed and said curiously, “She’s about to die. She can’t be saved.’","Feng Wu said grumpily, “I don’t care. I owe her my life.”","“What?” The fairy was dumbfounded.","She was a spiritual plant, so her perception was much stronger than others. She could sense that the little girl on the ice bed had lost a lot of life force, and it was almost impossible for her to wake up.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu injected the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid into Bao Er’s meridians.","Someone had already set up a spiritual essence formation around Bao Er. As long as spiritual essence was injected into a crystal ball at the head of the bed, it would enter Bao Er’s body through the ice bed and keep her alive.","Bao Er had been able to survive until now thanks to the constant infusion of spiritual essence through the crystal ball.","The person who injected the spiritual essence had to be quite capable, and Feng Wu couldn’t do it. The person had to be at least a Spiritual Overlord.","Luckily, the little girl was precious, or she wouldn’t have been able to receive so much spiritual essence.","Jun Linyuan was the one who had been injecting spiritual essence into the crystal ball.."]},{"number":3449,"title":"Chapter 3449: Saving Bao Er","paragraphs":["Chapter 3449: Saving Bao Er","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan was the one who had been injecting spiritual essence into the crystal ball.","Feng Wu gently stroked Bao Er’s body and opened all her acupuncture points.","This was a very dangerous act.","However, Bao Er was barely breathing now. If Feng Wu didn’t take the risk, there would be no hope at all.","!!","Jun Linyuan had been channeling spiritual essence into her body the entire time. His face was expressionless, and his eyes were unreadable.","Master Chu took care of the empress dowager and came in.","The moment he entered, he saw this scene and was shocked!","“You...”","Master Chu didn’t dare to speak for fear of disturbing Feng Wu.","However, he was really worried about her bold action.","While he was worried, he was also shocked!","There were 720 acupuncture points on the human body, which included 52 single acupuncture points, 300 double acupuncture points, and 50 special acupuncture points. All of them were opened in such a short period of time.","What kind of ability was this?","If Master Chu knew that Feng Wu had opened all of them in less than a minute, he would probably pass out.","Feng Wu looked up and saw Master Chu. She nodded at him. “Please come here.”","Master Chu hurried over.","Feng Wu asked off-handedly, “Is everything all right with the empress dowager?”","Master Chu smiled bitterly, amazed by Feng Wu’s attitude.","Didn’t she know how much the crown prince treasured Princess Bao Er? How could Miss Feng Wu still chat with him?","Master Chu darted a look at Jun Linyuan. Seeing that the latter didn’t react,","Master Chu said to Feng Wu in a low voice. “Her Maiestv was having another one of her episodes. I learned from you and treated her with a needle.”","Feng Wu glanced at him.","Master Chu said it in all seriousness. Those who didn’t know better would think that the empress dowager really had some chronic disease.","“Ahem!” The crown prince frowned.","Feng Wu went back to the topic at hand. “Master Chu, please help me keep the needles vibrating. ”","Master Chu looked at Feng Wu in confusion. What needles?","While he was still feeling confused, five silver needles appeared in Feng Wu’s hand.","Before Master Chu could see the length of the five needles, Feng Wu had already made her move.","Five silver needles pierced Bao Er’s acupuncture points.","These five acupuncture points were five of the 36 fatal acupuncture points!","Master Chu was so shocked that he almost fell to the floor!","His face was deathly pale. He looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “That, that...’","Was that really okay?!","Even a newly-minted physician knew that there were 36 fatal acupuncture points on the human body. One could kill someone if they weren’t careful when they touched these fatal acupuncture points!","How dare she...","How could she so casually insert the five silver needles into those fatal acupuncture points?","Right now, the five needles were in five acupuncture points on the head.","Master Chu was on the verge of tears. He looked at Jun Linyuan involuntarily.","He thought, “Your Royal Highness, she’s your favorite princess. Aren’t you going to say something?”","Jun Linyuan nodded at Master Chu, telling him to do as Feng Wu said.","Master Chu was speechless.","Alright, the crown prince had agreed to it. If something really happened...","Master Chu rolled up his sleeves, but before he could do anything, Feng Wu was already using more silver needles.","She eventually put one needle in each of the 36 fatal acupuncture points.","All of them!","Master Chu was astonished.","He turned around and stared at Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu said calmly, “Master Chu, use your spiritual essence to keep the needles vibrating. Don’t let them go too deep or too shallow. Just keep them like this..”"]},{"number":3450,"title":"Chapter 3450: Princess Bao Er (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3450: Princess Bao Er (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Chu asked, “One inch... Isn’t that too deep?”","Feng Wu had broken too many rules for him to understand. He also knew how to stimulate acupuncture points with silver needles, but he only dared to insert them half an inch.","The 36 needles had used up a lot of Feng Wu’s spiritual essence, so she looked a little pale.","!!","Feng Wu shook her head. “Bao Er has been sick for so long that she’s on the verge of death. Half an inch won’t work on her.”","Master Chu nodded.","Without another word, he followed Feng Wu’s instructions and focused on the 36 silver needles.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu took out an elixir and poured it into her mouth, which helped her recover a little.","However, she didn’t recover much.","After that, Feng Wu set up a mirror on the table.","Master Chu looked at her in confusion but didn’t ask any questions.","He saw that Feng Wu had tied a string around Bao Er’s wrist, and the other end of the string was wrapped around the strange-looking water mirror. Soon, a wavy line appeared on the water mirror, and it fluctuated at a slow speed.","Moreover, there was a number in the upper right corner of the water mirror.","At that moment, the number was 9.","“What’s that?”","That was Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu said, “It represents Bao Er’s health.”","Staring at the wavy line, Feng Wu told Jun Linyuan, “The line shows Bao Er’s physical condition. Everything’s fine when the line is moving at a normal speed. If it becomes a straight line, everything is over.","“This number 9 is relatively low. No, I should say it’s very low. It’s 100 for normal people.”","But it was only 9 for Bao Er...","Jun Linyuan nodded, but Feng Wu knew that he was worried.","“I’ll do my best to save Bao Er,” Feng Wu promised him again.","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu rubbed her temple. She was too weak...","If the assassination attempt in Black Cloud Alley hadn’t happened, Feng Wu would have been able to deal with the major treatment with her mental strength and stamina. Now, however, she was worried that she wouldn’t be able to keep up.","At that thought, Feng Wu downed another bottle of spirit elixir.","The best thing about being a Semi-Divine medicine refiner was that she had an indefinite supply of this potion.","Feeling a little more energetic, Feng Wu said to Jun Linyuan, “I’m going to start the first treatment. I need two Spiritual Overlords to be on standby.”","Two Spiritual Overlords came at Jun Linyuan’s signal.","The two middle-aged men were unfamiliar to Feng Wu.","Were these two Jun Linyuan’s subordinates? Feng Wu wondered.","Jun Linyuan surely had a lot of power if he could order two Spiritual Overlords around. No wonder he looked at the elders as if they were dummies.","The two Spiritual Overlords walked up to Feng Wu and looked at her inquisitively.","Feng Wu said, “I’m going to operate on Bao Er next. She’s suffering from lesions in several organs. I have to take this opportunity to get rid of these lesions in one go.","Before Feng Wu could finish, the crown prince frowned again. “How many?”","Feng Wu said, “She needs a liver incision. Her stomach needs a resection. Her gallbladder needs an incision...”","Feng Wu named six places in one go.","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “To be honest, Bao Er’s genes aren’t very good. She was born with serious ailments. If you hadn’t spent so much on her medication, she wouldn’t have been able to survive..”"]},{"number":3451,"title":"Chapter 3451: Princess Bao Er (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3451: Princess Bao Er (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The crown prince asked, “What will happen in the future?”","Feng Wu said, “Once she recovers, diseases won’t invade her body so easily, and she won’t get sick all the time.”","The crown prince nodded. After some thought, he asked, “Do we have to work on all six places at once?”","!!","Feng Wu had never looked so serious before. “Yes, we have to treat all six of them. Mr. Lu has one such lesion, but Bao Er has six. We’re really fighting with Death itself for Bao Er.”","Others would only tell Jun Linyuan that Bao Er was incurable, and no one had ever told him that apart from being weak, Bao Er had six other major health issues.","“Let’s begin.”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything else.","Feng Wu nodded and instructed the two Spiritual Overlords, “The two of you aren’t here to save Bao Er, but to transfer spiritual essence to me.”","The two Spiritual Overlords frowned at Feng Wu. “Aren’t we going to save Princess Bao Er when needed?”","Feng Wu said, “No, I’m the one you need to save at short notice.” Jun Linyuan’s stomach lurched when he saw Feng Wu’s pale face.","speed.","Moreover, there was a number in the upper right corner of the water mirror.","At that moment, the number was 9.","“What’s that?”","That was Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu said, “It represents Bao Er’s health.”","Staring at the wavy line, Feng Wu told Jun Linyuan, “The line shows Bao Er’s physical condition. Everything’s fine when the line is moving at a normal speed. If it becomes a straight line, everything is over.","“This number 9 is relatively low. No, I should say it’s very low. It’s 100 for normal people. ”","But it was only 9 for Bao Er...","Jun Linyuan nodded, but Feng Wu knew that he was worried.","“I’ll do my best to save Bao Er,” Feng Wu promised him again.","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu rubbed her temple. She was too weak...","If the assassination attempt in Black Cloud Alley hadn’t happened, Feng Wu would have been able to deal with the major treatment with her mental strength and stamina. Now, however, she was worried that she wouldn’t be able to keep up.","At that thought, Feng Wu downed another bottle of spirit elixir.","The best thing about being a Semi-Divine medicine refiner was that she had an indefinite supply of this potion.","Feeling a little more energetic, Feng Wu said to Jun Linyuan, “I’m going to start the first treatment. I need two Spiritual Overlords to be on standby.” rlAJ0 Spiritual Overlords came at Jun Linyuan’s signal.","The two middle-aged men were unfamiliar to Feng Wu.","Were these two Jun Linyuan’s subordinates? Feng Wu wondered.","Jun Linyuan surely had a lot of power if he could order two Spiritual Overlords around. No wonder he looked at the elders as if they were dummies.","The two Spiritual Overlords walked up to Feng Wu and looked at her inquisitively.","Feng Wu said, “I’m going to operate on Bao Er next. She’s suffering from lesions in several organs. I have to take this opportunity to get rid of these lesions in one go.","Before Feng Wu could finish, the crown prince frowned again. “How many?","Feng Wu said, “She needs a liver incision. Her stomach needs a resection. Her gallbladder needs an incision...’","Feng Wu named six places in one go.","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “To be honest, Bao Er’s genes aren’t very good. She was born with serious ailments. If you hadn’t spent so much on her medication, she wouldn’t have been able to survive..”"]},{"number":3452,"title":"Chapter 3452: The Crown Prince’s Girl (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3452: The Crown Prince’s Girl (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Chu hurried on with his work, but inwardly, he couldn’t help but admire Feng wu.","She was really bold. Wasn’t she afraid that the knife would cut into Bao Er’s liver?","After that, Feng Wu began to work at full speed.","!!","She quickly determined the location of the lesion and used a thick needle to seal the surroundings. She cut open the hepatic capsule and completely removed the lesion. Then, she quickly sutured the ducts and the epidermis.","One of the six major lesions had already been cut out.","Although Feng Wu looked calm, everyone could tell that she wasn’t in good condition.","“Xiao Wu, are you feeling unwell?” Duan Chaoge looked at Feng Wu with concern and frowned. “You look awful. Are you hurt?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll be fine.”","Duan Chaoge wanted to say something else, but Feng Wu stared at Bao Er’s health bar.","It had dropped to 7.","She couldn’t afford to delay any longer.","“Let’s move on to the next one.” Feng Wu took a deep breath.","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid had been injected.","Because Bao Er was too weak, the effect of the medicine was very slow. She was still in extreme danger, and her health bar was decreasing bit by bit.","Duan Chaoge had no choice but to listen to Feng Wu.","“Scalpel number two,” said Feng Wu.","Duan Chaoge picked up the second scalpel and handed it over.","This time, Feng Wu performed a stomach incision.","Duan Chaoge handed Feng Wu what she needed as she watched Feng Wu’s swift movements.","Scalpel, pliers, needle, thread...","By the time Master Chu reacted, Feng Wu’s second operation was complete.","How incredible!","Master Chu didn’t think the operation was supposed to be like this. At least, they had to cut out and remove the lesions carefully. It should take at least a few hours to finish one, but Feng Wu took less than five minutes!","However, there seemed to be no problem at all..","Seeing the sweat on Feng Wu’s forehead, Duan Chaoge took out a white cotton cloth and wiped it off.","As a matter of fact, Feng Wu was already feeling a little dizzy...","She wanted to cut out another lesion, but she couldn’t hold on anymore.","Feng Wu waved her hand. “I’m going to rest for a while. Wake me up in five minutes.”","Feng Wu said that to Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu didn’t go anywhere else. She sat in a corner and leaned against the wall to recover her mental strength.","Feng Wu had already taken medicine, but it wasn’t good to drink too much in one go. If she drank too much, she would suffer a mental breakdown. Therefore, Feng Wu stopped drinking and circulated her spiritual essence to restore her mental strength.","Time passed.","Five minutes later, everyone turned to look at Feng Wu, but she showed no signs of waking up.","Everyone looked at Jun Linyuan","At that moment, Feng came in and whispered something in Jun Linyuan’s ear.","The crown prince’s face darkened.","Someone had tried to assassinate Feng Wu?!","And they even stopped her in Black Cloud Alley?!","“Who was it?!” Jun Linyuan asked.","Feng said, “I didn’t have time to look into that yet, but it has to be one of those families...”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu, who was resting in the corner. Was she really that badly injured?","Previously, he could tell that she wasn’t in a good state, but he didn’t expect it to be so serious.","He had promised to protect her...","However, even the crown prince didn’t expect that Feng Wu would be targeted the moment she came out of the portal. He had thought that it would take some time for the news of her return to spread.","Feng Wu’s face was ghastly pale, and she was sweating profusely. Her clothes were already a little wet.."]},{"number":3453,"title":"Chapter 3453: The Crown Prince’s Girl (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3453: The Crown Prince’s Girl (2)","Translator: Henvee Translations Editor: Henvee Translations","Jun Linyuan couldn’t believe that the girl wouldn’t say a word and would carry the burden on her own. He wanted nothing more than to drag her over and scold her.","But he couldn’t bear to.","Just then, there was a commotion outside.","!!","The empress dowager led a group of people, but the instigator was actually Empress Dugu...","As soon as the empress dowager walked in, she saw Feng Wu resting in the corner. One look and she was infuriated!","“What’s going on?!” The empress dowager was furious. “Didn’t you say you were going to save Bao Er? Is this how you’re doing it?!”","Feng Wu was still leaning against the wall, her eyes closed and her face pale.","Jun Linyuan frowned when he saw the empress dowager.","But before he could say anything, the empress dowager strode toward Feng wu!","The empress dowager said, “I’ve never seen such a lazy person. Since you’re not here to save Bao Er, take her away and...”","“That’s enough!”","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes.","He glared at Feng.","Feng walked up to the empress dowager and bowed. “Your Majesty, please leave.”","However, the empress dowager didn’t even look at the steward. She only stared at Feng wu!","Granny Gui, who was standing next to the empress dowager, tried to pull Feng Wu away, but Feng stopped her with a look.","Seeing the argument, Empress Dugu gloated inwardly, but she couldn’t show it on her face.","The empress dowager was about to step forward, when Jun Linyuan said, “That’s enough!”","Instantly, all eyes were on Jun Linyuan.","The empress dowager said, “Baby Jun..","Jun Linyuan frowned. “If you still want Bao Er alive, please leave!”","The empress dowager had always doted on Jun Linyuan, so although Jun Linyuan was impatient with everything, he treated the empress dowager differently.","His attitude now hurt the empress dowager.","Now that the empress dowager was picking on Feng Wu, it was time for Jun Linyuan to pick a side.","Should he side with the empress dowager or Feng Wu?","However, the answer was obvious. The crown prince had asked the empress dowager to leave. How could the old empress dowager, who had always regarded Jun Linyuan as a treasure, take that? She felt wronged.","Jun Linyuan felt a headache coming on, but he still frowned and stared at the empress dowager. “Get out now!”","The empress dowager was furious.","“Fine, fine!” The empress dowager smirked. She went after Feng Wu instead of Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu was finally woken up. She rubbed her temple and woke up, still feeling a little tired.","Due to the interruption, Feng Wu hadn’t recovered very well this time, and her head was still aching.","However, before she could say anything, the empress dowager bellowed at her!","“Feng Wu, I’ll remember you!”","Feng Wu looked at the empress dowager in bewilderment. How did she offend","tne empress dowager tms timec","Before Feng Wu could say anything, the empress dowager stormed off.","Feng Wu was speechless. What was going on?","Empress Dugu gave Feng Wu a meaningful look, sighed, and hurried off to help the empress dowager.","Jun Wuxia glared at Feng Wu. “How dare you make Grandmother angry? Feng","Wu, you’re dead!”","Feng Wu was confused.","Before Feng Wu knew what was going on, the group had already left.","“What... what’s going on?” Rubbing her temples, Feng Wu stood up and looked at Jun Linyuan in confusion.","The crown prince wasn’t in a good mood either. He said calmly, “It’s fine. You can continue treating Bao Er.”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","It was obvious that he didn’t want her to pry, but Feng Wu knew that the empress dowager hated her now.."]},{"number":3454,"title":"Chapter 3454: The Crown Prince’s Girl (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3454: The Crown Prince’s Girl (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, the most important thing now was to save Bao Er.","Hence, Feng Wu hurried over to Bao Er’s side.","Frowning, Jun Linyuan asked Feng in a low voice, “Where’s the emperor?”","!!","Feng smiled bitterly. “Something happened in the military, and His Majesty went back to the palace.”","Jun Linyuan asked, “Is It the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng nodded.","Jun Linyuan said, “Go to Nest.”","Feng looked worriedly at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan said, “Your job is to protect me, but I don’t think I need your protection right now.”","Feng gave his young master a resentful look, then turned to Feng Wu. Jun Linyuan said seriously, “I’m here. As for her...”","The crown prince glanced at the girl’s slender figure and said calmly, “I’ll just tie her to me with a rope.”","Feng smacked his forehead.","However, at the thought of Nest, he nodded. “Okay.”","He left quickly, and Jun Linyuan’s attention went back to Bao Er.","He saw Feng Wu use the scalpel again, and Bao Er’s health was still dropping.","It had already dropped to 6.","Jun Linyuan frowned imperceptibly. With a cold face, he continued to pour spiritual essence into the crystal ball.","Without the spiritual essence from the formation, Bao Er would be dead by now.","There were six lesions on Bao Er’s body, and Feng Wu had already removed two of them. Now that she had recovered a little, she continued the operations.","The third, the fourth...","Seeing the sweat on Feng Wu’s forehead, Duan Chaoge wiped it off.","That was what Feng Wu had taught her.","If sweat rolled down and stained the wound, it would cause a lot of trouble.","By the fourth operation, Feng Wu’s eyes were already blurry, and her legs were so weak that she could barely stand.","However, Bao Er only had 4 health points now.","Jun Linyuan asked one of the Spiritual Overlords to ingest spiritual essence into the crystal ball while he stood behind Feng Wu.","A palm landed on Feng Wu’s back.","Immediately, a warm current flowed into Feng Wu’s back and saturated her limbs before flowing into her head.","Feng Wu had been feeling a little groggy, but she immediately came back to her senses.","“What are you doing here?” Feng Wu looked back at Jun Linyuan.","“It’s best if you control the crystal ball. No one else can do it as well as you can, and Bao Er won’t be able to handle any errors.” Feng Wu frowned at him.","“You’re more important,” Jun Linyuan said calmly.","Feng Wu felt as if she had been hit in the chest. She stood there, perplexed.","The crown prince glanced at her and said in a serious tone, “You’re a doctor. If you get sick, Bao Er will die too. That’s why you’re more important.”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","That made sense.","“The Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid is slowly taking effect, but Bao Er’s old ailments are too serious, so the liquid is only half as effective as usual.” Feng Wu shook her head regretfully.","Jun Linyuan said, “Then Bao Er...”","Feng Wu said, “I guess there’s only one option.” What?","Everyone looked at Feng Wu curiously.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu took out a syringe and drew a large amount of blood from her veins.","Feng Wu’s blood was different from others.","Because she had the Divine Phoenix Blood, her blood was a faint golden color and looked very dazzling.","“Xiao Wu, you...” Duan Chaoge looked at Feng Wu with a pained expression and gritted her teeth. “You’re not feeling well, and you’re mentally weak.. How are you going to take it? Your face is so pale! “"]},{"number":3455,"title":"Chapter 3455: The Crown Prince’s Girl (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3455: The Crown Prince’s Girl (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s face was very pale indeed.","It was as if she had been sucked dry of all blood. Even her lips were terrifyingly pale.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly and waved her hand. “That’s not important.”","!!","Duan Chaoge was anxious.","She didn’t know Bao Er. She only cared about Feng Wu!","Duan Chaoge wanted to say something else, but Feng Wu shook her head. “Bao Er only has this one chance. If we don’t take it, she’ll die. On the other hand, my cultivation can recover.”","Recover? What? Duan Chaoge didn’t understand.","But Jun Linyuan got it.","Feng Wu’s cultivation level had dropped after drawing the blood!","She used to be a Level 6 Spiritual King, but she now dropped to Level 5, then Level 4.","The crown prince’s pupils contracted!","He looked at the petite girl with sympathy.","Apart from Feng Wu, who else would be willing to lose their cultivation just to save a person who wasn’t related to them?","What a silly girl.","Feng Wu didn’t care what the others thought. She focused all her attention on Bao Er.","Bao Er didn’t have much time left.","Right now, she was in a race against Death.","Feng Wu injected the golden blood into Bao Er, and after she recovered a little, she began to operate on Bao Er again.","While she was doing that, Jun Linyuan pressed his warm hand against her lower back and injected spiritual essence into her.","It was also Feng Wu’s first time learning that spiritual essence could be injected into others.","But then again, Jun Linyuan had been able to force his spiritual essence into her body to help her refine the Magical Soul Vine’s poison last time. There was nothing Jun Linyuan couldn’t do.","With spiritual essence and mental strength, Feng Wu could resume the treatment.","This time, her movements were even faster.","Master Chu’s vision blurred, and in less than five minutes, Feng Wu had completed the last two operations.","After she was done, her hand trembled, and the sharp scalpel almost fell to the floor.","The next moment, Jun Linyuan reached out and pulled the exhausted Feng Wu into his arms.","He took a look at Bao Er’s health points.","In the next second.","Jun Linyuan frowned.","“Still not working?”","Even after this girl tried her best, she still couldn’t save Bao Er.","Jun Linyuan wasn’t the only one staring at the health bar. Feng Wu was, too.","She had not completely fainted. At this moment, she was staring at Bao Er’s health bar.","If it dropped any further...","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched!","She had worked so hard to save Bao Er.","She had gone deep into Sun Castle and almost died there. It had taken painstaking effort to steal the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid from Mr. Sakiya. Wasn’t it enough?","Despair appeared on Master Chu’s face, but it was within his expectations.","After all, Bao Er had been on her deathbed for so many years.","She had been on the verge of death ever since she was born, but Jun Linyuan and Master Chu had saved her every time. But this time, was she going to die?","Everyone thought that Bao Er wouldn’t make it.","Meanwhile, outside...","The empress dowager didn’t leave.","She sat on a chair outside the door and waited.","She wanted to see how Feng Wu would answer her in the end!","Since the empress dowager hadn’t left, the others didn’t either.."]},{"number":3456,"title":"Chapter 3456: The Crown Prince’s Girl (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3456: The Crown Prince’s Girl (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The empress dowager wouldn’t leave, and neither would the others.","Hence, Empress Dugu and everyone else sat outside the door, and the silence was terrifying.","Everyone knew that the empress dowager was throwing a tantrum, so they didn’t dare breathe too loudly for fear of offending her.","!!","The empress dowager was fuming, when she suddenly looked at Hua Wushuang.","Hua Wushuang’s stomach lurched. The way the empress dowager looked at her... Something wasn’t right","Sure enough, the next moment, the empress dowager asked Mrs. Hua, “How old is Wushuang? When is her birthday?”","Mrs. Hua was experienced enough to know what the empress dowager was up to.","However, she didn’t want to marry Hua Wushuang to another prince.","“Match her birthday with Baby Jun’s and see if they have good marriage compatibility.” The empress dowager didn’t beat around the bush.","Mrs. I ranstator: Hua pretended enyee I ranstatlons to demur. Editor: “Areyou enyee sure?I ranstatlons","The empress dowager wouldn’t leave, and neither would the others.","Hence, Empress Dugu and everyone else sat outside the door, and the silence was terrifying.","Everyone knew that the empress dowager was throwing a tantrum, so they didn’t dare breathe too loudly for fear of offending her.","The empress dowager was fuming, when she suddenly looked at Hua","Wushuang.","Hua Wushuangs stomach lurched. The way the empress dowager looked at her... Something wasn’t right","Sure enough, the next moment, the empress dowager asked Mrs. Hua, “How old is Wushuang? When is her birthday?”","Mrs. Hua was experienced enough to know what the empress dowager was up to.","However, she didn’t want to marry Hua Wushuang to another prince.","“Match her birthday with Baby Jun’s and see if they have good marriage compatibility.” The empress dowager didn’t beat around the bush.","Mrs. Hua pretended to demur. “Are you sure?","Hua Wushuang had never met Jun Linyuan before, and she thought what people said about him was rather exaggerated.","However, when she followed the others just now and saw the peerless youth, her heart raced.","Therefore, she lowered her head shyly and poked her grandmother with her hand hidden in her sleeve.","Mrs. Hua naturally knew what she meant.","What girl wouldn’t love such a handsome and outstanding young man?","However, Mrs. Hua still had to look like she wanted to decline the offer.","“Your Majesty, well...” Mrs. Hua smiled bitterly. “When we went in just now, Miss Feng Wu and the crown prince...”","The empress dowager waved her hand rudely. “She’s nothing. If Baby Jun likes","her, she can be the concubine. The crown prince’s wife is going to be a lady from a prestigious family. It’s not her place.”","Hua Wushuang lowered her head. She was overjoyed, but she didn’t let it show.","She thought, “Feng Wu seems to have been close to the crown prince for a long time. If I become the crown prince’s wife, she’ll be the first to be eliminated.”","“I heard she’s engaged to the crown prince.” The Hua family wasn’t an ordinary family, so they had to get the facts straight first.","The empress dowager waved her hand. “The engagement was over a long time ago. Do you really believe what that girl has been telling everybody?”","Mrs. Hua was surprised. “The engagement has already been canceled, yet she’s still saying...”","Mrs. Hua looked at Empress Dugu.","Empress Dugu felt bitter.","To be honest, she didn’t want to offend Feng Wu since as far as she knew, His Majesty strongly supported Feng Wu, and Jun Linyuan liked Feng Wu...","However, she had tried her best to slander Feng Wu. As a result, the empress dowager was deeply prejudiced against Feng Wu.","At that moment, Empress Dugu smiled. “Mrs. Hua, just listen to the empress dowager.”","Mrs. Hua smiled. “Of course. By the way, isn’t there Miss Zuo Qingluan as well?”","“That’s also a story the girl herself made up.” The empress dowager was infuriated. “I don’t know what’s going on with these girls, but they keep trying to get close to the crown prince and insist that they’re engaged to Baby Jun.”","The empress dowager clicked her tongue, which was enough to show how disdainful she felt.","Mrs. Hua looked shocked. “How could they do that?”","The empress dowager smirked. “They did that, alright. Anyway, don’t worry.","My Baby Jun isn’t engaged yet.. When your Wushuang marries...”"]},{"number":3457,"title":"Chapter 3457: Random Matchmaking (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3457: Random Matchmaking (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The empress dowager smirked. “Why wouldn’t they do it? Anyway, don’t worry. My Baby Jun isn’t engaged yet. When your Wushuang marries into the family, that won’t girl dare to do anything to the crown prince’s consort!”","Hua Wushuang didn’t expect the empress dowager to be so supportive of her. She was thrilled, but she didn’t let it show.","Jun Wuxia kept glancing at Hua Wushuang.","!!","As far as she could remember, the crown prince and Feng Wu were engaged. She vaguely remembered what her father said..","Jun Wuxia couldn’t help but look at the empress dowager. Her grandmother was so bold. How could she make such a promise to the Hua family?","Mrs. Hua looked like she was unable to turn down the offer after all. She could only smile and say yes.","Jun Wuxia was speechless.","But why would Mrs. Hua say no? She was just taking advantage of the empress dowager’s anger. When the empress dowager came back to her senses, she wouldn’t want to face the emperor and Jun Linyuan’s rage.","Still, Jun Wuxia loved to see Feng Wu get in trouble.","The more people targeted Feng Wu, the happier Jun Wuxia was.","Hence, she ran up and held Hua Wushuang’s arm. “Sister Hua, you’ll be my sister-in-law one day. You have to take good care of me.”","Hua Wushuang blushed. “I don’t know what you’re talking about.”","Jun Wuxia said, “Grandmother said you’ll marry the crown prince. As for Feng Wu, don’t worry about her. The world outside belongs to men, but my grandmother can do whatever she wants here.”","Empress Dugu glanced at Jun Wuxia.","Empress Dugu had been tricked by Feng Wu many times, and she had learned to stay out of Feng Wu’s business.","Jun Wuxia didn’t know that yet.","Empress Dugu had no choice but to step forward and pull Jun Wuxia behind her. She smiled at Mrs. Hua. “Congratulations, Mrs. Hua.”","At this moment, a voice came from outside.","“Congratulations? Is Bao Er alright?”","Everyone looked outside and saw Lady Northern Feng.","She was Feng Wu’s godmother.","Lady Northern Feng greeted the empress dowager as soon as she arrived.","The empress dowager’s face darkened when she saw Lady Northern Feng and remembered that she and Feng Wu were mother and daughter.","Lady Northern Feng was a wonderful woman. She had been an orphan girl in the palace, and even the empress dowager had doted on her. It wasn’t because of her looks, but her bright personality.","Hence, Lady Northern Feng went up to the empress dowager and held her arm. She asked warmly, “What’s wrong? Who made Her Majesty angry? Wuxia, was it you?","Jun Wuxia denied it. “It wasn’t me! It was Feng Wu!”","Lady Northern Feng said, “I heard she was treating Bao Er. How did she offend Her Majesty?","Seeing the look on the empress dowager’s face, Lady Northern Feng realized the latter was really infuriated. She smiled and said, “No matter what, Your Majesty is an elder. It would be disrespectful for a junior like her not to please you. Your Majesty, don’t be angry. I’ll teach her a lesson when she comes out and ask her to apologize to you.”","The empress dowager shook off Lady Northern Feng’s hand in a fit of pique. “I don’t want her apology!”","Lady Northern Feng’s stomach lurched.","What had Feng Wu done to make Her Majesty so angry?","At that thought, Lady Northern Feng changed the subject. “By the way, General Feng sent me a letter about the Dongsang Kingdom. The crown prince did a great job this time.”","The empress dowager was still angry with Jun Linyuan for siding with Feng Wu.. She had done so much to bring him up, but he had just asked her to leave the room! The more she thought about it, the angrier she got!"]},{"number":3458,"title":"Chapter 3458: Random Matchmaking (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3458: Random Matchmaking (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Normally, the empress dowager would have asked Lady Northern Feng questions by now, but her face was still grim.","Lady Northern Feng’s stomach lurched. It seemed that it was a big problem this time.","However, she knew the empress dowager best, and she was the best at coaxing the old lady. Therefore, Lady Northern Feng wasn’t anxious at all. Instead, she smiled and said, “But it was a close call. His Royal Highness almost died in the Dongsang Kingdom.”","WHAT?!","As she had expected, the empress dowager was so anxious that her heart almost jumped out of her throat.","She stared at Lady Northern Feng nervously.","Feng Xiangnan presided over Nest Fortress, and his only hobby was writing letters to his wife.","“We were going to lose, but in the end, a girl risked her life and fought like there was no tomorrow. Finally, she won the competition and obtained the opportunity to deliver the medicine.”","“This girl must be in love with Baby Jun,” the empress dowager chimed in with certainty.","Lady Northern Feng wasn’t sure, so she didn’t answer the empress dowager and only continued to tell the story.","“After the crown prince took the pill, he gained the upper hand.”","Just then, a figure appeared at the door. It was Emperor Wu.","After dealing with the matter of the Dongsang Kingdom, Emperor Wu returned with his chief steward, Master Gao.","Seeing him, Lady Northern Feng was about to salute him, when Emperor Wu waved his hand, signaling her to continue.","Lady Northern Feng nodded and went on. “The medicine which that girl gave His Royal Highness was divine. After taking it, the crown prince’s condition improved.”","Hua Wushuang frowned. “If that’s true, then this medicine must be a Semi-Divine elixir.”","Therefore, the general would write to his wife to tell her everything that happened in Nest as long as it wasn’t confidential information.","Everyone in Peace Grassland knew what wonders Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu had done in the Dongsang Kingdom, and there was no need to keep it a secret. Therefore, he wrote a letter to his wife every day.","That was why Lady Northern Feng knew everything that had happened in Peace Grassland.","“Sit down and tell me!”","Seeing that Lady Northern Feng wouldn’t say anything, the empress dowager dragged her to a seat.","She hated Feng Wu, not her Baby Jun, so she was still worried.","Hence, Lady Northern Feng told her about how the crown prince had fought Night Owl when he had yet to recover from his injuries.","“It was an earth-shattering battle. Dragging his sickly body, our crown prince withstood his enemy. If he hadn’t been injured, he would have won.","“Later on, there was an opportunity to give him a pill. However, we had to defeat the strongest team at the same Spiritual King stage to obtain this opportunity.","Hua Wushuang’s eyes lit up. “Lady Northern Feng, can you tell me her name? I’d like to meet her.”","Mrs. Hua smiled wryly. “The person you want to meet is that Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”","After that, Mrs. Hua explained to everyone, “Wushuang is also a medicine refiner. She’s quite talented and is about to become a Supreme Level medicine refiner. She’s just one step away.”","Mrs. Hua was still showing off when she said that.."]},{"number":3459,"title":"Chapter 3459: The Genius Girl (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3459: The Genius Girl (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Mrs. Hua wondered if she was seeing things, because she felt that His Majesty seemed to be looking at her meaningfully.","When Mrs. Hua looked at him, His Majesty had already turned to look at Lady Northern Feng.","At that moment, Hua Wushuang nodded and said to Lady Northern Feng seriously, “I’ve been stuck at the Supreme Level, so I’d like to meet this senior medicine refiner and ask for her advice.” Senior?","Emperor Wu glanced at Hua Wushuang.","Emperor Wu was now certain that the Semi-Divine medicine refiner was his future daughter-in-law, Feng Wu.","He had given Feng Wu access to the medicinal herbs warehouse in the palace and allowed her to refine pills at will, which allowed her to reach the","Semi-Divine level in one go. Moreover, she had taken away the divine cauldron that was in the palace.","Apart from Emperor Wu, Feng was the only one who knew about it. So, no one here knew that his genius future daughter-in-law was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","However, Mrs. Hua wondered if she was seeing things, because she felt that His Majesty seemed to be looking at her meaningfully.","When Mrs. Hua looked at him, His Majesty had already turned to look at Lady Northern Feng.","At that moment, Hua Wushuang nodded and said to Lady Northern Feng seriously, “I’ve been stuck at the Supreme Level, so I’d like to meet this senior medicine refiner and ask for her advice.” Senior?","Emperor Wu glanced at Hua Wushuang.","Emperor Wu was now certain that the Semi-Divine medicine refiner was his future daughter-in-law, Feng Wu.","He had given Feng Wu access to the medicinal herbs warehouse in the palace and allowed her to refine pills at will, which allowed her to reach the","Semi-Divine level in one go. Moreover, she had taken away the divine cauldron that was in the palace.","Apart from Emperor Wu, Feng was the only one who knew about it. So, no one here knew that his genius future daughter-in-law was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","At that thought, Emperor Wu was very pleased.","He knew something that the others didn’t.","Emperor Wu glanced at Hua Wushuang. “How old are you?”","“Your Majesty, I’m 18,” Hua Wushuang said respectfully.","Emperor Wu nodded and said nothing.","Xiao Wu was only 14 years old, much younger than this one. She was a junior, not a senior.","Emperor Wu still didn’t know what the empress dowager had promised. If he did, he would probably explode on the spot.","At that moment, the empress dowager cleared her throat. “What happened next?”","Lady Northern Feng almost forgot what she was saying.","She straightened her face and continued, “When the crown prince was about to win, Night Owl blew himself up with the crown prince in his arms!”","“OMG!”","The empress dowager turned pale. “How was Baby Jun? How was he?”","Lady Northern Feng said, “His Royal Highness was knocked out by the explosion, and we didn’t know if he was still alive!”","The empress dowager said, “What?!” Lady Northern Feng said, “His Royal Highness was on his deathbed!”","The empress dowager trembled. “What?!”","Lady Northern Feng said, “It’s true. The general said that he was going to hold a funeral for the crown prince, but that girl came out.","“She said that the only thing that could save His Royal Highness was the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid.”","“Yes, yes.” Hua Wushuang hurriedly nodded. “That girl is right. Only the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid can revive people. It seems that this girl is very close to that Semi-Divine medicine refiner. Is she her disciple?” Lady Northern Feng gave Hua Wushuang a strange look.","The empress dowager snapped, “Quiet!”","Hua Wushuang didn’t expect the empress dowager, who had been so fond of her a moment ago, to suddenly turn against her. She felt like crying. But the others weren’t surprised. The empress dowager had always been like that.","“Tell me!” The empress dowager urged Lady Northern Feng.","Lady Northern Feng recounted how Feng Wu had risked her life to steal the Immortal Spiritual Fruit from Mr. Sakiya of the Dongsang Kingdom. Of course, she didn’t go into the details. General Feng didn’t write that much in his letter, so she had to rely on her imagination.","She was a great storyteller, and her storytelling was entertaining and thrilling. It was even more exciting than what Feng Wu had actually experienced!","All eyes were on Lady Northern Feng, and no one wanted to miss a word.","Every sentence was as exciting as the next!","“OMG!”"]},{"number":3460,"title":"Chapter 3460: The Genius Girl (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3460: The Genius Girl (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“OMG!”","Jun Wuxia looked at Lady Northern Feng in disbelief. “Is that true? Did that really happen?!”","Lady Northern Feng said proudly, “My husband said so in his letter. What do you think?”","Feng Xiangnan was the most capable general of the Junwu Empire. No one would doubt what he said.","It had to be true!","Emperor Wu darted a look at Lady Northern Feng and found her rather naughty. She didn’t mention the girl’s name on purpose, but kept complimenting her.","Jun Wuxia and Hua Wushuang were idolizing that girl, but if they found out that it was Feng Wu...","Jun Wuxia said, “That girl is amazing! How did she do it?!”","Hua Wushuang also chimed in, “That was so dangerous. If she wasn’t careful, she could have been killed! This girl... This girl is so powerful. I don’t think she’s very young, is she?”","Lady Northern Feng didn’t answer her. Instead, she continued to brag about Feng wu.","“With the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, the crown prince was cured. Your Majesty,","do you think we should reward this girl?” “Yes! Of course! I have to reward her! Generously!”","The empress dowager was thrilled.","Lady Northern Feng said, “Your Majesty, don’t be in such a hurry. There’s more.”","The empress dowager said, “There’s more?!”","Lady Northern Feng said, “That’s right. We haven’t finished talking about the girl yet. She rushed over to Sun Castle again when she found out that the Dongsang Kingdom had a second Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","Lady Northern Feng told them about how Feng Wu had barged into the castle alone. Not only did she get the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, she also obtained 200 fighter jets.","If stealing the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid was dangerous, then the second time simply wasn’t something a person could do!","“200 fighter jets?!”","Although the Junwu Empire couldn’t make fighter jets, that didn’t mean that they hadn’t seen them before.","They had all seen fighter jets when the Dongsang Kingdom bombarded the Junwu Empire.","They were so precious.","It would be amazing to have one, but 200?!","Who was she kidding?!","The empress dowager couldn’t believe it, but Emperor Wu smiled at that moment.","“Lady Northern Feng is right, but I didn’t expect Feng Xiangnan to tell you about it.” What?","It was true?!","Everyone looked at Lady Northern Feng in shock!","Lady Northern Feng smiled. “Your Majesty, if you let him come back, he won’t have to write so many letters.”","Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “How could Nest survive without him?”","Without Feng Xiangnan, Nest would be as vulnerable as an unguarded egg. It would probably be destroyed as if it was made of paper.","“Who is she?” Hua Wushuang suddenly felt threatened.","Everyone looked at Lady Northern Feng curiously.","Lady Northern Feng, on the other hand, looked confused. “Didn’t I tell you her name?”","“You didn’t!” the empress dowager snapped. “Tell me who she is! I’m about to reward her! This child is incredible! She’s the pillar of the country now, and she’ll be incredible in the future.","“Besides, she saved Junjun’s life. A girl like that should be brought into the royal family.” The empress dowager made the decision. “Junjun isn’t married yet!”","Lady Northern Feng was dumbfounded.","If the empress dowager hadn’t said that, Lady Northern Feng would have been happy to say the name, but after what she said, wouldn’t mentioning Feng Wu be like a slap to the empress dowager’s face? Lady Northern Feng wondered what she should do.","However, the empress dowager kept urging her.. “Tell me! Who is it?!”"]},{"number":3461,"title":"Chapter 3461: Who’s That Girl?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3461: Who’s That Girl?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, the empress dowager kept urging her. “Tell me! Who is it?!”","Lady Northern Feng gave the empress dowager a complicated look.","The empress dowager wasn’t the only one urging her. The others urged her as well, and Hua Wushuang was looking at her eagerly.","Only Mrs. Hua frowned slightly.","Rubbing his chin, Emperor Wu smiled smugly.","Exasperated, Lady Northern Feng could only smile wryly. “Can’t you guess who she is?”","Guess?","Did she mean...","“Do we know her?” Jun Wuxia stared at Lady Northern Feng in amazement.","Lady Northern Feng said, “Of course. It’s Feng Wu.”","Empress Dugu, who was taking a sip of tea, couldn’t hold her breath and immediately spat the tea back into the teacup.","She realized how inappropriate that was and quickly looked up. When she realized that no one was paying attention to her, she slowly heaved a sigh of","I ranstator: Henyee I ranstatlons Editor: Henyee I ranstatlons","However, the empress dowager kept urging her. “Tell me! Who is it?!”","Lady Northern Feng gave the empress dowager a complicated look.","The empress dowager wasn’t the only one urging her. The others urged her as well, and Hua Wushuang was looking at her eagerly.","Only Mrs. Hua frowned slightly.","Rubbing his chin, Emperor Wu smiled smugly.","Exasperated, Lady Northern Feng could only smile wryly. “Can’t you guess who she is?”","Guess?","Did she mean...","“Do we know her?” Jun Wuxia stared at Lady Northern Feng in amazement.","Lady Northern Feng said, “Of course. It’s Feng Wu.”","Empress Dugu, who was taking a sip of tea, couldn’t hold her breath and immediately spat the tea back into the teacup.","She realized how inappropriate that was and quickly looked up. When she realized that no one was paying attention to her, she slowly heaved a sigh of relief.","Passing the teacup to her maid, Empress Dugu wiped the tea off her lips with a handkerchief and glanced at the empress dowager.","As expected, the empress dowager’s face was dark and gloomy, and it was quite scary.","Lady Northern Feng had been late to arrive, so she probably didn’t know that the empress dowager was angry at Feng Wu. Thinking that, Empress Dugu smirked.","Meanwhile, Jun Wuxia jumped to her feet. “That’s impossible! How is that possible? How can Feng Wu do that? I don’t believe it!”","Lady Northern Feng smiled. “I wouldn’t have believed it if the general hadn’t written it himself.”","The crowd was speechless.","The general had said so, so it had to be true.","Hua Wushuang frowned. “Isn’t Miss Feng Wu a Level 2 Spiritual King?”","Hua Wushuang saw Feng Wu as her love rival and wanted to criticize the latter whenever she could.","Jun Wuxia said anxiously, “That’s right! Isn’t Feng Wu a Level 2 Spiritual King? Everyone at Imperial College said that she was making breakthroughs so fast, but according to you, Lady Northern Feng, she did all those things in Sun Castle when she’s only a Level 2 Spiritual King. That’s ridiculous!”","Hua Wushuang nodded. That was right!","Lady Northern Feng gave them a strange look.","Jun Wuxia asked, “What’s wrong? Did I say something wrong?”","Lady Northern Feng said, “My husband said that little Feng Wu is already a Level 6 Spiritual King.”","Those words struck Jun Wuxia like a bolt of lightning.","Level 6 Spiritual King?","While she was still struggling to become a Spiritual Elder, Feng Wu was already a Level 6 Spiritual King!","“How is that possible? As far as I know, Zuo Qingluan is only a Level 2 Spiritual King. Why would Feng Wu...”","Lady Northern Feng glanced at Jun Wuxia. “Have you forgotten that Feng Wu has the Divine Phoenix Blood? Zuo Qingluan only has the True Phoenix Blood. How can she be better than Feng Wu?”","How could Zuo Qingluan compare with Feng Wu? Jun Wuxia wanted to cry. Zuo Qingluan’s talent was something she had always dreamed of but had never been able to reach. As for Feng Wu... Jun Wuxia wished she hadn’t heard anything.","Hua Wushuang was dumbfounded.","The Hua family of Heartless Valley was one of the nine influential families, but they had been living in seclusion for the past hundred years. Therefore, they didn’t know much about Feng Wu.","The Divine Phoenix Blood?","Hua Wushuang and Mrs. Hua looked at each other, their eyes shining! No one noticed that look. If they had, they would definitely be surprised.."]},{"number":3462,"title":"Chapter 3462: That Girl Is Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Chapter 3462: That Girl Is Feng Wu","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Northern Feng shrugged. “But she’s already a Level 6 Spiritual King. I heard that little Feng Wu was lucky enough to find all-purpose transformation liquid. The elders of Imperial College have all made huge breakthroughs. Nest is overjoyed, and the elders are praising little Feng Wu!”","Elders?","No matter how ignorant everyone was, they knew that the elders of Imperial College were at the Spiritual Overlord stage at least!","“That’s impossible.” Hua Wushuang stood up and said seriously, “The all-purpose transformation liquid can indeed increase one’s strength, but it usually comes in drops. How can it be used by so many people?”","In other words, Lady Northern Feng had to be exaggerating.","The empress dowager nodded.","She didn’t want to hear Lady Northern Feng brag about Feng Wu, so she was glad that Hua Wushuang was here to raise questions.","However, Emperor Wu smiled.","“Miss Hua, here’s the thing: Xiao Wu is a lucky girl. How could she only have found a few drops of all-purpose transformation liquid? She found a pool of","A pool.","It sounded like a lot.","Hua Wushuang wondered if the pool was bigger than a bathtub.","Emperor Wu pondered for a moment, then said, “Perhaps a lake would be more accurate.”","Hua Wushuang looked at Emperor Wu in shock.","However, Emperor Wu didn’t even glance at her. He only said, “I wonder how","Xiao Wu is doing inside.”","Hua Wushuang gave Jun Wuxia a look.","Jun Wuxia nodded and said to Emperor Wu, “Father, Feng Wu won’t be able to do it. Let’s go find her!”","Emperor Wu looked at her in confusion. “Who?”","Jun Wuxia said, “The Semi-Divine medicine refiner!” Hua Wushuang nodded!","Emperor Wu asked, “What Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”","Jun Wuxia said anxiously, “Didn’t Lady Northern Feng say that Feng Wu delivered a Semi-Divine elixir to His Royal Highness? We must have a Semi -Divine medicine refiner in the Junwu Empire! If we can find her, Bao Er will be saved!”","The empress dowager nodded and gave Jun Wuxia an approving look.","She couldn’t let that Feng Wu steal all the limelight. She needed a Semi-Divine medicine refiner to suppress Feng Wu!","Jun Wuxia was elated by the empress dowager’s look.","She had finally figured out how to please the old lady. All she had to do was oppose Feng Wu, which was so easy.","However, Emperor Wu looked at Jun Wuxia as if she was retarded. “You don’t know?”","Jun Wuxia said, “I... What don’t I know?” Everyone looked at Emperor Wu.","At that moment, footsteps came from inside.","Everyone looked at the door.","Jun Linyuan walked out with Feng Wu in his arms.","He was carrying her.","Yes, he was!","Hua Wushuang only took one glance, and jealousy filled her eyes! Her heart burned with anger!","She wouldn’t be feeling this way if the empress dowager hadn’t promised her the title of crown princess’s consort. Jun Linyuan was going to be her future husband, but he was holding another girl. What was going on?!","However, Hua Wushuang was too reserved to make a sound, so she could only look to her grandmother for help.","Mrs. Hua gave her a look to calm her down. The empress dowager would be the nrst to ny Inco a rage.","As expected!","Seeing the crown prince come out with Feng Wu in his arms, the empress dowager pounded the floor with her walking stick three times and bellowed, “Linyuan, come here!”","However, the crown prince glanced at the empress dowager and said calmly, “I’ll take the girl to take a bath first..”"]},{"number":3463,"title":"Chapter 3463: Take Her to Bath","paragraphs":["Chapter 3463: Take Her to Bath","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Take her to bath?!","The empress dowager almost exploded!","“I told you to come here!” The empress dowager scolded Jun Linyuan. “Are you not going to listen to my order now?”","The empress dowager was so furious that tears welled up in her eyes. It was obvious that she was truly upset. The crown prince stared at her coldly.","Feng Wu was in his arms.","Feng Wu’s cultivation level had dropped to Level 4 after saving Bao Er, but she hadn’t fainted yet. Therefore, she tugged at Jun Linyuan’s shirt with her weak hands.","However, Jun Linyuan tightened his grip on her. He glanced back at the empress dowager, then carried Feng Wu down the stairs.","The empress dowager looked astonished.","She couldn’t begin to describe her feelings.","He was her Baby Jun!","This was the Baby Jun she had painstakingly raised!","Take her to bath?!","The empress dowager almost exploded!","“I told you to come here!” The empress dowager scolded Jun Linyuan. “Are you not going to listen to my order now?”","The empress dowager was so furious that tears welled up in her eyes. It was obvious that she was truly upset. The crown prince stared at her coldly.","Feng Wu was in his arms.","Feng Wu’s cultivation level had dropped to Level 4 after saving Bao Er, but she hadn’t fainted yet. Therefore, she tugged at Jun Linyuan’s shirt with her weak hands.","However, Jun Linyuan tightened his grip on her. He glanced back at the empress dowager, then carried Feng Wu down the stairs.","The empress dowager looked astonished.","She couldn’t begin to describe her feelings.","He was her Baby Jun!","This was the Baby Jun she had painstakingly raised!","Ever since the late emperor passed away, the emperor had been sensible and filial. She had basically ignored him and focused on raising the crown prince, but the crown prince had actually forgotten about his grandmother after getting a girl!","Tears welled up in the empress dowager’s eyes.","Emperor Wu couldn’t bear to see her like this. He went up to help the empress dowager up. “Mother, let’s go back to the palace.”","Everyone else lowered their heads. Anyone who dared to look at the sorry state the empress dowager was in would be in trouble!","The room was silent as everyone deliberately lowered their breathing.","The empress dowager lost her temper as if no one was around!","She flung Emperor Wu’s hand away and said in an aggrieved and angry voice, “I’m going to sit right here! Take a bath? Let’s see if she dares! Granny Gui, go and pass on my orders. Tell that girl to crawl here right now or I’ll chop off her head!”","Emperor Wu felt a headache coming on. Why was the empress dowager so unreasonable?","“Mother...”","However, before Emperor Wu could finish, the empress dowager said angrily, “And you, the emperor! Are you going to disobey me like the crown prince? Do you want me to die?!”","“Of course not...’","“Then shut up! Why are you interfering in women’s matters? Go back to the palace and do your job!”","“Mother...","Emperor Wu rubbed his temples. Things had gone the empress dowager’s way for a while, and she hadn’t been this angry in years.","He knew that he wouldn’t be able to persuade her, so he only gave Empress Dugu a warning look.","“Empress Dugu, you’ve served my mother for many years. You know that she’s only throwing a tantrum for the time being. If someone aggravates the situation and makes her fall sick from anger, I’ll hold you responsible!” After that, Emperor Wu left with his hands behind his back.","The dumbfounded Empress Dugu was left behind.","She couldn’t believe it!","She really hadn’t said anything this time. She was just adding fuel to the fire. How could His Majesty be so biased and put all the blame on her?","“Go!” The empress dowager glared at Granny Gui.","Granny Gui had never liked Feng Wu. Now that she had the chance, she wouldn’t miss it.","Hence, she left happily.","Jun Linyuan’s spacious residence was outside the imperial palace.","It took Granny Gui a while to find the bathing pool.","Rather than call it a bathing pool, it was more like an essence gathering pool.","Because of the underground essence veins, the spiritual essence here was the richest in the imperial capital. Therefore, Jun Linyuan had specially set up an essence gathering pool here, where he cultivated most of the time when he was in the capital.."]},{"number":3464,"title":"Chapter 3464: Clever Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 3464: Clever Girl","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Granny Gui was surprised to see Jun Linyuan sitting cross-legged outside the Spirit Gathering Pool when she arrived with some ferocious servants.","Why was the crown prince here?","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had already stripped naked and was lying in the pool, absorbing the spiritual essence in big gulps.","Six major healing spells and a big bowl of blood... Feng Wu was now as dry as a withered tree and needed a lot of replenishment.","The spiritual essence in the pool was rich, but it wasn’t enough for Feng Wu right now.","Fortunately...","She had the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Feng Wu was glad that she had kept a barrel of all-purpose transformation liquid in her storage space for emergencies. Now was the time to use it.","After the all-purpose transformation liquid was poured in, Feng Wu’s pale face gradually regained some color.","But that was all.","She had internal injuries now, and the all-purpose transformation liquid couldn’t heal them all at once.","However, Feng Wu only thought of recovering some of her strength and mental strength since Bao Er’s life was still in danger.","Previously, Bao Er’s Health Points dropped to 1. When everyone thought that Bao Er couldn’t make it, her HP began to rise slowly.","Then, it remained stable at a certain level.","Master Chu had asked Feng Wu what a normal person’s HP should be, and Feng Wu told him it was 100.","Master Chu then asked Feng Wu how much health Bao Er needed before she was out of danger.","Feng Wu told him that 60 was the threshold.","Right now, Bao Er was still far from passing that point.","Feng Wu thought of the empress dowager and how angry she looked.","However, she shook her head with a wry smile. Right now, she had no time to worry about the empress dowager. Saving Bao Er alone would take all her energy. As for the empress dowager, Jun Linyuan would have to deal with her. Worried about Bao Er, Feng Wu wanted to get up after she felt a little better.","At that moment, there was a commotion outside.","“Your Royal Highness, the empress dowager has summoned Miss Feng Wu.” Granny Gui was very polite at first.","After all, Jun Linyuan was notorious for his temper.","Feng wasn’t around; if he were, he would have been able to tell that the crown prince was angry.","Seeing Jun Linyuan’s dark face, Granny Gui was a little scared. However, she remembered that the empress dowager was her backer. No matter how bad the crown prince’s temper was, he couldn’t be angry with the empress dowager.","After all, being a crown prince was still a long way away from being the emperor, and he would still need the empress dowager’s help.","At that thought, Granny Gui grew bolder.","She tried to persuade Jun Linyuan as an elder.","“Your Royal Highness, I know I’m not qualified to lecture the crown prince, but if I don’t say something, the empress dowager will feel wronged.","“Your Royal Highness, the empress dowager went through so much to raise you. Everything she did was for you. Have you ever been wronged?","“But now, you’re talking back to the empress dowager because of a girl who doesn’t know what’s good for her. The empress dowager is so angry that she’s crying. Your Royal Highness, why don’t you hand Feng Wu over to Her Majesty? She’ll be returned to you when she’s been disciplined, okay?” Feng Wu, who had already cleaned herself up, frowned a little.","What the hell? The empress dowager? What had she done wrong that the empress dowager had to discipline her?"]},{"number":3465,"title":"Chapter 3465: The Crown Prince’s Consort (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3465: The Crown Prince’s Consort (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was taken aback. What? The empress dowager was going to discipline her?","Before she could get angry, the crown prince took action.","“Go away!”","By the time Feng Wu hurried outside, the noisy Granny Gui had already been kicked away by Jun Linyuan.","Granny Gui was sent flying into a tree and almost couldn’t get down.","The group of ferocious servants she brought all knelt on the ground and trembled, not daring to say a word.","Jun Linyuan turned around and saw that Feng Wu’s face was still pale. He frowned. “Why didn’t you stay inside for a while longer?”","He was clearly worried about her, but his expression still looked unpleasant.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I don’t know how Bao Er is doing now. I don’t want all my efforts to go to waste. Let’s go and keep an eye on her.”","But Jun Linyuan stayed where he was and just looked at her. “Are you sure you’re alright?”","Feng Wu rubbed her temple. “It’ll be great if no one disturbs me.”","Jun Linyuan threw Feng Wu over his shoulder.","What a posture...","Feng Wu panicked and waved her hands around. “Put me down! Put me down!","However, no matter how the girl bared her fangs and brandished her claws, Jl Linyuan still carried her, not looking embarrassed at all.","“The empress dowager will be furious when she sees you like this,” Feng Wu reminded him.","“I know,” Jun Linyuan said indifferently.","Sure enough, when they passed by the inner hall, the empress dowager was infuriated to see how intimate they were. She clutched her chest and gasped.","Frowning, Jun Linyuan darted a look at the empress dowager and said impatiently, “Granny Gong, take the empress dowager back to the palace.”","With that, he was about to carry Feng Wu inside.","However, the empress dowager was furious.","“Linyuan! ” the empress dowager snapped. “Are you going to obey me or not?!” The crown prince stopped at the door with a frown.","The empress dowager was delighted to see him stop and said in a hurry, “I don’t like her. Let her go now!”","Jun Linyuan turned around and stared at the empress dowager.","Patting him on the back, Feng Wu urged him to put her down.","Jun Linyuan wouldn’t let her go. He stared at the empress dowager with cold eyes.","The empress dowager felt a little guilty...","However, she saw Hua Wushuang out of the corner of her eye and had an idea. She said loudly, “I’ve already made the decision to make Miss Wushuang the crown prince’s consort. It’s inappropriate for you to carry that girl around. Put her down!”","In an instant, Hua Wushuang’s heart was in her throat!","Why did she suddenly feel the temperature drop? It was as if she couldn’t breathe...","She wasn’t the only one who felt suffocated.","The surrounding people also felt the cold air suffocating them.","The crown prince’s consort?","The crown prince glanced at the empress dowager and smirked. Then, he carried Feng Wu away.","He never hesitated for a moment!","The smirk on his face and the way he turned around made the empress dowager’s chest hurt.","“Your Majesty!”","“Your Majesty!”","The empress dowager tried the same trick again, and everyone rushed forward. However, Jun Linyuan didn’t even look up as he carried Feng Wu away.","The empress dowager was really pissed off this time.","The disdainful smirk on his face was too hurtful.","It was as if all her decisions were meaningless.","That infuriated the empress dowager.."]},{"number":3466,"title":"Chapter 3466: The Crown Prince’s Consort (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3466: The Crown Prince’s Consort (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The empress dowager grabbed Hua Wushuang, her face twisted with jealousy.","“I said you’re the crown prince’s consort, so you’re the crown prince’s consort!”","Hua Wushuang was a little nervous. “But His Royal Highness...”","The empress dowager was furious. “The crown prince doesn’t have the final say!”","Hua Wushuang looked at her grandmother for help.","Mrs. Hua helped the empress dowager up and pushed her back into the chair.","She smiled bitterly. “Why don’t we just forget about this marriage...”","However, the more Mrs. Hua said, the angrier the empress dowager became!","“I won’t allow it! In any case, I’ve already decided that Wushuang will be the crown prince’s future consort! No one is allowed to object!” The empress dowager shouted at the backyard, but there was no reply at all.","She was fuming.","Her head really began to ache.","Lady Northern Feng felt helpless. Why didn’t the empress dowager get along with Xiao Wu? Logically speaking, the girl had always been obedient and likable. She had no idea why the empress dowager was like this.","Empress Dugu glanced at Mrs. Hua.","Mrs. Hua had been the empress dowager’s friend since they were teenagers, so the empress dowager was very happy whenever she saw her.","In Empress Dugu’s opinion, this Mrs. Hua wasn’t easy to deal with.","The empress dowager had already backed off a little just now, but Mrs. Hua deliberately said that to let the marriage go. How could the proud empress dowager stand that? She was bound to insist that Hua Wushuang had to be the crown prince’s consort.","If Mrs. Hua had really wanted to turn down the marriage, she could have waited for the empress dowager to calm down. She knew the empress dowager too well. Empress Dugu snorted inwardly.","Recalling the emperor’s warning, she couldn’t help but say, “Your Majesty, it’s getting cold. You may catch a cold here. Why don’t we go back to the palace first?”","“No!” The empress dowager was still furious. “I want to see if Feng Wu, a Supreme Level medicine refiner, can save Bao Er. She might kill Bao Er!” “What...” Hua Wushuang’s eyes were filled with jealousy!","Feng Wu was even a Supreme Level medicine refiner? A beautiful woman like her shouldn’t need to know any skills. Hua Wushuang was so annoyed!","Seeing Hua Wushuang’s expression, Lady Northern Feng was displeased.","She hadn’t announced who that Semi-Divine medicine refiner was because of the empress dowager’s feelings, but how dare this girl dislike Xiao Wu? Who did she think she was?","Hua Wushuang thought of something and asked Lady Northern Feng, “Didn’t Lady Northern Feng say that she knows that Semi-Divine medicine refiner? If a Supreme Level medicine refiner can’t cure Bao Er, why don’t I ask that master for help?”","The empress dowager also wanted to embarrass Feng Wu, so she asked Lady","Northern Feng in a cold voice, “Who’s that Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”","Lady Northern Feng hesitated. “Maybe I shouldn’t say her name.” The empress dowager was even more eager to hear who it was. “Tell me now!”","Empress Dugu, who knew Feng Wu well, felt her stomach lurch.","Seriously?!","Could it be what she thought?!","Sure enough, Lady Northern Feng looked at the empress dowager in resignation. “You really don’t want to hear this. I’m leaving now...”","With that, Lady Northern Feng was about to leave.","“Stop right there! Is everyone disobeying me today? Tell me!” The empress dowager glared at Lady Northern Feng.","Lady Northern Feng said in resignation, “I hope you won’t regret it.”","The empress dowager said, “Tell me!”","Lady Northern Feng shrugged. “Who else could it be?”","After that, she hinted to the empress dowager with her eyes that the person was in the golden room.."]},{"number":3467,"title":"Chapter 3467: A Semi-Divine Medicine Refiner","paragraphs":["Chapter 3467: A Semi-Divine Medicine Refiner","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The empress dowager looked at Lady Northern Feng in shock! Lady Northern Feng nodded. “It really is her.”","The empress dowager wanted to kick Lady Northern Feng!","Didn’t she know that the empress dowager was in the middle of a fit of anger? She was only making it worse!","What kind of daughter was she?!","“Go away!” The empress dowager pushed Lady Northern Feng away impatiently, not wanting to see her again.","Lady Northern Feng had no choice but to say, “Shall I go sit in the outer hall?”","The empress dowager was furious!","“If you don’t leave, I’ll leave!”","The empress dowager couldn’t stay here any longer. If Feng Wu really was a Semi- Divine medicine refiner and saved Bao Er...","The empress dowager suddenly remembered something she had said before.","If Feng Wu really saved Bao Er, she would apologize to her.","The empress dowager looked at Lady Northern Feng in shock! Lady Northern Feng nodded. “It really is her.”","The empress dowager wanted to kick Lady Northern Feng!","Didn’t she know that the empress dowager was in the middle of a fit of anger? She was only making it worse!","What kind of daughter was she?!","“Go away!” The empress dowager pushed Lady Northern Feng away impatiently, not wanting to see her again.","Lady Northern Feng had no choice but to say, “Shall I go sit in the outer hall?”","The empress dowager was furious!","“If you don’t leave, I’ll leave!”","The empress dowager couldn’t stay here any longer. If Feng Wu really was a Semi -Divine medicine refiner and saved Bao Er...","The empress dowager suddenly remembered something she had said before.","If Feng Wu really saved Bao Er, she would apologize to her.","Apologize!","“Let’s go!”","No one could make the empress dowager leave earlier, but she was leaving on her own accord now, and no one could stop her.","Empress Dugu heaved a sigh of relief.","That was good news. If the empress dowager left now, the emperor wouldn’t blame his wife later.","Ever since Empress Dugu was scolded by the emperor, she had been behaving herself and never said anything bad about Feng Wu.","Mrs. Hua wanted to say goodbye, but the empress dowager said, “You can leave, but I’ll take Wushuang with me. It’ll be good for her to familiarize herself with the place.”","Mrs. Hua demurred again, but the empress dowager ignored her and took Hua","Wushuang into the palace.","The empress dowager was still very grumpy after she went back.","A whole day passed after that.","She had wanted to ask Granny Lan how Bao Er was doing several times, but despite her anxiety, the proud empress dowager didn’t ask.","Granny Lan had been waiting on the empress dowager the whole time. Seeing the empress dowager walking around, she wanted to ask if Her Majesty wanted","Miss Feng Wu to save Bao Er, or...","At that thought, Granny Lan lowered her head.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was trying her best to save Bao Er.","Bao Er’s HP had already risen to 30, but suddenly, her condition turned critical, and her HP plummeted!","Jun Linyuan didn’t look pleased.","Seeing that Feng Wu hadn’t recovered and was still trying her best to save Bao Er, Jun Linyuan stopped her before she drew another bowl of her own blood.","“Stop!”","The crown prince’s face darkened.","Seeing that Bao Er’s health was dropping, Feng Wu tried to push Jun Linyuan away.","However, Jun Linyuan’s grip was so firm that Feng Wu couldn’t fight back.","She snapped. “My blood can be replenished, but Bao Er can’t be revived!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything. He stared at her with cold eyes and pursed his lips. He wouldn’t allow it!","Feng Wu said, “I took the Immortal Spiritual Fruit that belonged to her. How could I...”","“No one said that the Immortal Spiritual Fruit has to be hers.”","Jun Linyuan stared at her.","Feng Wu said, “What?”","The crown prince said, “It belongs to whoever is capable enough to get it!”","Feng Wu said, “But...”","Jun Linyuan said, “I have the Dragon Phoenix Blood.”","Feng Wu smacked her head. “That’s right! How could I have forgotten that? But my Divine Phoenix Blood has just fused with Bao Er; if your Dragon Phoenix Blood fuses with her now, will that be alright?” Jun Linyuan said coldly, “It’s up to her fate.”","It was rare for Feng Wu to see Jun Linyuan so serious.","Didn’t he cherish Bao Er very much? Why didn’t he let her use her blood to save Bao Er? Feng Wu couldn’t figure it out.","Feng Wu was still in a daze when Jun Linyuan drew a bowl of his blood.","“Save her..”"]},{"number":3468,"title":"Chapter 3468: Resuscitation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3468: Resuscitation","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","His voice was cold, devoid of any warmth, but it somehow reassured Feng Wu. “Alright.” Feng Wu took the blood and injected it into Bao Er’s veins.","Bao Er had drunk Feng Wu’s blood, and the Dragon Phoenix Blood had now been injected into her veins. Feng Wu hoped that the two wouldn’t touch each other. Otherwise, she didn’t know what would happen.","As the Dragon Phoenix Blood was injected, Bao Er’s HP, which had been falling fast, finally stopped dropping when it reached 5.","Feng Wu’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets. She only closed her eyes when she saw that.","Finally... it stopped.","It was destined not to be a quiet night.","Bao Er’s condition fluctuated frequently.","Her HP would rise to 50, but in the next second, it would fall rapidly.","Then, it rose and fell again.","This happened over and over again.","Feng Wu was exhausted.","It wasn’t until the sun rose that Feng Wu, who had saved Bao Er dozens of times, finally fell asleep.","When she woke up again, it was already late in the morning.","Granny Gong was delighted to see Feng Wu awake. She said excitedly, “I’ll get","His Royal Highness now!”","“Hey, wait a minute,” Feng Wu called out to Granny Gong. “How’s Bao Er? Is she still relapsing?","Jun Linyuan didn’t have time to take care of anyone, so Granny Gong was the one who had raised Bao Er since she was a baby, which was why Granny Gong loved Bao Er so much.","Granny Gong saw how Feng Wu had tried her best to save Bao Er.","Hearing Feng Wu’s question, Granny Gong said in a hurry, “It’s been two days since Bao Er woke up, but she’s been sleeping most of the time. She’s not in good spirits, but there’s nothing wrong with her. Miss Wu, you can visit her after you feel better.”","Feng Wu rose to her feet. “I think I’ll go take a look now. I won’t feel at ease until I do.”","Suddenly, she gripped her blanket.","A thought suddenly flashed across her mind!","Two days?","Had she forgotten something important?","Otherwise, why did she feel a little uneasy?","Suddenly!","Feng Wu froze!","She finally remembered what she had forgotten!","With a thud, Feng Wu fell back onto the bed.","Her head hit the edge of the bed, and it hurt so much that she was about to cry.","However, her attention was not on this at all because...","Taken aback by Feng Wu’s sudden reaction, Granny Gong hurried over to help her up. “Miss wu? Miss wu?!”","Bao Er had just gotten better. They couldn’t let Miss Wu fall ill now. Granny Gong panicked.","She looked outside in a hurry and shouted, “Your Royal Highness! Your Royal Highness!”","Feng Wu waved her hand. “Don’t call Jun Linyuan! No!”","However, the crown prince had already rushed in!","He ran so fast that he only managed to put on one of the shoes. The other foot was bare.","Jun Linyuan, who had always been calm, had never been in such a hurry.","“Are you hurt?” Jun Linyuan took Feng Wu from Granny Gong and checked her pulse.","Sensing her steady and strong pulse, he heaved a sigh of relief.","Glaring at Feng Wu, he said in a displeased tone, “Why are you yelling?","Feng Wu covered her face with both hands!","She didn’t want to see Jun Linyuan, not now!","Because...","The fairy was telling her what had happened.","The fairy wrung her hands and stammered, “I couldn’t wait for you to wake up, could I? You were unconscious, and I couldn’t wake you up...’"]},{"number":3469,"title":"Chapter 3469: Get Out!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3469: Get Out!","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu stared at the fairy in frustration. She didn’t know what to say.","A passionate relationship with Jun Linyuan?","The fairy had chosen that for her!","“Should I have picked the other one?” The fairy fidgeted with her hands, looking very pitiful.","Feng Wu was speechless.","“Then tell me, which one would you have chosen?” the fairy asked.","Feng Wu was speechless.","The fairy said, “See? You’re in a difficult position yourself, aren’t you? I was also in a dilemma, so I closed my eyes and clicked one. I didn’t know which it would be.”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure you did it with your eyes closed?”","The fairy said, “Well... that’s the way it is...”","“Xiao Wii?”","Seeing Feng Wu bury her head in the blanket, the crown prince patted Feng Wu’s raised butt.","Feng Wu flushed and turned around to glare at Jun Linyuan.","She saw his unbelievably handsome face.","Feng Wu’s ears turned red at the thought of falling in love with the teenager.","“Do you have a fever?”","Not knowing what was going on, the crown prince picked up Feng Wu, then wrapped the blanket around her.","The back of his hand brushed against Feng Wu’s cheek when he tucked her in, and Feng Wu’s face was as red as a tomato.","The crown prince had no idea how embarrassed Feng Wu felt when he took care of her with an expressionless face.","He sat on the bed and touched Feng Wu’s smooth forehead.","“It’s very hot.” Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu with a grim face. “Did you kick off the blanket while you were sleeping?”","It had nothing to do with kicking off the blanket at all! Feng Wu felt like rolling around in bed and didn’t know what to do.","“Get out of here!” Feng Wu said glumly as she buried herself in the soft blanket, only showing her face.","The crown prince frowned as if he hadn’t heard Feng Wu.","He reached under the blanket and checked Feng Wu’s pulse. He stared at Feng Wu without blinking.","His eyes were so deep and bright that they looked like obsidian... Feng Wu averted her gaze.","“You’re a little weak. Your internal injuries are still quite serious!” The crown prince didn’t look pleased.","“I’m fine. Just leave.” Feng Wu was impatient.","Jun Linyuan said, “Someone’s already investigating what happened in Black","Cloud Alley. Don’t worry, no one can...” “I said get out! Didn’t you hear me?!”","Feng Wu suddenly raised her voice!","In a moment of desperation, Feng Wu’s voice was shrill and piercing.","Jun Linyuan seemed stunned.","As far as he could remember, no one had ever spoken to him with such an attitude.","Feng Wu was shocked by her own words.","“I...” Feng Wu pursed her lips.","However, before she could say anything else, Jun Linyuan rose to his feet. He gave Feng Wu a meaningful look and left.","He left without hesitation.","The door closed with a loud bang.","Granny Gong’s stomach lurched.","She wanted to talk to the crown prince, but he seemed so angry that even Granny Gong, who had taken care of Jun Linyuan since he was a child, didn’t dare say anything.","She let out a long sigh.","Why were these two...","Looking at the closed door, Granny Gong wanted to go in and talk to Feng Wu, but.."]},{"number":3470,"title":"Chapter 3470: Angry Teenager","paragraphs":["Chapter 3470: Angry Teenager","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Right now, what Miss Wu needed the most was probably to be alone for a while.","After some thought, Granny Gong sighed.","The young couple still had a long way to go...","Hearing Jun Linyuan’s footsteps, Feng Wu buried her face in the blanket in frustration.","She whined.","She wasn’t trying to be mean to Jun Linyuan, but she was too embarrassed to see his handsome face.","Holding her head in her hands, Feng Wu rolled around in bed.","Right now, the crown prince was furious!","Everyone in the residence knew that His Royal Highness was angry.","That was because the entire mansion felt like a refrigerator. The atmosphere felt oppressive.","Everyone trembled and didn’t dare to make a sound.","The servants used to talk to each other as they walked, but they all lowered their heads and hurried along, afraid that they would become the crown prince’s target.","“It’s all my fault...”","The fairy felt so guilty that she lowered her head, tears rolling down her cheeks.","“It’s all my fault... I should have chosen the other option for you...","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Actuallv. she had onlv said those words in a fit of anger. She wasn’t blaming the fairy.","“If you really don’t want to do it, there’s a way out...”","The fairy sobbed and spoke intermittently.","“Because the choice hasn’t been made for more than a day, it can be withdrawn.”","The fairy wiped her tears. “I’ll withdraw it for you now.”","What?!","Was that an option, too?","For some reason, Feng Wu stopped the fairy. “Wait!”","Tears welled up in the fairy’s eyes, and she asked, “What’s wrong?","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","The fairy reminded Feng Wu, “We won’t be able to withdraw it after a while.” Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","The fairy looked at Feng Wu in confusion. “Do you not want to take it back?” Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Should she withdraw it? She had no idea. Feng Wu covered her eyes in frustration. She knew that relationships were too troublesome.","She would rather carry a 30-meter saber and fight to the death with a Spiritual Overlord than make such a difficult choice.","“Will it affect you if I withdraw it?” Feng Wu changed the subject.","The fairy said, “It doesn’t really affect me.” Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","The fairy asked, “Are we withdrawing it now?”","Feng Wu began to wonder if the fairy was doing it on purpose.","The fairy repeated the question.","Feng Wu’s head ached at her nagging. Holding her head, she said, “I don’t know. I don’t know. I don’t know anything...”","The fairy said, “If you withdraw it, I’ll just have a little stomachache. It really doesn’t matter. ”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at her. “Isn’t a stomachache an illness? Don’t treat it like a minor symptom. It can hurt like hell.” The fairy said, “Alright.","“So there’s really no need to withdraw it?” That question again.","It almost sounded like a spell in Feng Wur s ear.","Feng Wu felt like crying.","“No! No! No!”","She flew into a rage out of embarrassment.."]},{"number":3471,"title":"Chapter 3471: Gaze on Her Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 3471: Gaze on Her Back","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu tossed and turned on the bed. Worried about Bao Er’s condition, she freqhenpd lin and went tn the vnlden nalacp tn Innk for her","The golden palace was silent.","While Feng Wu was unconscious, Master Chu had been taking care of Bao Er.","As Feng Wu approached the golden palace, she saw a tall and handsome figure standing under the roof outside. The teenager was wearing a brocade robe and red shoes. He leaned against the golden pillar and glanced at Feng Wu.","Jun Linyuan!","Why was he here?","The two of them looked at each other and were both stunned.","Immediately, the two of them involuntarily turned their heads away.","Feng Wu wanted to turn around and leave right away.","But if she left now, wouldn’t that mean that she had a guilty conscience? Feng Wu stood there, not knowing whether to leave or go in.","Clasping his hands behind his back, the crown prince glanced at Feng Wu expressionlessly. His eyes were as dark as a wolf’s, and he looked arrogant and intimidating.","Feng Wu felt a little guilty and angry.","How could Jun Linyuan treat her so coldly? She felt like crying.","Just as Feng Wu was about to leave, she heard laughter outside the door.","“Xiao Wu, why are you standing here? Why aren’t you going in?”","It was Feng Xun.","He didn’t seem to notice the awkward atmosphere at all. He was smiling brightly, and his eyes were as bright as the sun shining on the glazed tiles.","“What are you standing there for? Let’s go in.” Holding a bag of food in one hand, Feng Xun pushed Feng Wu in with his free hand.","Feng Wu went in after some hesitation.","She could sense Jun Linyuan’s domineering aura when she walked past him.","She didn’t look up. She lowered her head and stepped through the door.","However, Feng Xun said at that moment, “Xiao Wu, why are you walking with your head down? Is there a wallet to pick up? Or did you have a fight with Boss","Jun?”","Feng Wu lost her footing and almost tripped over the threshold. She hit her head with a loud bang.","Feng Xun was shocked.","“Are you a three-year-old? You tripped over the threshold? Feng Wu, you’re a Spiritual King.”","Normally, Feng Wu would have turned around and punched him.","However, Feng Wu could clearly feel Jun Linyuan staring at her from behind.","His gaze was terrifyingly intense.","Feng Wu didn’t turn around to argue with Feng Xun, and just ran into the room.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in surprise, then turned to Jun Linyuan. “Boss Jun, what’s wrong with this girl? Why did she let me go?”","Hearing this, the corners of Jun Linyuan’s mouth curled up into an arrogant sneer.","Feng Xun scratched his head.","Were they arguing again?","Feng Xun said, “Boss Jun, did you make that girl angry again?”","The crown prince gave him a cold look.","Feng Xun rubbed his neck, feeling a little scared.","It seemed that the argument was a little serious this time.","Feng Xun said, “Shall I go in, then?”","Without waiting for Jun Linyuan’s reply, Feng Xun scratched his head and went in.","Jun Linyuan went in behind Feng Xun.","His handsome face was still expressionless, and there was no warmth in his deep eyes.","Feng Wu was talking to Master Chu.","The two of them discussed what Bao Er’s condition had been like over the past two days.","Master Chu told Feng Wu that he had been treating Bao Er according to Feng Wu’s instructions for the past two days with medicine and acupuncture.","Feng Wu nodded and walked up to Bao Er.."]},{"number":3472,"title":"Chapter 3472: Get Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3472: Get Out","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","By then, Bao Er had woken up, and the little girl was staring at Feng Wu with her big, round eyes.","She had exquisite facial features. Because she had always been sick all these years, her originally fair skin had become even paler.","Her big eyes were dark and round, and she was a lovely girl. However, because she was too thin, her head seemed a little big. Her tiny frame and big head made one’s heart ache.","Feng Wu looked at her health bar.","Her HP had reached 60, just past the threshold.","Feng Wu was about to talk to the girl, when she saw that Bao Er had fallen asleep again.","Master Chu told Feng Wu, “Bao Er wakes up from time to time, but every time she wakes up, she’ll fall asleep again after a quarter of an hour.”","Feng Wu looked at the little girl, who was buried under the blanket with only her tiny face exposed, and sighed in pity. “She’s too weak to take the energy she needs when she wakes up.”","Master Chu asked, “How can we...’ Feng Xun walked in.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder.","Although Feng Xun was walking in front, the first person Feng Wu saw was Jun Linyuan, who was walking behind Feng Xun.","He was dazzling, noble, and insufferably arrogant.","That kind of attraction wasn’t something that she could ignore.","Feng Wu turned around and focused on Bao Er.","Feng Xun turned around and looked at Boss Jun, only to see him leaning against another pillar with his arms crossed. He was still staring at Feng Wu as if he wanted to dig a hole in her back.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in silence.","Bao Er had already fallen asleep, and Feng Wu had nothing to do, but she kept her head down as if she were busy.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","How could these two people be so awkward?","Feng Xun said, “Bao Er said she wanted to eat spring rolls from Song’s","Restaurant, so I went to buy them, but she fell asleep again. I guess she’s out of luck. Xiao Wu, would you like one?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m busy.”","Feng Xun asked, “What about you, Boss Jun?”","The crown prince gave him a sneer.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","Master Chu was slow to react and hadn’t noticed anything yet. He asked Feng Wu about Bao Er.","Feng Wu explained everything to him.","She even wrote down what herbs to use for the daily treatment.","Master Chu suddenly said, “Miss Feng Wu, why don’t you...”","Feng Wu waved her hand. “I can’t be here all the time. I still have a lot to do.”","As expected, when she said those words, the teenager’s brooding eyes turned even more menacing!","Feng Wu could sense it.","However, she deliberately said, “Since Bao Er is fine, I’ll be on my way.”","She turned to leave.","When she walked past Jun Linyuan, he suddenly grabbed her arm!","“Let go!”","His grip was tight, and there was something aggressive about it.","Involuntarily, Feng Wu looked up and stared at him.","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu without saying a word.","Feng Xun grew anxious.","Boss Jun was obviously angry and couldn’t control himself anymore.","Feng Xun was about to intervene, but Jun Linyuan was already furious.. He stared at Feng Wu while telling the others, “Get out!”"]},{"number":3473,"title":"Chapter 3473: Little Crab","paragraphs":["Chapter 3473: Little Crab","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Only Jun Linyuan would dare tell the imperial physician and a young lord to scram.","However, when the two of them heard this, they really left as they were told.","Feng Wu was furious. She yelled at Feng Xun and Master Chu, “Are you leaving just because he told you to leave? Don’t you have any dignity? You’re not allowed to leave!”","However, Master Chu and Feng Xun looked at each other before they ran off without hesitation.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","The crown prince stared at Feng Wu with a cold look in his eyes.","Feng Wu panicked under his gaze.","Instinctively, she tried to shake off Jun Linyuan’s grip, but the more she resisted, the tighter Jun Linyuan’s grip was.","“It hurts! ”","Feng Wu cried out in pain when she felt like her wrist was about to be crushed.","Jun Linyuan frowned, but he still let go in the end.","Feng Wu wanted to run away like a rabbit as soon as he released her.","However, before she could take more than two steps, Jun Linyuan grabbed the back of her collar and pressed her against the pillar.","The next thing she knew, the crown prince had already placed his hands on both sides of her head and was staring at her with angry eyes.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu panicked when she saw the look in his eyes.","“Did you want to run away?” His voice was low, and it was obvious that he was very angry.","Feng Wu said, “I’m going home!”","The crown prince loomed over her, and a mocking look appeared on his nanasome race. “DIG 1 say you can leaver”","Feng Wu said, “W- what do you mean? I – I want to go home. Do I need your permission?","For some reason, Feng Wu felt guilty in front of Jun Linyuan.","It was as if she had been his maid in some previous life. She really couldn’t face him.","There was no response for a long time.","She looked up and saw his unbelievably handsome face.","The two of them were very close, only centimeters away.","He moved closer and closer.","His exquisite features were unbelievably attractive up close.","He stared at her and smirked, as if to say, “Why are you even asking?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“I want to go home!” Frustrated, Feng Wu bared her fangs and brandished her claws like a little beast.","Jun Linyuan stared at her coldly.","Feng Wu was even angrier. “I want to go home!”","After that, Feng Wu bumped her head against Jun Linyuan’s chin!","There was a loud bang.","Jun Linyuan was stunned.","Feng Wu was stunned. However, the next moment, her face scrunched up in pain. Was Jun Linyuan’s chin made of iron? It was so hard!","He looked at Feng Wu as if she were a retard.","Seeing the miserable look on Feng Wu’s face, he found her adorable. He wanted to rub the little beast’s head.","However, he didn’t follow his heart.","He pulled Feng Wu closer and raised her chin with one hand. The red mark on the girl’s fair forehead was obvious.","Feng Wu struggled.","Jun Linyuan glanced at her and frowned. “Stop waving your hands. Are you a crab?”","Feng Wu was astonished!","She also realized that her actions were very childish. She stopped struggling and glared at him angrily.","Rubbing her forehead with his fair fingers, the teenager sighed and stared at Feng Wu in resignation.. “Is your head made of iron? Why did you hit me with your head?”"]},{"number":3474,"title":"Chapter 3474: Pride In a Relationship","paragraphs":["Chapter 3474: Pride In a Relationship","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was frustrated. “Is your chin made of steel? Why didn’t you feel a thing?!","Looking at the frustrated girl, the crown prince’s anger dissipated.","He rubbed Feng Wu’s head.","Feng Wu moved away unhappily. “I’m going home.”","With a swoosh, she really dashed off.","Feng Wu couldn’t believe it!","Did Jun Linyuan really just let her leave?","She involuntarily turned around and met Jun Linyuan’s eyes.","He looked at her with a cold gaze. It was obvious that he was unhappy.","Feng Wu didn’t dare look him in the eye.","Feng Wu waved at him. “I’ve been busy since I got back from Nest. I haven’t had time to go home yet, so I’m leaving, okay?”","She looked back at Jun Linyuan when she jumped onto the wall.","Anyone who tried to jump over Jun Linyuan’s wall would die.","However, Feng Wu could jump whenever she wanted.","If it wasn’t for Jun Linyuan’s special permission, she would have been torn to pieces. After all, there were more than three Spiritual Overlords in the crown prince’s residence.","Feng Wu saw that Jun Linyuan was still standing there. Although he didn’t look well and his eyes were dark, he didn’t come to catch her. She ran away like a cat and soon disappeared from Jun Linyuan’s sight.","Jun Linyuan didn’t say a word.","“Pfft! ”","Someone nearby snickered.","Jun Linyuan gave him a sharp look!","It was indeed Feng Xun.","He cleared his throat, walked out trom behind a pillar outside the door, and moved closer to Jun Linyuan, trying not to laugh.","“Boss Jun, don’t be mad at me. I’m not the one who made you angry.” Jun Linyuan gave him an intimidating look and walked out.","Feng Xun hurried after her.","“I see. So, that’s what’s going on between you two.” Feng Xun looked like he finally knew what was going on.","The crown prince, who was walking silently in front of him, paused for a moment but didn’t say anything.","Feng Xun noticed that Boss Jun was listening intently.","He said, “Boss Jun, you won’t be able to get a wife for the rest of your life if you keep doing this. Hey, don’t glare at me. Am I wrong?” “I have nothing to do with her,” Jun Linyuan said glumly.","“Really...”","Resting his hands on his hips, Feng Xun teased him. “Boss Jun, no one believes that. Alright, if you have nothing to do with her, then this conversation is useless.”","Even His Royal Highness, who had always been elegant and graceful, had times when he choked on his words.","Resting his hands on his hips, Feng Xun gloated and said to himself, “My sister has a lot of suitors waiting for her. They’re all waiting in line outside the imperial capital. Let me tell you...’","The imperious crown prince glared at him. “Do you want to die?!”","Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine...","“Speak!”","Feng Xun was dumbfounded. “What?”","He was so frightened that his mind went blank. How could he know what to say?","Staring at him, Jun Linyuan crossed his arms and said nothing.","“What? Right!”","Feng Xun finally understood what Boss Jun meant.","He was so...","He didn’t sound like he was asking for advice.","Of course, Feng Xun only dared to criticize Boss Jun in his head. Just like Feng Wu, he wasn’t bold enough to say anything out loud.","Feng Xun then began to tell Jun Linyuan how to woo his sister.","“The way you are right now won’t do. Both of you have high self-esteem. Why are you still so arrogant and aloof? One has no pride when one is in a relationship..”"]},{"number":3475,"title":"Chapter 3475: Brother-in-Law","paragraphs":["Chapter 3475: Brother-in-Law","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“The way you are right now won’t do. Both of you have strong self-esteem. Why are you still so arrogant and aloof? One has no pride when one is in a relationship.","“Yes, I know you’re strong, and so is little Feng Wu. One of you has the Divine Phoenix Blood, and the other has the Dragon Phoenix Blood. You’re both the proudest people in the world. You can’t be any more arrogant.","“But in a relationship, there’s always someone who gives in first. Boss Jun, do you think little Feng Wu will give in?”","Jun Linyuan frowned and gave it some thought.","Based on what he knew about Feng Wu, she was only obedient on the surface, but never on the inside.","Feng Xun said, “Then, who likes the other more?”","Jun Linyuan glared at Feng Xun. What kind of question was that?","Feng Xun felt a little guilty being stared at, but he still said seriously, “You like her more than she likes you, right?”","Jun Linyuan’s face darkened.","“You want her more than she wants you, right?","“Don’t you want to marry her?”","The crown prince didn’t know what to say.","For the first time in his life, someone dared to speak to him like this, and he couldn’t refute it.","Feng Xun said frankly, “Since you like her more and want her more, go after her.","“It’s useless to glare at me. Go and pester her, telling her that you like her and want to marry her!”","Jun Linyuan’s face was tense and expressionless. He gave Feng Xun a cold look and left.","“Hey, wait!”","Jun Linyuan left in the middle of the conversation.","Master Chu had been hiding behind a pillar. He rolled his eyes at Feng Xun. “Do you want to die before taking a bite of your spring roll?”","Feng Xun said, “What?”","Master Chu said, “Why did you try to get yourself killed?”","Scratching his head, Feng Xun shuddered at the thought of what he had just done.","He cringed a little. “I was really brave just now, wasn’t I?”","Master Chu said, “Did you have a death wish?”","Feng Xun said, “Master Chu, can’t you say something nice? Heh, I’ll be the matchmaker that got them together.”","Feng Xun was so pleased with himself, as if Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu would get married and have babies right away.","Master Chu said with a poker face, “Do you really think that the crown prince, who’s so arrogant and unruly, will court that girl?”","Feng Xun said, “That’s... that’s possible, right?”","“Look, you don’t even believe it yourself.” Master Chu smiled bitterly.","However, to Master Chu and Feng Xun’s surprise, Jun Linyuan disappeared for three days.","After leaving the crown prince’s residence, Feng Wu went back to the Feng family.","“Xiao Wu is back!”","Duan Chaoge rushed in before Feng Wu could announce herself!","Instantly, the entire Feng family heard the news.","Feng Wu was back?","The Feng family’s main branch was shocked, and their expressions were ugly.","The third branch of the Feng family was also in a state of panic.","Only Fallen Star Yard was happy.","Feng Wu entered Fallen Star Yard.","The news spread to every corner of the Feng family.","There weren’t many people left in the Feng family’s main branch.","Feng Yanfeng, Lady Wang, Feng Sang and Feng Yiran exchanged looks.","They had thought that Feng Wu would never return from Nest, but she was back..","“Why is she still alive?!” Lady Wang’s face was livid!","It was the same for the third branch.","Feng Wu didn’t care about them. She was going to live in Fallen Star Yard.","“Sister!”","Feng Xiaoqi was the first to rush out when he saw Feng Wu.","He looked out the door and saw that Feng Wu was alone. He frowned.. “Sister, why are you alone?”"]},{"number":3476,"title":"Chapter 3476: Changes In the Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 3476: Changes In the Family","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Sister, why are you alone?","Xiaoqi kept looking behind Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at him in confusion. “Of course I’m alone. Who else did you expect?”","!!","“Where’s my brother-in-law?” Xiaoqi looked puzzled. “I still have a few cultivation technique questions to ask him. Didn’t he come back with you?”","Feng Wu smacked Xiaoqi on the head.","Xiaoqi asked, “Sister, why did you hit me?","Feng Wu said, “I’m not married. How can you have a brother-in-law?”","Xiaoqi said, “I mean the crown prince...”","Feng Wu put her hands on her hips. “The crown prince and I are just friends. What are you thinking?”","Xiaoqi muttered softly, “Just friends? What kind of a friend sleeps in the same bed with you? Why don’t I have such a friend?”","Feng Wu asked, “What are you mumbling about?”","Xiaoqi didn’t dare to offend his sister. He immediately waved his hand. “No, I","I ranstator: Henyee I ranstatlons Editor: Henyee I ranstatlons","“Sister, why are you alone?","Xiaoqi kept looking behind Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at him in confusion. “Of course I’m alone. Who else did you expect?”","“Where’s my brother-in-law?” Xiaoqi looked puzzled. “I still have a few cultivation technique questions to ask him. Didn’t he come back with you?”","Feng Wu smacked Xiaoqi on the head.","Xiaoqi asked, “Sister, why did you hit me?","Feng Wu said, “I’m not married. How can you have a brother-in-law?”","Xiaoqi said, “I mean the crown prince...”","Feng Wu put her hands on her hips. “The crown prince and I are just friends. What are you thinking?”","Xiaoqi muttered softly, “Just friends? What kind of a friend sleeps in the same bed with you? Why don’t I have such a friend?”","Feng Wu asked, “What are you mumbling about?”","Xiaoqi didn’t dare to offend his sister. He immediately waved his hand. “No, I didn’t say anything!”","Feng Wu gave him a suspicious look. “Do you really like Jun Linyuan as your brother-in-law?”","Xiaoqi asked, “Sister, do you want to hear the truth?”","Feng Wu’s face darkened. “Forget it. I didn’t ask anything.”","After that, Feng Wu walked inside.","Feng Xiaoqi followed her and asked persistently, “Sister, are you really alone? Did you have a fight with the crown prince? He doesn’t want you anymore?”","Feng Wu was frustrated.","When did Xiaoqi, who only cared about her, become a fan of his “brother-in-law”? That wasn’t right.","Feng Wu’s heart ached a little. She turned around and glared at Feng Xiaoqi.","“Xiaoqi, you don’t like me anymore?”","“How could that be?!” Xiaoqi quickly raised his hands to deny it.","Feng Wu said, “Xiaoqi, who do you think is more important, me or Jun Linyuan?”","Was it that serious? Xiaoqi felt uneasy... Could they really have quarreled?","“Of course you’re more important. The crown prince? I don’t even know him!” Xiaoqi said in all seriousness.","Feng Wu rubbed Xiaoqi’s head. “You’re still my loveliest brother.”","After that, Feng Wu left Xiaoqi and went into the inner hall. Granny Zhao, Uncle Qiu, and Qiuling were all there, but...","“Where’s Mother?”","Feng Wu looked at Granny Zhao in confusion.","Granny Zhao looked behind her before she took Feng Wu aside. In a low voice, she said, “Your mother... is cultivating.”","What?","Feng Wu was shocked.","All her beautiful mother ever cared about was looking beautiful and delicate. Since when did she know how to cultivate? Was that real?","Feng Wu said, “Let me see...”","She leaned over and poked a hole in the paper window to take a look...","She saw her beautiful mother sitting cross-legged on the futon with a serious look on her face. Her eyes were closed and she was circulating her spiritual essence as she cultivated.","Retreating to a corner, Feng Wu looked at Granny Zhao in surprise. “What.. what’s going on?","Granny Zhao said happily, “Miss Wu, didn’t you ask someone to deliver a large barrel of all-purpose transformation liquid? Everyone’s strength has improved after using it; even I am in great health. Your mother...","“When your mother bathed in the all-purpose transformation liquid, I don’t know what memories of the past were triggered, but she suddenly knew how to cultivate.”","Granny Zhao looked at Feng Wu in wonder. “It’s like some part of a seal was suddenly undone. From time to time, her head will clear up a little..”"]},{"number":3477,"title":"Chapter 3477: Flogging","paragraphs":["Chapter 3477: Flogging","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Although her mother was very beautiful, she only had the intelligence of a sixor seven-year-old, which was why she looked so innocent and weak.","However, Feng Wu noticed that her mother had a stern look on her face while she was cultivating.","“Madam said that no one is to disturb her for the time being,” Granny Zhao added.","Feng Wu nodded.","!!","It was a taboo to disturb someone who was cultivating, as they might suffer a qi deviation.","Luckily, Feng Wu had set up a barrier around Fallen Star Yard, so no one could get in now.","“Have you all made some progress?”","Feng Wu glanced at Qiuling, Uncle Qiu, Granny Zhao and Xiaoqi. She couldn’t help but smile when she saw how strong they were.","“Sister, I’m already a Level 1 Spiritual King.”","Feng Xiaoqi was elated. “Even in the War Academy, very few people can beat me.”","Feng Wu rubbed Xiaoqi’s head.","Due to his Ultimate Spiritual Body, Xiaoqi’s cultivation speed was twice as fast. He was already a Level 1 Spiritual King.","Feng Wu had been around the same level before she went to Nest.","“Your progress is so...” Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Xiaoqi couldn’t hide his excitement. “That’s because of the all-purpose transformation liquid you sent us. We’ve all made some progress! Plus, with brother-in-law’s guidance...”","“Huh?” Feng Wu gave him a dirty look.","Feng Xiaoqi immediately shut up and said obediently, “I know, I know. I won’t mention him.”","While Feng Wu returned home...","In the palace.","“Your Majesty, Princess Bao Er is out of danger.”","The head maid, Qiuxue, came in and told the empress dowager the news.","“Congratulations, Your Majesty. Your wish has finally been fulfilled. Princess Bao Er will be able to visit you in the palace soon.”","Qiuxue was all smiles, and her voice was clear and bright, as if she was waiting for the empress dowager to praise her.","The empress dowager had always been kind to the maids.","Meanwhile, the empress dowager was holding her forehead and sitting in front of the window, looking unwell.","She had a headache.","A real headache.","Hearing that, the empress dowager looked up. Her eyes were as cold as snow and as sharp as blades!","Qiuxue was startled.","What was going on? Why did Her Majesty look like she was going to eat her alive? But Princess Bao Er was clearly out of danger.","Granny Lan, who served the empress dowager, sighed inwardly.","She knew why the empress dowager was so angry.","She had made a bet that if Feng Wu really could save Bao Er, she would serve Feng Wu tea. What would the empress dowager do now?","“Is Bao Er really awake? Is she really alive?” the empress dowager asked coldly.","“Y- yes, Your Majesty, that’s what Granny Gong said.” Qiuxue remembered that Granny Gui had told her to come in and deliver the message.","Granny Gui had told her to report the news. Did she know that the empress dowager wouldn’t like hearing it?","Thump!","A cup of tea was thrown at Qiuxue!","She almost screamed when the hot tea splashed on her, but in order not to be punished by the empress dowager, she didn’t let out a groan despite the sweat rolling down her face.","However, the empress dowager said coldly, “How dare you disrespect me? Take her away and flog her a hundred times!”","Qiuxue looked at the empress dowager in shock!","However, before she could shout, Granny Gui had already come up and covered her mouth with a handkerchief. Immediately after that, a strong nanny came up and took Qiuxue away to be punished.."]},{"number":3478,"title":"Chapter 3478: You Don ‘t Want It?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3478: You Don ‘t Want It?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiuxue stared at Granny Gui with hatred.","Granny Gui had set her up!","Granny Gui knew that the empress dowager wouldn’t like hearing the news, but she still told Qiuxue to deliver it. As a result, Qiuxue had enraged the empress dowager, which was why she had ended up like this... Qiuxue shivered in pain and nursed the hatred in her head.","Granny Lan made a note.","As expected, the empress dowager’s reputation was the most important thing to her.","At that moment, the empress dowager frowned and instructed Granny Gui, “Go get Hua Wushuang.”","Granny Gui backed away silently.","After some thought, the empress dowager turned to Granny Lan and said, “Find my dragon-phoenix bracelets.”","Granny Lan was a little surprised.","The dragon-phoenix jade bracelets were no small matter. Only the crown prince’s future consort could receive this honor.","According to the rules, the empress dowager would only take out the dragon-phoenix bracelets on the first day the crown prince’s consort served tea to her.","The empress dowager hadn’t liked Empress Dugu back then, so she had never given her the bracelet.","Now, she was going to...","Granny Lan looked at the empress dowager in surprise, and the empress dowager said in a serious tone, “Get her here.”","“Yes.","Granny Lan hurried off.","All items were registered, and the dragon-phoenix bracelets were recorded in the top-ranking registry. That was why Granny Lan was so reluctant to get them.","She had always thought that Feng Wu was the best. If there was anyone in the world who was worthy of the crown prince, it would be Feng Wu.","While she was dawdling, the empress dowager sent someone to tell her to hurry up.","The person she sent was Ruyi.","Ruyi was on good terms with Qiuxue. Seeing what happened to Qiuxue, she was concerned, so she asked Granny Lan cautiously, “Have you found them? Her Majesty is pressing us.","“Miss Hua is here too.” She was referring to Hua Wushuang.","Granny Lan nodded and followed Ruyi out with an exquisite wooden box.","When they came out, they saw the empress dowager holding Hua Wushuang’s hand and saying with a pained expression, “Do you know how bad Feng Wu is? I don’t even know where to begin...","Then, the empress dowager told her about when Feng Wu accompanied her to the grassland.","Granny Lan frowned.","Feng Wu had saved the empress dowager’s life more than once. Without Feng Wu, Her Majesty might have already.","In the end, the empress dowager turned the truth around and badmouthed Feng Wu. She accused Feng Wu of everything and made up things about her. She made Feng Wu out to be a girl with a bad temper and a bad character.","Granny Lan couldn’t stand it anymore.","Hua Wushuang had been playing along with suitable expressions.","“Really?","“Oh god.","“How could she do that...","“I really can’t imagine it. .","“Oh, my god..","“I wouldn’t have believed it if Your Majesty hadn’t told me.","As if they were performing a carefully choreographed dance, they sme Feng Wu from head to toe.","Seeing Granny Lan come over with the box, the empress dowager took pair of dragon-phoenix bracelets and tried to put them on Hua Wushu wrists.","However, the bones of Hua Wu’s hands were a little big...","The bracelets were rather small.","The empress dowager couldn’t put them on Hua Wushuang right away","Before she could frown, Hua Wushuang said, “Your Majesty, these bra( too precious. I...’","The empress dowager said coldly. “The bracelets are the symbol of the prince’s consort.. Do you want them or not?”"]},{"number":3479,"title":"Chapter 3479: Untitled","paragraphs":["Chapter 3479: Untitled","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hua Wushuang blushed.","The sign of the crown prince’s consort?","How could she not want it?","Hua Wushuang wanted it more than anything else.","However, she still had to pretend to try and turn it down.","Nevertheless, she secretly pushed harder and scraped her skin, and in the end, she still managed to put on the bracelets.","Seeing her injured hands, the empress dowager frowned. She wasn’t very happy about it.","But now that Zuo Qingluan was gone, Hua Wushuang was her only option.","“Let’s go. I’ll show you around the imperial garden. From now on, this will be your home.”","Although Hua Wushuang said that she didn’t deserve it, she still followed the empress dowager.","However, she was curious. “Doesn’t His Royal Highness live in the palace?”","How could the crown prince not live in the east wing?","The empress dowager said grumpily, “The crown prince is special. He likes freedom and says that he’s trapped in the palace, so he built his own residence outside the palace.”","For other dynasties, this was definitely against the ancestral system.","Once the crown prince left the palace, he would become uncontrollable if he got close to the court officials and joined hands with them. It would threaten the emperor’s authority.","However, Jun Linyuan was different. He had always kept his distance from the throne, while Emperor Wu was practically begging him to take it. Therefore, having a residence outside wasn’t a problem.","Hua Wushuang was overjoyed. When she married the crown prince in the future, she would live with him outside the palace and wouldn’t have to pay her respects to the empress dowager and Empress Dugu two times a day.","However, before Hua Wushuang could finish daydreaming, the empress dowager told her, “When you marry him, you’ll live in the east wing so you can visit me often. I have a lot to teach you.”","Hua Wushuang was instantly displeased. Why?! Why?!","However, she hadn’t married the crown prince yet, so she didn’t dare disobey the empress dowager. She could only blush and said, “Of course, Your Majesty.”","Her Majesty was pleased with her attitude and asked Hua Wushuang to hold her arm.","“Go see the Emperor with me.”","The emperor’s study.","Emperor Wu finally finished dealing with the Dongsang Kingdom. He heaved a sigh of relief as he lay back in his chair.","The intelligence report sent from the frontline was very brief and didn’t mention Feng Wu’s achievements. Emperor Wu asked General Feng after listening to Lady Northern Feng’s description. Only then did the general give him the details.","So, it was true...","Feng Wu was amazing!","Emperor Wu had never seen anyone as bold as her!","She was a mere Spiritual King, but she had actually overturned half of Sun Castle. If she became a Spiritual Overlord, would she be able to turn the capital of the Dongsang Kingdom upside down?","At that thought, Emperor Wu rubbed his hands and paced around the room excitedly.","Just then, the empress dowager came in with Hua Wushuang.","“Mother, why are you here?”","Seeing the empress dowager, Emperor Wu hurried up to greet her.","He said happily, “Did you hear about Bao Er? That girl, Xiao Wu, is really amazing. She really brought Bao Er back to life. This girl is simply the lucky star of our royal family. I remember that she was also the one who treated you on the way to the grassland. Otherwise...’ Empress Dowager flushed.","That wasn’t what she told Hua Wushuang!","“Your Majesty!”","The empress dowager reprimanded her son loudly!","Startled, Emperor Wu looked at the empress dowager in surprise. Why did she raise her voice all of a sudden?","“Who knows what she’s up to?” the empress dowager said unhappily. Emperor Wu was displeased. “Mother, Xiao Wu has saved you several times..","How can you say that?”"]},{"number":3480,"title":"Chapter 3480: The Engagement Is Still On","paragraphs":["Chapter 3480: The Engagement Is Still On","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu said, “If that girl hears this, she’ll feel so wronged. In the language of the common folk, Xiao Wu is your savior.”","The emperor was on Feng Wu’s side?!","Sensing that something was wrong, the empress dowager frowned. “Your Majesty, what are you talking about? We don’t use that word in the imperial family!”","Emperor Wu frowned at the empress dowager.","The empress dowager was displeased. “It was her honor that she had the opportunity to cure me! However, she keeps telling people about it. What does that mean? She wants everyone to think that I’m weak and sick and that I’m going to die early!”","Emperor Wu tried to defend Feng Wu. “She hasn’t spread the word...”","The empress dowager said, “Why do you all sound like I owe her my life? That’s so ridiculous!”","Emperor Wu knew that the empress dowager was angry, and the more he talked about Feng Wu, the angrier his mother would get. He could only keep quiet.","The empress dowager couldn’t help but sneer. “I don’t like how arrogant she is.","So what if she’s a Supreme Level medicine refiner? Wushuang is also a","Supreme Level medicine refiner!”","Emperor Wu said, “Xiao Wu isn’t at the Supreme Level. She’s...”","Before he could finish, the empress dowager changed the subject. “I don’t care what rank she’s at. I hate people like her! If you’re a good son, do as I say, and don’t mention her in front of me again!”","Emperor Wu felt a headache coming on. Why was the empress dowager so unreasonable?","If Empress Dugu and the concubines had dared to do that, Emperor Wu would have killed them long ago. However, the empress dowager was such a pest. .","“Eh, wait...”","Emperor Wu suddenly realized what was going on. “Why is Miss Hua here? Mother, have you taken in a goddaughter again?”","That reminded the empress dowager.","She rolled her eyes at Emperor Wu. “What does His Majesty think of Wushuang?”","Emperor Wu glanced at her. “She’s pretty.”","The empress dowager said, “Not only is this girl beautiful, she’s also a good person. She’s also dignified and magnanimous. She’s a good candidate for the crown prince’s consort..","“Mother, that position is already...”","The empress dowager didn’t wait for the emperor to finish. Instead, she said in an authoritative tone, “I’ve already made up my mind that she’s going to be the crown prince’s consort. No one can change that!”","Emperor Wu raised his voice. “Mother!”","The empress dowager raised her voice as well. “Your Majesty! I have the final say, not you!”","Before Emperor Wu could say anything, the empress dowager raised Hua Wushuang’s hands.","The dragon-phoenix bracelets were on her fair wrists.","Emperor Wu was infuriated.","The empress dowager smirked. “I’m here to tell you about this, not to ask for your opinion. You have to accept it no matter what!”","After that, the empress dowager took Hua Wushuang’s hand. “Let’s go.”","Behind her, Emperor Wu said in a cold voice, “Mother, what about Feng Wu? You know that the engagement hasn’t been canceled yet!”","The empress dowager paused and said coldly, “Then cancel it now.”","Emperor Wu said, “We can’t!”","The empress dowager said, “Then let her be the concubine.”","Having said that, the empress dowager led Hua Wushuang away, walking as fast as the wind. She didn’t look like a senior at all.","Only then did Hua Wushuang realize that the engagement hadn’t been annulled...","Cining Palace.","The empress dowager frowned when she saw how distracted Hua Wushuang was. “What are you thinking about now?”","Hua Wushuang smiled bitterly and pretended to take off the bracelets.."]},{"number":3481,"title":"Chapter 3481: Celestial Spirit Bead","paragraphs":["Chapter 3481: Celestial Spirit Bead","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She said tearfully as she tried to remove the bracelets, “So, the engagement was never broken off. Your Majesty, this engagement...”","The empress dowager glared at her. “What are you crying for? Don’t you understand what I’m saying? If the position of consort is yours, it has to be yours. Do you think I’m talking nonsense?!”","In the empress dowager’s Cining Palace, she would smash things when she was angry, to say nothing of reprimanding another person.","Hua Wushuang was frightened and didn’t dare to speak.","The empress dowager quickly softened her tone and said to Hua Wushuang, “The engagement with Feng Wu isn’t official. Who knows what it is? If you ask me, she’ll only be a concubine!","“As for you...","“When’s your grandmother’s birthday?”","Hua Wushuang: “In, in ten days...”","The empress dowager said, “Ten days from now, I’ll ask the emperor to write an imperial edict and let everyone know that you’re the real crown prince’s consort! ”","After some thought, she said, “Go back and prepare.” “Yes.” Hua Wushuang was about to leave.","Suddenly, the empress dowager stopped her. “Wait!”","She then asked Granny Lan, “What do you think Feng Wu’s cultivation level is now?”","Granny Lan said, “She’s at least a Level 4 Spiritual King.”","The empress dowager frowned and asked Hua Wushuang, “How strong are you now?","“What did you say that Feng Wu’s level is?”","Hua Wushuang felt inferior because she was no match for Feng Wu in terms of cultivation level.","“I’m a Level 1 Spiritual King,” Hua Wushuang stammered.","The empress dowager had a terrible headache!","“Why are you only a Level 1 Spiritual King? What have you been doing? You’re so weak!” The empress dowager criticized Hua Wushuang without hesitation.","Hua Wushuang wanted to cry.","So weak? She was the most talented member of her generation in the Hua family.","She was one of the best among the younger generation of the nine major families. How could she be weak? Zuo Qingluan was only a Level 2 Spiritual King...","“You’re nowhere near as capable as Feng Wu!” The more the empress dowager thought about it, the angrier she got. However, she was determined to beat Feng wu.","She turned to Granny Lan and said, “Go get the Celestial Spirit Bead.”","Granny Lan looked at the empress dowager in surprise!","Because she had been with the empress dowager for decades, Granny Lan knew exactly how much good stuff the empress dowager had.","The emperor was a loving son, so the empress dowager got the pick of all the good stuff first.","For example, cultivators would give everything for this Celestial Spirit Bead.","It could increase the strength of a person by several levels!","Hua Wushuang had heard of the bead before, so she looked at the empress dowager in disbelief.","Granny Lan tried to stop the empress dowager. “Your Majesty, this bead probably suits Bao Er...”","Bao Er was saved by Feng Wu, and the empress dowager was blaming Bao Er for her humiliation!","“It’s mine! I’ll give it to whoever I want! I’ll find better things for Bao Er when I have something good. Why are you nagging me? Go get it!” The empress dowager reprimanded Granny Lan without hesitation.","Granny Lan had no choice but to silently fetch the bead.","The empress dowager asked Hua Wushuang to open her mouth and swallow the bead.","“Work hard when you return home. In less than seven days, your strength will definitely increase. I think highly of you!”","After Hua Wushuang left, the empress dowager got even angrier when she thought about how she had wasted such a good thing in order to help Hua"]},{"number":3482,"title":"Chapter 3482: Reconciliation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3482: Reconciliation","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She put all the blame on Feng Wu.","According to Lady Northern Feng, Feng Wu was more talented than anyone else in the world.","Although the empress dowager kept saying that it was all a lie, she knew Feng Wu well enough to believe that it was true!","At that thought, the empress dowager got even angrier!","The empress dowager called Granny Gui when she got angry because she knew that Granny Gui had a lot of tricks up her sleeve and would share her burden.","Meanwhile...","Feng Wu had no idea how much the empress dowager hated her.","She was cultivating at home and would give her family some helpful instructions from time to time. They improved quickly.","The beautiful lady was still in seclusion.","Feng Wu was a little worried, but she didn’t want to disturb her. She could only set up layers of barriers around the beautiful lady’s room so that no one would interrupt her.","Everyone in the Feng clan now knew how powerful Feng Wu was. Ever since Feng Wu came back, they had been hiding in their rooms and didn’t dare to come out and meet her.","Feng Wu had specifically asked Granny Zhao if the first and third branches had come to pick on them while she was gone.","Granny Zhao told her with certainty that they hadn’t.","Feng Wu was relieved and didn’t worry about them anymore.","She hadn’t seen Jun Linyuan since she came back from the crown prince’s residence, nor had he come to Fallen Star Yard.","Feng Wu snorted inwardly.","He acted like he liked her very much, but he had disappeared just like that.","“Since you’re not coming, I won’t miss you anymore.” Feng Wu deliberately forgot about Jun Linvuan, but to her surprise, the more she tried to forget, the harder it was to do it. Jun Linyuan’s handsome face kept popping up in her mind.","Sitting cross-legged on the ground to cultivate, Feng Wu couldn’t focus on her cultivation no matter what.","Feng Wu rubbed her head in frustration. How was she supposed to cultivate when her mind was in such a mess?","She had already dropped to a Level-4 Spiritual King, and she was so weak. If Zuo Qingluan was standing right in front of her, she wouldn’t be able to defeat Zuo Qingluan. How could she have time to think about anything else?","At this moment, there was a knock on the door.","Granny Zhao was busy, and Feng Wu had nothing better to do, so she went to open the door herself.","She opened the door and saw Feng Sang outside.","“You...”","Feng Sang was a little taken aback when she saw Feng Wu. “I-I’m just here to give you something...”","After that, she handed a lunch box to Feng Wu. “Father said that you’ve worked hard in your cultivation. We made this ourselves. Please try some...”","Feng Wu looked at Feng Sang in confusion.","She had never been on good terms with Feng Sang. To be more precise, Feng Sang had always disliked her. Why did she suddenly change her attitude?","‘Why?”","“Why what?” Feng Sang was confused.","Feng Wu asked, “Why the sudden change of attitude? What are you planning?” Feng Sang smiled bitterly.","Yes, the whole first branch of the Feng family had been targeting Feng Wu and wanted nothing more than to strangle her to death. However, it had been proven time and time again that not only couldn’t they kill Feng Wu, but they had also been so unlucky each time that Feng Liu had died because of them.","Feng Wu was like the daughter of God, and anyone who messed with her would be in trouble.","At that thought, Feng Sang smiled bitterly. “Because we’re tired.","“Going against you is too tiring, both physically and mentally.”","Feng Wu was a good judge of character. Seeing the look on Feng Sang’s face, she knew that Feng Sang wasn’t putting on an act. Feng Sang suddenly asked, “How strong are you now?”"]},{"number":3483,"title":"Chapter 3483: His Royal Highness Sent Us to Protect You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3483: His Royal Highness Sent Us to Protect You","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu asked, “Why do you ask?”","Feng Sang asked again, “How strong are you now?","She had been trying her best, so she wanted to know if she could catch up to Feng wu.","Feng Wu looked frustrated. “I was a Level-6 Spiritual King before, but something happened, and I’m only a Level-4 Spiritual King now. Hey, why are you leaving( I’m not done yet.. Feng Sang didn’t just leave, she ran.","“Screw reconciliation! I’m so envious!!!”","Granny Zhao finished hanging the clothes up for drying and wiped her wet hands on her blue apron as she walked out. “Was someone here? It sounded like Miss Feng Sang.”","Feng Wu came in with the basket, closed the door, and handed it to Granny Zhao. “It was indeed her.”","Granny Zhao opened the basket and realized that it contained raw dumplings. She couldn’t help but laugh and was going to cook them.","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure we can eat them?”","Granny Zhao asked, “Why not?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t think she likes me at all. Will she set us up?","Granny Zhao smiled. “Miss Wu, you haven’t been at home these days and have no idea what’s going on with Lady Wang’s family. They’re very close to us now and would send us gifts every now and then. Lady Wang doesn’t dare to come here, in case she annoys us. However, she often sends people here, and Miss Feng Sang is a frequent visitor.”","Feng Wu asked, “When did that happen?”","Granny Zhao said, “It started when His Royal Highness spent a night in Fallen Star Yard.”","Feng Wu said, “They’re only sucking up to whom they consider rich and powerful!”","Granny Zhao said, “Aren’t they always like that?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","However, it would be great if Lady Wang stopped making trouble for them.","At the thought of her own capability, Feng Wu felt that she was still too weak.","She wanted to ask the white fairy about her third senior brother.","But the white fairy was cultivating, and Feng Wu had no choice but to go to Master Linghu first.","Hence, she turned to leave.","As soon as she walked out of the Feng manor, she saw two people standing outside.","Feng Wu had met them before.","Earlier when she treated Bao Er, she had asked Jun Linyuan for two Spiritual Overlords in case of emergencies. Right now, they stood guard at the door.","“Why are you here? When did you get here?” Feng Wu frowned at them.","If these two Spiritual Overlords were released to the outside world, they would at least be high-ranking officials with their own land. But now, they were guarding her door.","Of the two Spiritual Overlords, one was tall, thin, and the other short. They were quite easy to spot.","The lanky one was called Gao Gong, and the short one was called Yuan Pan. They were easy to remember.","“His Royal Highness sent us here to protect you,” Gao Gong said solemnly.","Yuan Pan smiled politely. “His Royal Highness was worried that someone would try to assassinate you. He couldn’t come here himself, so he told us not to let anything happen to you.”","Feng Wu frowned. What could possibly happen to her?","It was just that she had been unlucky and was hunted down in Black Cloud Alley. Right now, she had almost recovered from her internal injury. Fenz Wu recalled what happened in the zeneral’s residence earlier. She had offended the Firmament Palace, and that old woman was very displeased with her. She was indeed in danger.","She didn’t know how to face Jun Linyuan now, so it was probably a good thing that someone else was protecting her.."]},{"number":3484,"title":"Chapter 3484: Wanted Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 3484: Wanted Girl","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Yuan went on. “His Royal Highness says that if you go out, we have to stay by your side and protect you.”","After all, they were both Spiritual Overlords and elders in Imperial College. Feng Wu was a Spiritual King, so they talked to her as if she was only a normal girl.","They weren’t her minions. They were only here to protect her for the time being. Both of them thought that way, so they stood ramrod straight.","Feng Wu knew that they were Jun Linyuan’s people, not her own. Moreover, they were so much more capable than her, so she understood why they didn’t think much of the job.","Although she could understand it, she still had a plan.","“Actually, I don’t need any personal protection,” Feng Wu said earnestly. But the two masters ignored her. They followed Feng Wu wherever she went.","Feng Wu sighed inwardly.","When her cultivation level rose, she wouldn’t need someone to protect her.","However...","Just then, Feng Xun arrived.","“Xiao Wu! Xiao Wu! Where are you going?!”","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment. “To see Master Linghu.”","The two Spiritual Overlords were shocked.","They had heard of Master Linghu before, but he wasn’t someone they could meet just because they wanted to.","Feng Xun took Feng Wu’s hand and shook his head solemnly. “You’re not going anywhere now!”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","“Look. ”","Feng Xun handed her a piece of black paper.","Before she could unfold it, Yuan Pan cried out, “A black paper with a red name? A hunting order for the Guillotine Inn?!”","Feng Xun nodded solemnly.","The Guillotine Inn? Feng Wu remembered that she had hired an assassin there a long time ago.","When she unfolded the paper, she saw her name written in red ink.","And there was a red cross on the name!","Feng Wu had a bad feeling.","She looked at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun paled. Looking into Feng Wu’s eyes, she took a deep breath and tried her best to calm down.","“Master Wang is right. It’s a bounty from the Guillotine Inn. Someone has put a price on your head.”","Seeing how nervous Feng Xun was, Feng Wu couldn’t help but smile. “So be it. It’s not like I haven’t been hunted down before. The Zuo family has tried to kill me so many times, but I’m still alive.”","Feng Xun looked even more anxious when he saw how relaxed Feng Wu was.","“How can you still be smiling at a time like this? Look! It’s black paper with a red name!”","Feng Xun wanted to shake Feng Wu’s head. “Do you know what that means?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “What does it mean?”","Feng Xun said, “It means that your reward is the highest! Do you know what that means? That is to say, even Spiritual Overlords and Spiritual Saints will come after you! You’re so dead!”","Feng Wu was exasperated. “They may send Spiritual Overlords, but there are only a handful of Spiritual Saints in the empire. How can that be...”","Just then, someone from Imperial College arrived.","Gongsun Mu, the vice-chief of Imperial College, came in person.","The 100k on his face was very serious when he saw Feng Wu. “Little Feng Wu, what on earth have you done? You’re in a lot of trouble!”","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Gongsun Mu said, “Everyone in the empire who is at the Spiritual Overlord Stage or above have received the news!”","“Feng Wu” asked, “What?”","Gongsun Mu said, “Someone has put the highest bounty on your head! Anyone who kills you will be rewarded with a peak Spiritual Overlord Stage weapon and cultivation technique, as well as the title of the sacred elder of the Firmament","Palace!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.."]},{"number":3485,"title":"Chapter 3485: Wandering Temple","paragraphs":["Chapter 3485: Wandering Temple","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was cursing inwardly.","Why would they pay such a high price to kill her? They were all peak Spiritual Overlords!","“Has the entire empire’s Spiritual Overlords heard about it?” Feng Wu frowned.","Feng Xun had never looked so serious before. He stared at Feng Wu and nodded.","After a pause, he added, “Not just the entire empire.”","Feng Wu looked back at him.","Feng Xun said, “To be more precise, all the Spiritual Overlords on this continent have received the news.”","Feng Wu asked, “Does that include the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng Xun said, “It’s not limited to the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Feng Wu rubbed her temple in frustration.","Although she was much more capable than other people of her age, she was still a mere Level-4 Spiritual King. The person who wanted to kill her would be at least junior Spiritual Overlords. How was she supposed to survive?","The price on her head was much higher than Zuo Qingluan’s back then, but she wasn’t very happy.","“Xiao Wu, don’t worry. There’s always a way out. I’m sure you’ll be fine.” Feng Xun took Feng Wu’s hand and said solemnly, “I’ll always be by your side and protect you! ”","Feng Wu glanced at him.","Feng Xun had been making rapid progress. The all-purpose transformation liquid had helped him greatly last time, and after this period of cultivation, he was already a Level-9 Spiritual King.","Compared to before, he was very capable, but now, he wasn’t even qualified to accept the assassination mission.","Feng Wu wanted to laugh and cry at the same time. She glanced at Feng Xun before looking back at the Feng manor.","Feng Xun took Feng Wu’s hand. “You’re not safe here. You’re staying with me in","Northern Feng Mansion.”","Feng Wu said, “My family is here. I can’t leave.”","Feng Xun said seriously, “You’re the one they’re after, not your family. Your family will be safer when you’re gone. Trust me.” Tilting her head, Feng Wu began to think about it.","Feng Xun was worried sick.","“Forget about it. If you keep thinking about it, you’ll be running out of time! Those Spiritual Overlords are like wolves. I’m sure they’re all heading for the imperial capital!” Feng Xun grew angrier as he spoke. “It just so happens that Boss Jun isn’t here at the moment. I can’t find him no matter what. Feng is still at the Nest Fortress... Everything’s happening at the same time.”","Feng Wu said, “I’m going to see Master Linghu.”","Feng Xun agreed with her. If Master Linghu said something now, no one would dare to go after Feng Wu.","It wasn’t just the Guillotine Inn anymore.","Feng Xun had no idea how many Spiritual Overlords there were in the Guillotine Inn.","But he knew that many Spiritual Overlords didn’t belong to the Guillotine Inn.","Anyway, anyone with ambition would try their best.","It would be better if a Spiritual Saint spoke up for Feng Wu, but now...","“Since we’re going to find Master Linghu, let’s hurry up before someone tries to ambush us.”","Feng Xun pulled Feng Wu onto a horse and dashed off.","The two Spiritual Overlords exchanged looks and both saw astonishment in each other’s eyes.","Feng Wu had become the prey of all Spiritual Overlords...","How terrifying.","Would the two of them be able to protect Feng Wu?","His Royal Highness thought too highly of them.","“Let’s catch up with them. We owe His Royal Highness our lives, anyway.” The two Spiritual Overlords exchanged looks and quickly followed Feng Wu and Feng Xun.","Soon, they arrived at Wandering Temple.."]},{"number":3486,"title":"Chapter 3486: Divine Phoenix Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 3486: Divine Phoenix Blood","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Soon, they arrived at Wandering Temple.","Ordinary people weren’t allowed to go to the mountain behind the Wandering Temple. Even Feng Xun had to stop at the gate.","Feng Wu was the only one who could come and go as she pleased.","“Master Linghu is in seclusion.” Yuanbao looked at Feng Wu in embarrassment.","“He only went into seclusion three days ago.”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, little Yuanbao went on. “He said no one was to disturb him.”","Feng Wu said, “Did he say when he would come out?”","Yuanbao shook his head and looked at Feng Wu with teary eyes. “He said that his Heavenly Tribulation had arrived. If he can’t get through and dies, I’ll go find you. I’m sure you’ll look after me.”","Feng Wu was speechless. Was it that serious?","“Will you take me with you?” Little Yuanbao looked eagerly at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at the little monk and smiled bitterly. “I can take you away from the mountain on any other day, but I can’t even protect myself now. Staying with me is very dangerous, and I may lose my life. So, I suggest that you stay here for a while. After I solve these problems... If I’m still alive, I’ll pick you up.”","Little Yuanbao gave Feng Wu a concerned look.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. I’ll live.”","Only then did little Yuanbao nod. “Please come and fetch me. I’ll be waiting for you here.”","Feng Wu left the mountain, and Feng Xun ran up to her.","“How did it go? What did Master Linghu say?”","Feng Wu gave him a bitter smile.","Feng Xun asked, “Isn’t Master Linghu going to help you?","Feng Wu said, “Master Linghu is in seclusion.”","Feng Wu didn’t tell him that Master Linghu’s Heavenly Tribulation was coming, because if the Dongsang Kingdom knew about it, it would be another disaster for the Junwu Empire.","“When will he come out, then?” Feng Xun asked anxiously.","Feng Wu shook her head with a wry smile. “We can’t count on him now. He has his own problems.”","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","But what should Feng Wu do now?","The entire continent’s Spiritual Overlords had received the notice, and the news seemed to have grown wings.","The Hua family.","The Hua family had been living in Flower Valley for a long time. Since they had decided to come back into society, they naturally paid attention to the outside world.","When Mrs. Hua got back, she had already told her family about the empress dowager.","Meanwhile, Mrs. Hua and her daughter-in-law, Lady Hua, were talking in the inner hall.","Lady Hua said, “Mother, the empress dowager likes Wushuang, but after all, Feng Wu is engaged to His Royal Highness. Is the empress dowager playing tricks on the Hua family?”","Mrs. Hua shook her head. “Of course not. I’m the empress dowager’s best friend when we were young. Moreover, the Hua family is very influential. Why would she offend us? She really wants to make Wushuang the crown prince’s wife this time.”","Lady Hua said, “But why? Isn’t Feng Wu a better choice? I heard that she’s very smart and has the Divine Phoenix Blood. I don’t think Wushuang is comparable to Feng Wu.”","Mrs. Hua glanced at her. “The Divine Phoenix Blood? What good is it now? It’ll only have divine power when she becomes a Spiritual Overlord. With each breakthrough after that, she’ll become much more capable, and she’ll be able to fight against opponents that are one, two, or even three Levels higher! As for her now? Heh.."]},{"number":3487,"title":"Chapter 3487: Happy and Worried","paragraphs":["Chapter 3487: Happy and Worried","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Hua seemed to have picked up on the hint and asked curiously, “Mother, do you have a plan?”","Mrs. Hua smiled calmly. “I’m a member of the Hua family, and I’m the best strategist. Why do you think Her Majesty chose Wushuang?”","Lady Hua had always known that her mother-in-law was very smart, and she immediately saw the light.","Her mother-in-law must have said something to the empress dowager, which was why her daughter was chosen.","Lady Hua was both happy and concerned.","She was happy to have such a good son-in-law and worried that something might go wrong.","“I’ll take care of it. Why are you so worried?” Mrs. Hua was very confident. “All you need to do is prepare the birthday banquet a few days later. The empress dowager will be here that day.”","With Mrs. Hua around, there was nothing Lady Hua could worry about.","Just then, hasty footsteps came from outside!","“Grandma! Grandma!”","It was none other than Hua Wushuang.","Hua Wushuang had always been elegant and aloof in front of other people, but now, she couldn’t hide her joy. She was so happy that she looked like she was flying.","“Mother, you’re here as well?”","Hua Wushuang greeted her mother and ran into Mrs. Hua’s arms in excitement.","“Grandma! Grandma, you’re amazing! You said that you could get the Celestial Spirit Bead from the empress dowager, and you did! You said that I could make a quick breakthrough, and I really did!”","Hearing that, Mrs. Hua immediately pulled Hua Wushuang away and sized her up.","“You’re a Level-4 Spiritual King now?” Mrs. Hua couldn’t hide her excitement.","“That’s right!” Hua Wushuang said excitedly. “I was only a Level-I Spiritual","King before, but after taking the Celestial Spirit Bead, I’m a Level-4 Spiritual King now! Grandma. Feng Wu is only a Level-4 Spiritual King, and she has the Divine Phoenix Blood!”","Hua Wushuang was even more unconvinced.","Wasn’t Feng Wu supposed to have the Divine Phoenix Blood? Wasn’t she supposed to be talented? Hua Wushuang decided that since they were at the same level, Feng Wu wasn’t all that amazing after all.","“Good.’","Mrs. Hua was over the moon when she heard that Hua Wushuang had made three breakthroughs in a row, and she couldn’t stop smiling. “That’s great. You’ve made three breakthroughs in a row, but that’s not the end of it. There will be an after effect from now on, and you’ll be able to make another breakthrough in the near future.”","Hua Wushuang was even more excited. “Grandma, you’re so clever! No one can escape from you! Even Her Majesty the empress dowager is fooled!”","Mrs. Hua gave Hua Wushuang a feigned angry look.","Hua Wushuang came back to herself and looked around. She was relieved to see that she, her mother, and her grandmother were alone.","“Alright, alright. I’ll keep it to myself from now on.” She smiled sweetly.","“You naughty thing.”","Mrs. Hua was satisfied with Hua Wushuang’s progress. She nodded and said indifferently, “Feng Wu is only a junior Level-4 Spiritual King, and you’re already a peak Level-4 Spiritual King. Of course, she won’t be your match.” Hua Wushuang jumped to her feet and ran off in excitement.","However, she was only able to take a few steps before Mrs. Hua stopped her.","“Come back!”","Hua Wushuang turned around and looked at Mrs. Hua in bewilderment.","“Grandma, I’ll go to challenge her!”","Hua Wushuang wanted to defeat her rival in love.."]},{"number":3488,"title":"Chapter 3488: Protect Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3488: Protect Her","According to the Hua family’s information, Zuo Qingluan was only a Level-I or Level-2 Spirit King a few months ago..","Hua Wushuang was far stronger than Zuo Qingluan! If she could defeat Feng Wu now, she would be able to make a name for herself!","In that case, once the marriage between her and Jun Linyuan was announced, wouldn’t it become what everyone wanted?","But Mrs. Hua stopped her. “You can’t go!”","Hua Wushuang looked at Mrs. Hua in shock. “Grandma, why?!”","Before Mrs. Hua could speak, Hua Wushuang blurted out, “She doesn’t know that my strength has increased greatly now. She’ll easily agree to my challenge. I’ll definitely defeat her! Grandma, if I can’t step on her to get to the top, many people still won’t accept my status. I don’t want such comments, Grandma...’ Hua Wushuang pleaded with her eyes.","Seeing that her daughter was so insistent, Lady Hua also spoke up for her.","Mrs. Hua frowned. “You might not be able to defeat her now.”","What?!","Hua Wushuang was even angrier.","“Then I must give it a try!” Hua Wushuang clenched his fists.","Mrs. Hua was speechless.","Seeing that she was so determined, Mrs. Hua couldn’t stop her. After all, this was Hua Wushuang’s own choice. If she couldn’t resolve Feng Wu’s problem, Hua Wushuang’s cultivation would be hindered in the future.","“It’s fine if you want to give it a try.” Mrs. Hua waved her hand, and the person who had been standing silently behind her walked out.","It was her dowry nanny, Aunt Xi.","“Protect her well,” Old Madam Hua told Aunt Xi.","Aunt Xi had always been by Mrs. Hua’s side and knew what she meant.","Hua Wushuang might have been one of the daughters of the Hua family’s third generation, but who would have known that she would become the future crown prince consort? It would be of great help to the Hua family in the future.","Therefore, Hua Wushuang was now the most important person in the Hua family.","Aunt Xi nodded and accompanied Hua Wushuang out.","Lady Hua paced around worriedly.","Mrs. Hua glanced at her daughter-in-law angrily.","“If I don’t let her go, you’ll plead for her. If I let her go, you’ll be worried.”","Lady Hua asked, “Mother, aren’t you worried?”","Mrs. Hua said, “What are you worried about? Feng Wu is the one who needs to worry about herself.”","Lady Hua said, “But I heard that she’s outstanding.”","Mrs. Hua looked ferocious. “Outstanding? How can she not be outstanding? How can she not be outstanding when she’s being hunted down by Spiritual","Overlords in the entire continent?”","Lady Hua looked at Mrs. Hua in shock. “Mother, is that true?”","Mrs. Hua said, “How is it not true? I’m also a Spiritual Overlord.”","Lady Hua said, “You said that Feng Wu was...”","Mrs. Hua said mockingly, “She even dares to offend experts above the Spirit","Saint Stage. Does she think she’s God Mu’s daughter? What a joke.”","Lady Hua wanted to ask more questions, but Mrs. Hua wouldn’t tell her.","After Lady Hua left, Mrs. Hua said calmly to the person beside her, “Send this letter to the Zuo family.”","Disappointed, Feng Wu left Wuding Temple and prepared to go home.","However, the journey wasn’t peaceful.","Because she encountered an assassination on the way!","The two Spirit Overlords protecting her had stayed hidden, and no one knew, so...","Just as they were passing by a bridge..."]},{"number":3489,"title":"Chapter 3489: Impression of Jun Linyuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3489: Impression of Jun Linyuan","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was in this downtown area!","A figure burst out from the crowd and charged at Feng Wu with his sword pointed at her throat!","A Level-3 Spiritual Overlord!","It wasn’t her judgment, but the two hidden Spiritual Overlords.","“Feng Wu! Die!”","Someone screamed.","She was only a Level-4 Spirit King, and she was nowhere near as powerful as the assassin.","She could clearly feel that when the other party attacked, she seemed to be restrained by his sword energy and couldn’t move at all.","He didn’t even have the strength to lift a finger.","She could clearly feel the difference in their strength.","This difference was too huge for her to do anything.","There was no need to fight.","She would be killed by a single strike.","It was obvious that the other party thought the same.","Hence, when he saw that she was frozen in place, the man dressed in black stabbed at her heart with his long sword!","But...","When the tip of his sword was only three inches away from her, he froze.","This was because a dagger flew over from somewhere and was aimed at the man’s head!","“Hm...”","The Level-3 Spiritual Overlord was instantly killed.","The flying dagger hit his forehead and fell to the ground, making a heavy sound.","“Miss Feng Wu, are you alright?”","The round and chubby Master Yuan Pan turned around and smiled at her.","Initially, he thought that he would see a young girl who had panicked because of the assassination. Unexpectedly, her eyes were as clear as spring water.","Feng Wu frowned and stared at the man in black.","This person didn’t hesitate to kill her. He really thought no one would protect her.","“Cut his head off and take it back. Find out whose family he belongs to. Jun Linyuan will let them know what’s going to happen if they go after Feng Wu!” Infuriated, Feng Xun decided to use the assassin as an example!","If he couldn’t do it himself, he would have to ask for Jun Linyuan’s help.","If someone wanted to kill Feng Wu, they’d better hide their faces. Otherwise, the crown prince would destroy them.","Although he didn’t say the exact words, he meant it.","The two Spiritual Overlords looked at him in disbelief. Why was the crown prince so interested in this girl?","If he was really so concerned, wouldn’t he keep his side to protect her? They couldn’t withstand the combined forces of many Spirit Overlords.","That was what they thought, but they didn’t say it out loud.","Spiritual Overlords had their temper. They were proud and noble and valued their dignity above anything else.","They didn’t believe what Feng Xun said, but they still did as he said.","Yuan Pan was all smiles, but his movements were unbelievably clean. In an instant, he cut off the head of the man in black. He grabbed the man’s long hair and walked back, blood dripping all the way.","Everything happened in broad daylight, so the people on the street all saw them.","Feng Xun looked back at them and said in a serious tone, “When Boss Jun comes back, he’ll reward you.”","Lord Yuan Pan and Lord Gao Gong only smiled and didn’t say anything.","It was obvious that they didn’t believe him.","He didn’t say anything else.","The two of them had been cultivating in the dark and hadn’t been by Boss Jun’s side, so they naturally didn’t know about the relationship between Boss Jun and Feng Wu.","“They only remembered Jun Linyuan from a year ago, when he was the cold and murderous Boss Jun...” thought Feng Xun.."]},{"number":3490,"title":"Chapter 3490: You Can Move out Now","paragraphs":["Chapter 3490: You Can Move out Now","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun ran up to Feng Wu and comforted her.","“Don’t worry, no one will dare to assassinate you next.”","Feng Xun had deliberately made a big deal out of it in the downtown area to intimidate future enemies.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly.","She did not know why she was so unlucky.","She had finally surpassed Zuo Qingluan and gotten her revenge for what happened five years ago. In the end, she had provoked the Matriarch of Firmament Palace...","“Do you regret it?” Feng Xun asked suddenly.","Feng Wu knew what he was asking.","“Regret?” Feng Wu shook her head and looked determined. “Of course not. I just hate myself for taking revenge too late.”","Feng Xun smiled bitterly. “You could have waited until you’re stronger.”","Feng Wu said, “I did what I wanted. At that time, I heard a voice in my head telling me that it was time to destroy Zuo Qingluan. If I delayed, something might happen, so I did it.” Feng Xun smiled bitterly.","Feng Wu said, “You know what? I did the right thing.”","Feng Xun asked, “What?”","As she galloped, Feng Wu told Feng Xun, “Do you know why that Matriarch wanted me dead? It’s not because of her pride.”","Feng Xun said, “It’s not?”","Feng Wu said, “I thought I’d humiliated her, which was why she wanted to take revenge. But I suddenly realized something..","Feng Wu turned around and stared at Feng Xun. “It’s not like that.”","Feng Xun asked, “What is it?”","Feng Wu said, “She’s so angry because I ruined her plans. What exactly did I do? It’s all because of Zuo Qingluan.”","Feng Xun still didn’t follow.","Feng Wu said, “Firmament Palace has been trying its best to groom Zuo","Qingluan and gave her everything she wanted. Why should they do that? There’s only one reason, and that’s because she’s useful in a way. I didn’t understand it before, but now, I think that Zuo Qingluan is probably going to be consumed by that Matriarch.”","Feng Xun said, “I almost believed you.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I hope I’m wrong. Otherwise, that Matriarch will really hunt me down.”","Feng Xun said, “The Feng Mansion is too dangerous. Let’s go to Northern Feng Mansion now. At least...’","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m not going anywhere. I’ll just stay in the Feng manor. Don’t worry. I’ll set up a formation around the manor. The defensive formation will be able to hold off a Spiritual Overlord for a while.”","Feng Xun said, “You said that you could only stall them for a while... You’d better come back to Northern Feng Mansion with me, or I won’t be able to answer to the crown prince when he comes back and finds something has happened to you.”","Jun Linyuan... Feng Wu snorted. “It concerns him, how?”","Feng Xun said, “You’re not going to carry the burden yourself, are you? You’re the hunted prey of every cultivator on the continent! Do you know how much you’re worth?!”","Feng Wu said, “I can survive.”","Feng Xun was flustered. “Why are you still so stubborn at a time like this?! I’m so mad at you!”","Feng Xun couldn’t win the argument against Feng Wu, but he couldn’t bring himself to scold her. There was nothing he could do.","Back at the Feng Manor","Feng Wu ran into Feng Sang.","Feng Sang’s face fell when she saw Feng Wu, but in the end, she had no choice but to greet Feng Wu.","“You’re back.”","Feng Wu looked at Feng Sang and said calmly, “You can move out now.”","Feng Sang’s expression changed drastically. “Are you chasing us out?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Sang said, “No!”","Feng Wu said, “That’s my order..”"]},{"number":3491,"title":"Chapter 3491: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else(1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3491: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else(1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Sang glared at Feng Wu. “Do you really want to kick us out?”","Feng Wu said mercilessly, “Yes.”","Feng Sang was so angry that she burst into tears. “We... Our family has already changed. We’ve already discussed it, and we won’t be enemies with you anymore. Why are you still doing this?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Sang said, “Aren’t you going to give us a chance to turn over a new leaf?”","Feng Wu didn’t answer.","It wasn’t that she didn’t want to, but the situation didn’t allow it.","No one knew what those powerhouses would do when they were motivated by the bounty. What if they slaughtered the entire Feng family?","To those people, this was just a matter of snapping their fingers.","“You can leave now,” Feng Wu said calmly. “If you don’t have a place to stay, go to Grand Secretary Fang’s house next door. I’ve already bought it.”","In the end, she still wanted to chase them away...","Feng Sang glared at Feng Wu and ran away with teary eyes.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in resignation. “Why do you have to...”","Feng Wu said, “Come with me.”","Back at Fallen Star Yard, Feng Wu took out a pen and paper and started writing.","Soon, she wrote a full page.","Feng Xun took the paper and found that it was filled with precious herbs such as “Myriad Spirit Ginseng” and “Immortal Ginger Grass”. Before he could say anything, Feng Wu handed him a token.","Feng Xun took it and saw that it was His Majesty’s token.","Feng Wu spoke quickly. “His Majesty promised me that I can take whatever I want as long as they have it in the imperial treasury. Grab everything on the list and bring Master Chu with you. He knows a lot.","“It’s urgent!”","Feng Wu stressed.","Feng Xun knew that this was an emergency, so he nodded. “Alright, I’ll be right back. Wait for me!”","up Lile rellb VVu nau VV11LL.e11, rellb AUM anu cusctppedleu in the blink of an eye.","Feng Wu let out a long breath.","Thankfully, she had Emperor Wu’s treasury to support her. Otherwise, it would have been extremely difficult for her to gather all the herbs she had written down. She might even have to fight for some of them at an auction.","But now, she was the target of everyone. If she wanted to win the medicinal herbs from auctions, it would be difficult.","After Feng Xun ran out, Duan Chaoge ran into Fallen Star Yard.","“Xiao wu! Xiao wu!”","Duan Chaoge couldn’t keep a secret. Something must have happened for her to be in such a hurry.","Sure enough, she ran up to Feng Wu and grabbed her. She sounded like she was about to cry. “Xiao Wu, something bad has happened!”","She cried and stomped her feet angrily.","Feng Wu thought that Duan Chaoge had found out about her high bounty and was about to comfort her, but Duan Chaoge blurted out,","“The crown prince is such a jerk! He’s going to marry someone else!”","What?","Feng Wu looked at Duan Chaoge.","Duan Chaoge said, “I’ve heard about that before. We went in when you saved Bao Er, didn’t we? I asked around, and it turned out that the empress dowager wanted the crown prince to marry Hua Wushuang!","“I didn’t believe it at the time. The crown prince liked you so much, how could he marry someone else?","“But, but... Everyone is talking about it now. They’re all saying that Her Majesty the empress dowager will announce it on Mrs. Hua’s birthday!","“I didn’t believe it at first. I reprimanded the person who spoke, but when I went to the Hua family’s house today, they actually started to make preparations.. They were obviously there to receive the empress dowager!”"]},{"number":3492,"title":"Chapter 3492: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3492: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Xiao Wu, do you think the crown prince is really marrying someone else?”","Duan Chaoge grabbed Feng Wu anxiously.","“Xiao wu? Xiao WII?”","Feng Wu was in a daze, and Duan Chaoge had to call her name several times before she came back to her senses.","“I see,” she replied lightly.","I see. What kind of answer was that?","Before Duan Chaoge could ask, Feng Wu changed the subject. “Help me set up the formation before Feng Xun comes back.”","The formation had only protected Fallen Star Yard before, but Feng Wu had decided to expand it to protect the entire Feng Manor.","Fortunately, there was a mineral vein below, providing her with enough Spirit Stones.","She had gained a lot from this trip to the Peace Grassland, so she was able to arm the entire Feng Manor.","Duan Chaoge had been helping Feng Wu.","Seeing Feng Wu’s calm expression as she set up the formation, Chaoge wanted to say something several times, but she kept them to herself.","Feng Wu was now a Level 9 formation master and inscription master. She was much stronger than before.","Hence, she set it up very quickly.","Nearby, the white fairy was standing on the wall. Her eyes widened when she saw what Feng Wu had done.","“Did you set this up?” She looked at Feng Wu in surprise. Feng Wu looked up at her. “Aren’t you in seclusion?”","The white fairy said, “I sensed danger, so I came out early.”","Seeing Feng Wu raise her eyebrows, the white fairy frowned. “What’s going","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","Duan Chaoge looked at Feng Wu in confusion.","Who was she talking to?","She only saw an extremely faint shadow. Was it a human or a ghost?","At this moment, the white fairy looked into the distance and frowned even more. “There are many more Spiritual Overlords in the imperial capital. Five? Ten? Fifteen? I can already sense fifteen more Spiritual Overlords. Is there a treasure in the imperial capital? But I can’t sense any.”","At the end of her speech, the white fairy looked at Feng Wu in confusion. “Why are you coughing like that? Huh... Are these people here because of you?”","To be honest, the white fairy really didn’t think it was Feng Wu. She had only said it in passing.","However, to her surprise, Feng Wu admitted it, “... Yes.”","The white fairy stared at Feng Wu with a grim face. “They know who you are?”","Feng Wu said, “No.”","The white fairy asked, “Then why are they here for you?”","As she worked, Feng Wu told the white fairy what had happened in Nest.","“The ancient existence of Firmament Palace?” The white fairy seemed to be immersed in an ancient memory. She frowned. “She’s still alive?” Feng Wu’s heart skipped a beat and she asked in a hurry, “Do you know her?”","The white fairy said, “Not really. We’ve only met a few times.”","Feng Wu was overjoyed. It was so much better to have someone who knew about that person because she knew nothing about her.","Feng Wu said, “Is she the most powerful being in the world? She hasn’t fully awakened yet, but a giant phantom hand came down. It was as strong as Jun Linyuan, who’s at the Spirit Saint Stage! He’s almost as strong as Xue Zhibei.” The white fairy said, “I don’t know what level Xue Zhibei is at.”","Feng Wu said, “... Anyway, Jun Linyuan is a lot stronger than when he captured you.”","The white fairy’s face darkened.."]},{"number":3493,"title":"Chapter 3493: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3493: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Wasn’t it Jun Linyuan who had forced her to protect Feng Wu?","At that thought, the white fairy glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu stuck out her tongue at her playfully.","The white fairy gave Feng Wu a strange look. “Aren’t you worried?”","Feng Wu looked at her in confusion. “Why should I be?”","The white fairy said, “A dozen Spiritual Overlords want to kill you. Aren’t you afraid?”","Feng Wu only smiled.","The white fairy said, “That’s right. The crown prince is here to protect you.","What are you afraid of?”","Feng Wu still didn’t say anything.","However, the white fairy smirked. “But why did I hear that the crown prince was marrying someone else?”","Feng Wu was still busy with her work and didn’t even look at the white fairy. The white fairy frowned. “Aren’t you going to respond at all?”","Her man would be snatched away. What was she waiting for? She should be going after that man!","However, Feng Wu didn’t even have much reaction.","The white fairy asked, “What are you thinking? Do you really not like him?” Feng Wu kept quiet.","The white fairy said, “If you behave this way, someone might really steal the crown prince. You have to believe me. Back then, Chu Yunfei and I...”","Feng Wu said, “You were courting him back then, but he wasn’t into you.”","The white fairy was infuriated. She glared at Feng Wu. “Do you have a death wish?”","Only then did Feng Wu realize what she had said. She waved her hand. “I’m sorry. I just...’","She was in a bad mood.","Who said that Feng Wu didn’t care at all?","She was just pretending not to care.","However, she was also annoyed by how much she cared, so she had been suppressing her anger. But the white fairy made her show it.","The white fairy smirked. “You can’t afford to get annoyed right now. Let’s save your life first!”","With that, she turned around and left angrily.","Duan Chaoge gave Feng Wu a strange look.","She could see a black shadow and hear the other party’s voice, but she couldn’t see who was talking.","How strange.","Watching the white fairy leave, Feng Wu patted herself on the head.","She couldn’t be anxious... There must be a way.","Feng Wu was multitasking.","As she set up the formation, she thought of a plan.","Putting Jun Linyuan aside, the most important thing now was to save her own life. There were only over a dozen assassins at the moment, but what about in a few days? What about the other countries? Feng Wu racked her brain.","Soon, she had a preliminary plan, but it was missing a trigger...","Which family should she pick?","Meanwhile, the other families in the imperial capital started moving as well.","Even if their old manors weren’t in the imperial capital, the nine major families still had a lot of properties there, and most of the major members were there as well.","That was the case with the Zuo family.","The Zuo family didn’t know about what happened to Zuo Qingluan yet, but they knew that Feng Wu was wanted by the entire continent.","“Hahaha —","Master Zuo laughed until he was in tears.","That was great!","That was the best news!","Feng Wu was wanted by the entire continent, and one would get a generous reward when one had her head!","The reward would be weapons and martial techniques needed by a peak","Spiritual Overlord and the position of a sacred elder of the Firmament Palace... How attractive!","Take the position of the sacred elder of the Firmament Palace as an example.."]},{"number":3494,"title":"Chapter 3494: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3494: The Crown Prince Is Marrying Someone Else (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was only an honorary position, and one didn’t need to stay in the Firmament Palace. However, one could get paid every year.","In layman’s terms, it was a dividend.","That alone was enough to tempt anyone, not to mention the other two rewards.","!!","Zuo Ming said excitedly, “With that reward, I’ll be able to rise to the Spiritual","Overlord stage. The Zuo family must get it!”","Mrs. Zuo was equally excited. Clenching her fists, she said, “Feng Wu has done so many evil things, and she’s finally going to get what she deserves. After all the people she has offended, she has finally offend the Firmament Palace, and one doesn’t mess with the Firmament Palace.”","An idea struck Mrs. Zuo all of a sudden. “Firmament Palace... Firmament Palace... My dear husband, do you think Qingluan is behind all this? Otherwise, why is Feng Wu on the wanted list?”","Zuo Ming said, “Of course. Qingluan is too smart for Feng Wu to handle.”","Mrs. Zuo couldn’t hide her excitement.","But something else then occurred to her.","“My lord, why do I hear that Her Majesty wants to make the daughter of the","Hua family the crown prince’s wife? Isn’t that position reserved for Qingluan?”","Mrs. Zuo frowned. “How can Her Majesty do that?”","Zuo Ming only smiled. “I’ve talked to my father about it. According to him, it may not be a bad thing.” Mrs. Zuo asked, “Did father say that?”","Zuo Ming said, “Yes.”","Mrs. Zuo was relieved, but she still didn’t like it, so she frowned and asked, “Why? Why isn’t it a bad thing? It’s the worst thing.”","Zuo Ming shook his head. “My lady, you’re so silly. Have you forgotten that","Feng Wu is His Royal Highness’s favorite?”","Mrs. Zuo wouldn’t have it. “His Royal Highness is only interested in her beauty...’","Zuo Ming nodded. “Even if that’s the case, he still likes her.”","Mrs. Zuo didn’t want to talk to him anymore.","Zuo Ming went on. “If you watch carefully, you’ll see how calm His Royal Highness is when he looks at Qingluan. There’s no emotion in his eyes, but the way he looks at Feng Wu... I don’t know what to say.”","Mrs. Zuo said angrily, “I don’t like the sound of that.”","Zuo Ming said, “Do you think I want to tell you that? If you hadn’t been dreaming all the time, I wouldn’t have tried to wake you up either. To be honest, as a man, I’m almost certain that His Royal Highness doesn’t have any feelings for Qingluan!”","Mrs. Zuo punched Zuo Ming in frustration.","Zuo Ming smirked. “Even if we’re divorced today, I still have to say it. But don’t worry. Our daughter will marry the crown prince one day.”","Seeing that Mrs. Zuo was staring at him in bewilderment, Zuo Ming smiled. “But it seems that the 1–1ua family has to go first.”","“Let the Hua family and the crown prince fight it out now. Hua Wushuang and","Feng Wu will fight it out, and Her Majesty and His Majesty will be angry.”","Zuo Ming went on smirking. “...In the end, they’ll realize that Qingluan, who’s such a peaceful girl, is the only one good enough to be the crown prince’s wife!” Zuo Ming’s words were so powerful that Mrs. Zuo almost believed him.","Just then, she suddenly asked, “What do you think Feng Wu did to make the","Firmament Palace put such a high price on her head?”","Zuo Ming said, “How am I supposed to know?”","Mrs. Zuo said, “I don’t care. I’m going to tell everyone. Some clans don’t have Spiritual Overlords, and they don’t know it yet. I need to visit them..”"]},{"number":3495,"title":"Chapter 3495: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3495: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Ming wasn’t a Spiritual Overlord yet, but the Zuo family had more than one Spiritual Overlord, so they had heard about it a long time ago. After Mrs. Zuo left, Zuo Ming sipped his tea and smirked.","“Feng wu... Ha!”","When he talked to the older generation about it earlier, they gave him permission to gather a group of capable cultivators from the old manor in Jingyang Province.","!!","They were all peak Spiritual Kings and Spiritual Overlords.","The first group of five had arrived, and the second group was still on their way.","“Feng Wu, you’ll never survive this!”","Zuo Ming was sure of it. With so many capable cultivators attacking Feng Wu at the same time, of course, Feng Wu had to die.","If he put himself in Feng Wu’s shoes, he would be doomed no matter what.","Mrs. Zuo thought the same as Master Zuo.","Mrs. Zuo hated Feng Wu even more.","Many of the Zuo family’s third generation had died at Feng Wu’s hands. Among her children, Zuo Qingyu was killed by Feng Wu, as was Zuo Qingxian and Zuo Qingliu.","She had five children, and Feng Wu had killed three of them. Zuo Qingluan and Zuo Qingxi were the only ones left.","Zuo Qingxi hadn’t been raised by Mrs. Zuo and had been taken away as soon as he was born. Even Mrs. Zuo didn’t know where he was now.","Zuo Qingluan was their only hope now.","At that thought, Mrs. Zuo hated Feng Wu to the bone and gritted her teeth.","Mrs. Zuo had always been on friendly terms with Mrs. Dugu, so she visited the latter first.","“We’ve also heard that Feng Wu is wanted by the Firmament Palace.” Mrs. Dugu wasn’t the only member of the family.","Empress Dugu was from that family, so Mrs. Dugu was second only to Empress Dugu in her status as the first lady of the empire. Hence, many noble ladies flocked to her.","For instance, Duke Li’s wife and Lord Ye’s wife were both here.","Neither of them had Spiritual Overlords in their families, so they didn’t know the news.","Hearing that, an idea struck Duke Li’s wife. Her family was related to the Feng clan by marriage, and her second son was going to marry the eldest daughter of the Feng clan.","Therefore, she blanched a little when she heard the news, fearing that her family would be implicated.","The tea party was led mainly by Mrs. Zuo and Mrs. Dugu, who chatted the entire time.","Of course, Mrs. Zuo wouldn’t miss such a great opportunity to slander Feng wu.","She said happily, “The old saying is right. Good and evil will always be rewarded. It’s only a matter of time before they come. That brat of the Feng family used to do all sorts of evil things. Now, she’s finally going to get what she deserves! And it’s going to be a great retribution!”","Naturally, everyone here belonged to the same side, so the other ladies didn’t like Feng Wu at all.","“Is Feng Wu going to die?” asked Lady Li.","Mrs. Zuo asked, “Do you have Spiritual Overlords?”","Lady Li shook her head.","Mrs. Zuo said, “Those who want to kill Feng Wu are at least Spiritual Overlords, and she’s wanted by the entire continent. That is to say, the Junwu Empire isn’t the only place where she’ll be hunted. Do you think Feng Wu will survive?”","Lady Li shook her head.","Mrs. Zuo said, “So, Feng Wu has to die. I just feel sorry for her family...”","Lady Ye said, “Lady Xuanji is very pretty. What a pity.”","Mrs. Zuo pursed her lips. “So what if she’s pretty? She’s just a retard..”"]},{"number":3496,"title":"Chapter 3496: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3496: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","All the ladies covered their mouths and laughed. The word “retard” meant their envy of Lady Xuanji’s looks turned into mockery. It was as if that was the only way they could feel better.","“By the way, I heard that Feng Wu’s brother is also very talented. With the help of Grand Secretary Fang, he has been making rapid progress. I think it won’t be long before he rises again and becomes the pillar of the empire.” Lady Ye gave Mrs. Zuo a meaningful look.","Mrs. Zuo didn’t say anything, but she smirked.","Lady Ye knew that the Zuo family had something planned.","That made sense. Since the Zuo family and Feng Wu were archenemies, of course, they would add insult to injury.","An idea struck Lady Ye, and she asked, “If these people want to kill Feng Wu, will the Feng clan be affected?”","Mrs. Zuo smirked. “Anyway, I heard that the Feng clan isn’t going to get away this time.”","That was to say...","Lady Ye glanced at Lady Li and saw that the latter was pricking up her ears. She then asked, “Will their extended family be affected?”","Lady Li nodded and looked solemnly at Mrs. Zuo.","Mrs. Zuo smirked. “It’ll be so chaotic. Who knows if someone will try to take advantage of the situation? Feng Wu only has one head, and all the capable cultivators are already here. They won’t leave empty-handed. Why should they? I don’t know if they’ll be willing to come here for nothing.”","Lady Li immediately paled.","Lady Ye said, “Actually, I’ve been wondering. What did Feng Wu do to make the","Firmament Palace so angry? Moreover, I don’t think Master Yun of the","Firmament Palace can give such a reward.”","Mrs. Zuo glanced at Lady Ye and said in a mysterious tone, “Feng Wu offended","Master Yun’s boss.”","Lady Ye was confused. “Her boss? Who’s that?”","Mrs. Zuo said, “She’s not from our era. That’s all I can tell you.”","Lady Ye was anything but ordinary, and her stomach lurched when she heard that. “Don’t tell me... Oh god, someone from that era is still alive? How dare Feng Wu offend someone like that? If that person really goes berserk, the","Junwu Empire will be wiped out!”","Mrs. Zuo gloated. “You don’t say. I think Feng Wu has really lost her mind.”","“I still have some errands to run at home... I’ll be on my way.” Lady Li couldn’t sit still anymore and ran back home right away.","As soon as Lady Li left, Mrs. Dugu threw a dirty look at Mrs. Zuo. “You’re scaring her on purpose. Her clueless daughter-in-law is going to have a hard time.”","Having achieved her goal, Mrs. Zuo was elated. “I’m not scaring her. I’m only","telling her the truth. As for how she reacts, it’s her business. I missed the part where that’s my problem. Anyway, Qingluan is the most popular member of the Firmament Palace now. As for Feng Wu... the Zuo family will just have to wait and see.”","After that, Mrs. Zuo went back home, looking very pleased.","Mrs. Dugu and Lady Ye looked at each other, and both had twinkling eyes.","If what Mrs. Zuo said was true, the Zuo family would rise even higher.","“Isn’t the empress dowager fond of that girl from the Hua family? Isn’t Mrs. Zuo worried that Zuo Qingluan won’t be able to marry His Royal Highness?”","Lady Ye asked curiously.."]},{"number":3497,"title":"Chapter 3497: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3497: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Dugu smirked. “That’s great. She can always marry the second prince.”","Lady Ye vented her sarcasm inwardly. The crown prince and the second prince were worlds apart. How could they be the same? They couldn’t be more different.","After Mrs. Zuo sent the news to Mrs. Dugu, Lady Ye, and Lady Li, she was sure that they would spread the news among their friends.","“Feng Wu, you’re not only going to die but your reputation will be ruined as well!”","Mrs. Zuo went back home in a great mood. Before she entered the house, she felt something was off.","What was wrong?","Mrs. Zuo went into the backyard and saw that most of it had been destroyed. Zuo Ming was drinking from a wine cask and was very drunk.","“Let me go! I’ll kill every one of the Feng clan!”","Zuo Ming rushed out with a saber over his shoulder, but his servants stopped him.","“What happened?” Mrs. Zuo frowned.","Seeing that Mrs. Zuo was here, Steward Zuo said, “Master was furious when he heard the news. The letter is on the table.”","“Leave us.”","After sending them out, Mrs. Zuo picked up the letter.","It was from the Firmament Palace.","Mrs. Zuo was perplexed. A letter from the Firmament Palace, and it was delivered in such a solemn manner... What was going on?","Mrs. Zuo opened the letter and read it. One look and her knees buckled, and she almost fell to the ground.","It was from Master Yun herself.","The letter was about how Feng Wu had destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood, and no one knew if Zuo Qingluan was still alive. The Firmament Palace was still trying to save her, which was why the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace was so angry that she put a price on Feng Wu’s head.","Mrs. Zuo’s lips trembled. “The True Phoenix Blood... Qingluan’s True Phoenix","Blood!”","She almost fainted.","Zuo Ming rushed over and steadied Mrs. Zuo.","Mrs. Zuo said, “Qingluan has always been a blessed girl, and she’s very proud of her True Phoenix Blood. What should she do now? Will she become a cripple?","“My lord, is this karma? My family destroyed Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood back then, and Feng Wu is taking her revenge now!","“That’s right! Master Yun said that Feng Wu destroyed Qingluan because she had the crown prince and Northern Feng General behind her! The Zuo family won’t let that happen! We must make her pay!”","Zuo Ming nodded. “Naturally! We won’t let her off the hook just like that!","Come, let’s go to the Feng clan and kill Feng Wu!”","After that, Zuo Ming took Mrs. Zuo’s hand and led her away.","Mrs. Zuo, who had been lying on the ground, suddenly calmed down.","“Wait a minute.”","Mrs. Zuo looked at Zuo Ming. “Master Yun said that Feng Wu is supported by the crown prince and Northern Feng General. If we kill her now, we’ll offend those two people.”","Zuo Ming frowned. “My lady, what are you waiting for?”","The more impulsive Zuo Ming was, the calmer Mrs. Zuo became.","“No, we have to be careful with those things. Just think about it. Even God is on our side now! Have you forgotten? Feng Wu is being hunted down by so many people, and it’s not surprising that she’s going dead. Why should we make these two formidable enemies publicly?","“We don’t need to do it openly. All we need to do is to get someone to dress up as a man in black. That way, we’ll be able to get a reward for killing Feng Wu..","That’ll be great!”"]},{"number":3498,"title":"Chapter 3498: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3498: Is Feng Wu Going to Die (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Isn’t that what the Zuo family is going to do all along?” Mrs. Zuo looked at Zuo Ming.","Zuo Ming said, “I’ll go talk to my father, then.”","Zuo Ming went to see Zuo Chengfeng.","Ever since the battle with Jun Linyuan the other day, when Zuo Chengfeng was severely injured, he had been recuperating and hardly ever showed his face. No one knew what he would do this time.","Meanwhile in the Feng clan.","Feng Xun came back from the imperial palace.","He left in a hurry and came back much more relaxed.","“Xiao Wu, I’m back.” Feng Xun quickly ran to Feng Wu’s side.","It was getting late, and Feng Wu was still busy setting up the formation.","A Level-9 formation master was incredible. More than half of the formation had been set up, and she might be able to finish it after staying up late tonight.","Feng Wu was intrigued when she saw Feng Xun. “Why isn’t Xuan Yi with you today?”","Weren’t Feng Xun and Xuan Yi always together?","Feng Xun said, “He went into seclusion and said that he had to become a Spiritual Overlord. That way, he would be able to protect you.”","Feng Wu asked, “What about you?”","Feng Xun scratched his head. “I don’t feel like making a breakthrough yet, so I’ll run errands for you. Plus, I brought you the rest of the Spiritual Overlords in my family.”","All the capable cultivators of Northern Feng Mansion that could be sent to Nest had been sent there by General Feng. The two remaining ones guarding the Northern Feng Mansion were brought here to protect Feng Wu.","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun. Although she didn’t say anything to thank him, she would never forget what he had done for her.","“By the way, I almost forgot about why I’m here,” Feng Xun said to Feng Wu in excitement. “I’ve got all the ingredients you need. Master Chu has picked them himself.","To make sure that nothing went wrong, Feng Wu opened the sacks Feng Xun had carried over and examined each item. “They’re all good stuff. We’re counting on them.”","Feng Xun said, “By the way, I ran into His Majesty on my way there.”","Feng Wu asked, “His Majesty? What did he say?”","Feng Wu put away all the ingredients and asked casually as she went on setting up the formation.","One could only see other people’s characters and attitudes when one was in danger.","Now that she was at her lowest point and was being chased by all the capable cultivators in the world, she finally saw who was genuinely kind to her and who was hypocritical.","From the looks of it, Feng Wu realized that she had made a good choice. She had chosen the right people to trust.","Feng Xun said, “His Majesty said that he had an agreement with the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace, and it wasn’t appropriate for him to help you openly. However, he has dismissed ten capable men from the imperial palace, and they’re no longer his guards. They can work for you now.","“By the way...” Feng Xun lowered his voice. “They’re all Spiritual Overlords.”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","Feng Xun asked, “Aren’t you happy?","Feng Wu said, “I’m happy. His Majesty treats me very well.”","Feng Xun said, “You don’t look very happy.”","Feng Wu ignored him and asked, “Didn’t His Majesty tell you anything else?”","Feng Xun scratched his head. “No...”","Feng Wu said, “If that’s the case, I need to go to court now. What’s wrong with His Majesty? Why doesn’t he have any faith in me? It’ll be such a waste if I don’t take this great opportunity.”","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.. “What are you talking about?”"]},{"number":3499,"title":"Chapter 3499: Encounter (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3499: Encounter (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Had he heard it correctly? Not only wasn’t Feng Wu intimidated by what had happened, but she was also trying to set someone up?","Feng Wu dusted off her hands and turned to Feng Xun. “Come. Let’s go to court. ”","Feng Xun was at a loss and looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","What was the girl doing?","Since he couldn’t figure it out, Feng Xun had to go with Feng Wu.","What he didn’t expect was that instead of going to see His Majesty, Feng Wu went to the vault of the imperial palace.","With Emperor Wu’s token, Feng Wu could go anywhere in the imperial palace.","There were a lot of good stuff in the imperial palace, but after walking around, Feng Wu frowned. “That shouldn’t be the case.”","Feng Xun had been astonished the whole time.","“Not only did you just walk in, you even rested your hands on your waist and looked so disgusted. Feng Wu, you’re incredible.” Feng Xun didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","Feng Wu frowned. “It shouldn’t be the case.”","Feng Xun asked curiously, “What are you looking for?”","Feng Wu said, “It’s an ancient pill recipe that can control one’s mind, but it’s not in the imperial palace. Where can it be found?” Feng Xun asked, “Are there such elixirs?”","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun but didn’t say anything.","Feng Xun asked, “What’s wrong?”","Why did he feel like he was being looked down upon by his sister?","Feng Wu said, “I think I should go to His Majesty.”","Master Gao was surprised to see Feng Wu.","What happened to Feng Wu hadn’t spread among the common folk yet, but some people in the imperial palace didn’t like her, so with their connivance, the news got around.","“Miss Wu, what are you doing here?” Master Gao had always been very nice to Feng wu.","Hence, he went to greet Feng Wu outside the study.","“I want to see His Majesty,” said Feng Wu earnestly.","Seeing the serious look on Feng Wu’s face, Master Gao sighed inwardly and gave Feng Wu a sympathetic look.","She was such a nice girl. How could anyone...","There were things that Master Gao didn’t want to say, but he took the initiative to tell her, “His Majesty is busy in the study. I’ll go report to His Majesty after he’s done. How about that?”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, she heard the sound of someone smashing a cup, as well as an angry voice.","Wasn’t that..","The empress dowager?","As expected, before Feng Wu could dodge, the empress dowager came out with a large group of people.","Granny Gui spotted Feng Wu right away.","The empress dowager, who had been walking angrily, didn’t see Feng Wu, but Granny Gui reminded her on purpose, so she looked up and saw that Feng Wu was standing at the front gate with Master Gao.","Seeing that the empress dowager was still angry, Master Gao felt a headache coming.","Oh no.","He had tried to take Feng Wu to a side hall so that she could avoid the empress dowager, but the empress dowager ran into her right away.","Master Gao had been by Emperor Wu’s side the whole time, and he knew perfectly well that the empress dowager didn’t like Feng Wu. Recently, her dislike had turned into hatred.","As expected, the empress dowager’s eyes glinted coldly when she saw Feng Wu.","“It’s you!”","The empress dowager stopped in front of Feng Wu.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes.. What kind of luck was this? Why did she run into the empress dowager here?"]},{"number":3500,"title":"Chapter 3500: Encounter (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3500: Encounter (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Feng Wu wouldn’t back down when it came to the empress dowager. She had tolerated the old lady before, but now that the empress dowager had made her attitude so clear, why should Feng Wu try to play nice?","Hence, Feng Wu gave the empress dowager an indifferent look and didn’t say anything.","That attitude made the already angry empress dowager even angrier!","“Fine, fine! You have no respect for me anymore, do you? You haven’t even married into the family, and you’re already like this. What will happen if you do?!” The empress dowager snorted.","She raised her voice in anger, so there was no way Emperor Wu couldn’t hear her.","Emperor Wu felt a headache coming on. Why had his mother become so unreasonable? She had just asked him to cancel the engagement between the crown prince and Feng Wu and give Hua Wushuang to the crown prince instead.","Emperor Wu was so angry that his head hurt.","Did she know how outstanding Feng Wu was?! Did she?!","Hearing the empress dowager’s words, Emperor Wu hurried out, fearing that the empress dowager would drive Feng Wu away.","Before Emperor Wu could get close, the empress dowager snapped at Feng Wu, “Kneel!”","Feng Wu looked up, her eyes cold and emotionless.","The empress dowager had gone too far.","The empress dowager glared at Feng Wu. “I told you to kneel. Didn’t you hear me?”","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “Your Majesty, are you making me kneel?","“Are you asking a Semi-divine medicine refiner to kneel before you now?” The empress dowager’s expression froze at Feng Wu’s words!","Feng Wu wasn’t that outstanding in the Junwu Empire in terms of her cultivation level. After all, there were many people above her who were better than her. However, in terms of medical skills, she was almost one of a kind.","A Semi-divine medicine refiner was an honored guest in any country on the continent, but the empress dowager ignored that question on purpose.","“A Semi-divine medicine refiner? When did Miss Feng Wu reach that stage? Do you have any evidence?”","Seeing that the empress dowager was embarrassed, Granny Gui interrupted Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled. “The empress dowager knows best whether I’m a Semi-divine medicine refiner or not. I saved Bao Er, didn’t I, Your Majesty?”","A Supreme Level medicine refiner couldnrt save Bao Er, but Feng Wu had saved her, which proved that she was probably a Semi-divine medicine refiner. Even if she wasn’t, she would be one in the near future.","At that thought, the empress dowager was probably the only one who knew how conflicted she felt.","Rubbing her head, Feng Wu smiled at the empress dowager. “If I remember correctly, I made a bet with you before I saved Bao Er at the crown prince’s residence, didn’t I? The bet was...","The empress dowager flushed!","She glared at Feng Wu, her eyes spitting fire.","Damn her!","The empress dowager had forgotten about the bet on purpose, and she thought that as the empress dowager, she could do whatever she wanted. If she didn’t remember the bet, no one would dare to remind her.","However, she didn’t expect to meet such a tough opponent this time.","Feng Wu hadn’t been like this before, but now, she wouldn’t give in. The more the empress dowager thought about it, the angrier she got.","However, when she looked up, she saw Feng Wu’s half-smile.","Feng Wus said, “I remember the bet back then was that if I saved Bao Er, Your","Majesty would...”"]}]);
